\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -142\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Origenes}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Homiliae in Genesim et Exodum}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Incipiunt capitula libri Genesi \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!)<; dar\u252 \'fcber von Hand des 14. Jh.s: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Hunc librum non ex\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  toto exequitur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  sed tantum aliquas sentencias de quibus capitulis puta nisi 17 sentencias\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  vt infra per capitula patebit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  <; Capitulatio zu Gn (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -73\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Incipit liber omeliarvm Origenis Adamantii in\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Genesim\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 In principio fecit ... (Gn 1,1). Quid est omnium principium nisi dominus noster}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...; sechzehn Homilien zu Gn; (73\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -81\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  XVII\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Incipit explanatio de benedictionibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  patriarcharum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Sciendum primo est, quod in singulis quibusque locis ubi scriptura de duodecim patriarchis commemorat}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Filios patris sui quasi in morali loco posuimus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Explicit liber omeliarum Origenis Adamanti in Genesi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (!)<; Text der 17. Homilie; (81\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r/v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Capitulatio zu Ex; (81\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) unten von Hand des 14. Jh.s (wie 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ): >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Iterum in hoc libro non exequitur \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   omnia capitula Exodi ordinate\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  sed tantum secundum capitulationem hic scripta\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  <  (81\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -142\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Incipit liber Exodi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  <; nach Textende Schreibersubskription: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Ego itaque in dei nomine Immo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  scribsi \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   librum istum non mea dignitate sed dei gratia sed tamen presbyter\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Fratres uos qui\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  legitis in istis uoluminibus et inuenietis ubi opus est ad emendandum non me maledictis sed cum omni diligentia emendetis et pro me indigno\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (korr.) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  et peccatore\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (korr.) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  orare dignemini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Ualete in domino eius temporibus saluet uos Christus pius uester diu\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; von Hand des 10. Jh.s hinzugef\u252 \'fcgt: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Anima ilius \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  requiescat in pace\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; zwischen Textschlu\u223 \'df und Schreibersubskription Besitzvermerk, 10. Jh.: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Iste liber pertinet ad sanctum Emmerammum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 142\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Federproben, 11./12. Jh.; darunter u.a. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Magna apud deum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   [r]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  efulget gratia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  qui huic mundo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  contemptibilis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  fuerit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Nam reuera necesse est ut quem mundus odit diligatur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  a\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  deo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; Isidorus Hispalensis, Sententiae III 16, 3 (CCL 111, S. 244) und \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Emmeramme preces insignis suscipe clemens, quas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (Rest der zweiten Textzeile nicht mehr leserlich); weitere Besitzvermerke von St. Emmeram.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Edition: GCS 29 (1920), ed. W. A. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Baehrens\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 ,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   S. XI f. und 1-279 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs18 (Clm 14315 = Sigle n, in Edition unter C); Text der 17. Homilie in PG 12, Sp. 253-262; . \endash  CPG 1, 1411 und 1414.   \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20    \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24     }

