\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   leer. (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -3\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Prolog: >{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Marcus dei electus< et Petri in baptismate filius}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85; am linken Rand von wohl gleicher Hand, beschnitten [M]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  arcus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   [e]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  uangelista\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   [dei] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  electus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; glossa marg. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Ieronimus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Quatuor sunt qualitates, de quibus sancta euangelia contexuntur}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \endash  (Schlu\u223 \'df 3\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  uerbi dei inchoat in ressu\plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs24 rectione domini \u281 \'eauangelium consumit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; (3\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -70\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Evangelientext glossa marg. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Euangelium bona annuntiatio, quod proprie ad regnum dei}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  quia in\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  certamine habuit eum adiutorem \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (in Mittelspalte); glossa interlin. \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Iesu saluatoris\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Christi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  uncti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  obedientiam signa commitantur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . 
