\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Incipiunt Augustini dicta et ceterorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Inuenimus apud IIII euuangelistas decies commemoratum dominum uisum esse}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   ab hominibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \endash  (150\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Incipit de libro Iohannis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Hieronimus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . [dar\u252 \'fcber von Hand des 14. Jh.s, teilweise getilgt: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  C\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ew\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  s\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Iohannis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  <] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Iohannes apostolus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  quem Iesus amabat pulrimum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (!), \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  filius Zebethei\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ut uenti flatus adire non possit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  et adprehendendum lumen facile ubique circumfertur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; gek\u252 \'fcrzte Autorennamen am Rand.  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  
