\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs24 Incipit omelia de Maria Magdalen\u281 \'ea\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Narrat Iosephus, quod Maria post ascensionem domini saluatoris nostri pro ardente caritate}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs24 ipsiusque corpus sanct\u281 \'ea mulieris exanime\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  steterat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  usque dum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  mirabilia magna pro sanctis meritis eiusdem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  mulieris\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  pre\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [s]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  tante domino nostro Iesu Christo cui gloria in secula seculorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . [am Rand zeitgleicher Vermerk: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Huc vsque scribe\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Hanc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  uero quam Lucas peccatricem mulierem Iohannes Mariam nominat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Illam esse Mariam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  credimus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  de qua Marcus septem demonia eiecta fuisse testatur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; am Rand r\u246 \'f6mische Z\u228 \'e4hlung bis \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  VIII\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Vgl. BHL 5454, 5455}

