\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -184\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Liber Psalmorum et Cantica cum Glossa ordinaria}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Vorspann (Beginn aus Cassiodor, Expositio Psalmorum, Praefatio): {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Prophetia est diuina aspiratio, qu\u281 e euentus rerum uel per dicta uel per facta}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   immobili ueritate pronuntiat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   Multis autem modis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Psalmus uocatur melodia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs24 qu\u281 \'ea \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  tactu digitorum et decem cordarum psalterii de superiori\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  parte procedit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; (2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -170\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Liber Psalmorum (Dreiteilung und Ps 109 hervorgehoben; s. oben): >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Incipit liber ymnorum et soliloqvior\plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs24 um David prophet\u281 \'ea de Christo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < glossa marg. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Primus psalmus bipartitus est de beato uiro}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  eo quod mutabili unitate concordet\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; glossa interlin. \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  non abiit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Cogitatione\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  consensu\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (nachgetragen, dar\u252 \'fcber von erster Hand \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Positus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  cogitatione et consensu\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  addit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  iubilationis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; (170\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -181\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Canticum Isaiae (Is 12), Canticum Ezechiae (Is 38, 10-20), Canticum Annae (I Rg 2, 1-10), Canticum Moysis I (Ex 15, 1-19), Canticum Habacuc (Hab 3, 2-19), Canticum Moysis II (Dt 32, 1-43), Canticum Zachariae (Lc 1, 68-79), Canticum Mariae (Lc 1, 46-55, Magnificat), Canticum Simeonis (Lc 2, 29-32, Nunc dimittis); glossa marg. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Prophetauerat Ysaias quod deus percuteret flumen Egypti}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Ad reuelationem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ut reueletur cecis oculis gentilium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  tunc omnis Israel\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  saluus erit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; glossa interlin. ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  iratus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Per pec\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [c]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  atorem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Ad gloriam fidei\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; (181\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -184\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Symbolum Ps.-Athanasianum (CCL 50a, S. 566 f.) glossa marg. und interlin. nach sog. Stavelot-Kommentar: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Hic beatus Anastasius {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 (!)}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17  liberum arbitrium posuit}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  et si ita non credideris\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  saluus esse non poteris\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; (182\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  una est diuinitas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Hec est una\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  substantia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash  (183\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Qui licet deus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Ideo sicut coniungi uoluit dei filius cum humana\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  natura\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ut ex his duabus substantiis fieret una\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; (184\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) unter Kommentarspalte Zitat aus Ps 8,3, wohl 13. Jh., unter der Zeile Bl. abgeschnitten. 184\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Zitat aus Eph 5, 18 einmal wiederholt, wohl 13. Jh. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Druck: GW 4282 (BSB-Ink B-442) und PL 113, Sp. 841-1080 (Glossa ordinaria zu Cantica vereinzelt an den betreffenden Stellen); Glossa marg. und interlin. zum Symbolum Ps.-Athanasii nach dem Stavelot-Kommentar, A. E. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Burn\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , The Athanasian Creed and its early commentaries. Cambridge 1896 (Texts and studies IV/1), Nachdruck 1967, S. 11-20. \endash   \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Stegm\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 \u252 \'fc\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 ller\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , RB 9, 11808 (Vorspann beginnt 4, glossa marg. 18 usw.), 11801, 1-6 und 8-10; CPPM IIA, 38, 39.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24      }

