\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \endash  278\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24    {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Nicolaus de Lyra}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Postilla (litteralis) super quattuor evangelia }}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  (\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Recommendacio Nicolay de Lyra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Incipit exposicio Nicolay de Lyra super\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Mathei, Marci, Luce, Johannisque ewangelia et primo super ewangelium Mathei\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .<; (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -100\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Postilla super Matthaeum; (9\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Teil der Spalte freigelassen f\u252 \'fcr nicht ausgef\u252 \'fchrte schematische Darstellung der Genealogie Josephs in den voneinander abweichenden Berichten bei Matthaeus und Lukas; (100\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -121\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Postilla super Marcum; (121\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -175\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Postilla super Lucam; (175\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -278\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Postilla super Iohannem; (258\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -259\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) leer ohne Textverlust; (278\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Kolophon}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   abgesetzt: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Anno domini 1387 finitus est iste liber in uigilia Nicolai  per Wolfhardum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . 
