\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -76\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Postilla super Matthaeum; (6\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) schematische Darstellung der Genealogie Josephs in den voneinander abweichenden Berichten bei Matthaeus und Lukas; (76\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -94\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Postilla super Marcum; (94\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Explicit mit Datierung: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Explicit lectura domini Nicolay de Lira super Marcum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  anno xvij\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; (95\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -137\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Postilla super Lucam; (137\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -204\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Postilla super Johannem; (173\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Initium zu Io 10,1: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Amen amen dico vobis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (Io 10,1). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Hic ostenditur, quod doctrina Christi sit viuificativa\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; (203\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -204\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) endet \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  sicut dictum est, quia facta et dicta dei tanta sunt nobis incomprehensibilia propter eorum excellenciam respectu intellectus nostri deo gracias\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; (204\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) abgesetzt: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Explicit lectura super Johannem magistri Nicolai de Lira anno domini m\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   cccc\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   decimo octauo. In vigilia sancti Viti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . Am Rand Lesetermine zu den Evangelienperikopen.
