\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  De natiuitate Melchisedech\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Incipit natiuitas uel uita Melchisedech\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Asar genuit Asap, Asap genuit Melchi. Melchi autem erat gentilis deseruiens idolis}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   et nihil offerebat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Genuit autem filium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  et uocauit nomen eius Melchi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  et genuit filium secundum et uocauit nomen eius Melchisedech\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Uenit\plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs24  autem tempus et c\u281 \'eaperunt querere sacrificium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Sacerdos in aeternum in deo in\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  omni corde et fidem sine macula\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  cui dedit deus doxam et laudem in secula seculorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
