\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (120\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Prolog: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Incipit prologvs\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Sanctum atque perfectum et gloriosum triumphum}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85\~; (120\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -127\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Passio: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Incipit passio sancti Qvintini martyris\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < (am Rand:)\~>\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Pridie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   [kal. nov]< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Igitur in illo tempore sub Maximiano imperatore multi Christiani persecutionem}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Aqua autem fuit tumulus corpus illius annis circiter LV\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; (127\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -129\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Inventio: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Incipit inventio sancti Qvintini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  VIII\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  kal\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ivl\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Expletis his diebus uoluit deus ostendere huic plebe occultatum}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  que ministerio pauperum dispensauit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Sepeliuit autem corpus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  cui est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  gloria et honor laus et imperium in saecula saeculorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Explicit inventio sancti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Qvintini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  <; (129\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -133\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Inventio altera (ex Vita Eligii episcopi Noviomagensis lib. II, 6): >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Incipit inventio sancti Qvintini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  III\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  non\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ianuarii\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < / {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Huic itaque uiro sanctissimo inter cetera uirtutum suarum miracula}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  multimodaque medela diuersis egritudinum in cordis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  eadem inpercipiendo prebuit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Explicit inventio sancti Quitini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (!)<.
