\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  181\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -204\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Michael de Massa}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Tractatus de quattuor virtutibus cardinalibus}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Incipit liber de quatuor virtutibus cardinalibus per exempla gestorum antiquorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  collectus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < Prolog: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Quoniam ut ait Salomon Prouerbia II (20,28): Misericordia et veritas \u8230 \'85 Sunt autem quatuor virtutes cardinales}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   que quemlibet principem glorificant\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85; Textbeginn: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Remota iusticia, quid sunt regna nisi magna latrocinia vt ait Augustinus}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   libro 4\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   De ciuitate dei\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ut ad illam vere felicem vitam et summe iocundam perueniat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Vbi nos perducat qui est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  principium virtutum et ipsarum finis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Cuique sit laus et gloria\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Text ungedruckt; am Anfang \u228 \'e4hnlich Johannes Guallensis, Breviloquium de virtutibus antiquorum principum ac philosophorum (\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Bloomfield\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   4971); gleicher Text in Berlin, SBB-PK, {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 Theol. lat. fol. 638}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , 109\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  -126\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   und Frankfurt/M., UB Joh. Chr. Senckenberg, {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[1].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 Ms. Barth. 62}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , 123\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  -135\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Zumkeller\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Manuskripte, Nr. 699; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Bloomfield\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   5124, 664; Initium des Prologs zu Iohannes Guallensis, Breviloquium, ebd. 5070.}

