\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -105\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24    {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Albertus de Diessen}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Speculum clericorum}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -8\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Kapitelverzeichnis (nicht numeriert, mit Blattangabe): >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Registrum speculi clericorum Alberti de\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Dyessen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 abgesetzt: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Et sic est finis speculi clericorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  deinde secuntur exposiciones\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (?) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  symbolorum apostolorum ecclesie et Athanasii etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Et sic\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  incipiuntur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Corde creditur ad iusticiam ore autem confessio fit ad salutem etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .<; Rest der Seite und 8\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   leer\~; (9\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra-vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Prolog (am oberen Rand rote \u220 \'dcberschrift abgeschnitten): {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Legimus in Exodo quod Moyses fecit labrum eneum de speculis}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   mulierum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 (vgl. Ex 38,8; 30,19-20). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Glosa\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  In ciruitu lab\u255 \'ff supremi circumposita fuerunt specula\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \endash  (9\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Idcirco ego Albertus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  canonicus regularis in Dyezzen licet minimus presens opusculum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  collegi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  quod speculum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  clericorum intytulatum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (!) \u8230 \'85; (9\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -105\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Text: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Incipit speculum clericorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Qvi bene presunt \u8230 \'85 habeantur. Hec sunt verba Pauli in suis epistolis ad Thymotheum capitulo quinto (I Tim 5,17). Commune proverbium dicitur apud omnes}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 (104\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -105\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Queritur utrum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  sompnia sint observanda\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  vt ad extremum valeat animum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   / \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ex aliqua falsitate laqueare\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Explicit stella clericorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  <.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  
