\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (105\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra-va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Prolog: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Exposicio simbolorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Corde creditur \u8230 \'85 (Rm 10,10). De fide katholica tractatum breuem ex diuersis sanctorum patrum dictis colligere volentes}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85; (105\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -131\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) De symbolo apostolorum: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Circa distinccionem fidei sciendum est tres esse differencias symbolorum}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  hoc est vitam eternam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; (131\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -134\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) De symbolo Nicaeno: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Postquam determinatum est de symbolo apostolorum restat}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  nunc videre de symbolo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  sanctorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  vna fides\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  vnum baptisma\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; (134\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -136\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) De symbolo Ps.-Athanasii: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Dicto de duobus symbolis in duabus distinccionibus precedentibus restat}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  nunc videre de\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  exposicione symboli Athanas\u255 \'ff episcopi Allexandrini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ore autem confessio fit ad salutem etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .; Kolophon: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Finitum M\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   [eingef\u252 \'fcgt] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  CCCC\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   decimo festum etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  per me Hainricum Lind\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  er\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Summa XXXVI gr\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ossos\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ), \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  vnde VII gr\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ., \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  vnde V gr\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ., \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  vnde VI gr\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .; Rest der Spalte leer. 137\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r/v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   leer. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Parallele \u220 \'dcberlieferung: Augsburg, UB, Cod. II.1.2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 o\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   32, 115\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  -137\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   (nach \lquote Speculum clericorum\rquote ); Cod. II.1.2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 o\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   136, 185\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  -209\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   (s. oben); Cgm 3897, 87\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  -114\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   (nach \lquote Speculum clericorum\rquote ); Solothurn, Zentralbibl., Cod. S I 213, 160\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  -177\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   (bei \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Stegm\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 \u252 \'fc\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 ller\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , RB 7, 11081, 11082). \endash  Vgl. N. M. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Haring\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Commentaries on the Pseudo-Athanasian creed, in: Mediaeval Studies 34 (1972), S. 208-252, hierzu S. 236 Nr. XIX (nach Vat. Pal. lat. 385, nur erster Teil) und S. 246 Nr. XIII (dritter Teil, Albertus zugewiesen, nach seiner Zweitschrift Clm 5668, 208\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  -211\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , zuvor zweiter Teil 205\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  -208\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 )}

