\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra/b\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Liber figurarum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < Prolog: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Religiosis viris in Christo dilectis studentibus Neapolitani conuentus ordinis fratrum heremitarum sancti Augustini frater Antonius de Ianua eiusdem ordinis salutem in domino. Dilectioni vestre postulata conferens}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85; (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -113\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Text: >De abstinencia< (am Rand) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Figura prima\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  De abstinencia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Castigo corpus meum I Cor}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 . }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 9 }}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 (27). {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Non est animal adeo indomitum}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Vnde qui verus est deus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  idem verus est homo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  dominus noster Ihesus Christus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  qui cum patre\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Amen etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .; (113\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va/b\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Epylogus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Sequitur epylogus totius summe in quo se excusat pro suo posse\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Prolixius quam putarem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Supplicans tamen legencium caritati ut pro me invtili operario apud Christum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  dominum et iudicem nostum humiliter intercedant\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Amen etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Et sic est finis etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .<; Rest der Spalte leer; (69\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) leer ohne Textverlust.
