\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -214\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Bernardus de Montemirato}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Lectura Decretalium Gregorii IX}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Zuschreibung am oberen Rand nachgetragen: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Lectura Petri de Sampsona super quinque\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  libris decretalium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -69\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Liber I: \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Gregorius: Interpretatur vigilans et bene uigilauit}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Non extenditur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ff\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  pro socio vel actiones\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  c\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  morte vnius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; (69\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -129\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb/va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Liber II; (129\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -171\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Liber III; (171\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -183\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Liber IV; (183\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -214\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Liber V: \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  respondeo quod non quia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  indignum et a Romane ecclesie consuetudine alienum etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Finito libro sit laus et gratia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Christo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Explicit lectura magistri Petri de Samp\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  super decretalibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; Rest der Seite leer; (94\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -104\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) h\u228 \'e4ufigere Korrekturen von anderer Hand vor allem an den Lemmata und  Kommentaranf\u228 \'e4ngen zu einzelnen capitula in lib. II, tit. XIII cap. 19\endash tit. XX cap. 28. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Druck: Lectura aurea domini abbatis antiqui super quinque libris decretalium. Argentoratum 1510/11, fol. 2-225}

