\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (215\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Nachtrag am oberen Blattrand: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Scriptum super rubricas Innocent\u255 \'ff 4\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 ij\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; Text: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Cum in multis. Casus est planus, quia per generalem clausulam}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \lquote \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  quidam alii\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \rquote  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ultra III vel quatuor in\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  iudicium trahi non possunt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Aliis defensionibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ut prescriptionibus vel\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  compositionibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (darunter durch Rasur verwischt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  qui scripta\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Explicit opus istud\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; Rest der Seite leer.
