\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Incipit breuis continencia omnium librorum biblie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Ad euidenciam presentis libelli notandum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  quod scripture divine siue libri\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  qui continentur in biblia sunt numero XXXVI\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Et habet\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  capitula XXII\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Explicit breuis continencia siue summarium librorum biblie}

