\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  145\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -208\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Nicolaus de Dinkelspuhel}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 De vitiis et virtutibus (Tractatus octo VI)}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (145\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -197\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )>\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Tractatus de septem vic\u255 \'ffs capitalibus cum virtutibus oppositis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs48\chcbpat17 Homo quidam fecit cenam magnam et misit seruum suum etc. (Lc 14,16-17). Postillam ewangel\u255 \'ff huius require dominica 2a}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24    post penthecosten\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Sequens autem ad idem pertinet ewangelium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Notandum quod ut dicit magister sententiarum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  2\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  dist\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  prima\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Deus a principio hominem ad\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  hoc creauit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ad perfectionem nemo attingere potest\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; (197\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -205\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  De accidia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Post ea que dicta sunt prius de alijs peccatis capitalibus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  qui talia ignorant et cetera\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; (205\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -208ra) De dilectione dei et proximi. Sermo octavus: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  De reconciliacione fraterna\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Sicut quilibet homo compos rationis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  et choeres \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (lies coheres) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  naturalis eius filij domini nostri Ihesu Christi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; abgesetzt >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  1445\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  <; abgesetzt: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Explicit tractatus de septem vic\u255 \'ffs mortalibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  compillatus per reverendum doctorem Nicolaum de Dinckelsp\u252 \'fchel\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Scriptus per me Iohannem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85.\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  olff \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (? Name wegen Rasur nur in Resten erkennbar) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  de Newstat etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Anno domini M\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  CCCC\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   XLV\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   sabbato post festum corporis Christi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; Rest der Seite und 208\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -212\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   bis auf Schriftspiegellinierung leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Druck: Nycholai D\u252 \'fcnckelsp\u252 \'fchel, Tractatus \u8230 \'85 Argentine 1516, fol. 110-146. \endash  Textbestand bei \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Madre\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , S. 192-195 Nr. 2, 8 (148\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ), 9 (150\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ), 10 (150\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20  Inc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   abweichend, anderes \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20  Expl\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ), 11 (152\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ), (155\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  -163\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20  De humilitate\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  < nicht genannt (wie Clm 14229, 200\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  -209\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ), 12 (163\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ), 13 (167\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ), 14 (182\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ), 15 (186\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , anderes \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20  Expl\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ), 16 (188\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ), 17 (195\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , ohne \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20  Inc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ); von den beiden anh\u228 \'e4ngenden Sermones f\u252 \'fchrt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Madre\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   (S. 195 Nr. 2 und 3) das erste Initium (197\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ) nicht auf; ebd. S. 197 diese Handschrift genannt. \endash  Vgl. A. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Madre\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Nikolaus von Dinkelsb\u252 \'fchl, in: \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  VL 6 (1987), Sp. 1048-1059, hierzu Sp. 1054}

