\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \endash  337\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Nicolaus de Dinkelspuhel}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Lectura Mellicensis (Distinctio 1-17)}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (Prolog) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Cum desiderarem vestris caritatibus in aliquo deseruire}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Distinctio 1) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 In prima distinccione Magister tractat de sacramentis in generali}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   propter quod sit questio prima talis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Utrum in quolibet hominum statu fuerint aliqua sacramenta\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... - ... (336\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  et loquitur Magister de diuisione ab ecclesia per scisma aut per heresim uel per excommunicacionem etc.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (336\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Beginn von Distinctio 18: [\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  H\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ic queri solet Si peccatum etc. Postquam Magister determinauit de penitencia et de partibus eius incipit nunc determinare de potestate ministrorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  quibus huius sacramenti dispensacio est commissa et diuiditur in duas partes. In prima de hoc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  // \par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Zus\u228 \'e4tzliche Quaestionen (im Vergleich mit \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Madre\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , s. unten):
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Zu dist. 9: (138\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Septimo queritur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  vtrum sacerdos dare debeat hoc sacramentum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash ... (143\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ex causis ibi tactis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (Parallel\u252 \'fcberlieferung u.a.: Dillingen Studienbibliothek XV 2, 87\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -90\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .- Klosterneuburg CCl 47, 91\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -94\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) ... Zu dist. 12: (194\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Quarto queritur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   vtrum effectus huius sacramenti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  quo ad promocionem in bono sit collacio gracie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash ... (195\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  qui innocenciam non seruant\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  effectum huius sacramenti non consecuntur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .- \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Quinto queritur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   vtrum effectus huius sacramenti quo ad mali remocionem sit remissio peccatorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  sed qui primo et 3\u176 \'b0 modis accedit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  inmortali ut dictum fuit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .- (197\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   Sexto queritur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  vtrum venalia peccata impediant efficaciam huius sacramenti \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ... \endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  impedit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ut non consequitur homo quodam efficaciam sacramenti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .- (201\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Septimo queritur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  vtrum expediat hoc sacramentum frequentare aut eciam cotidie sumere\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  et consulit omnibus diebus dominicis communicare\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .- (203\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Octauo queritur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  vtrum sacerdoti consecranti liceat a communione cessare\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash ... (206\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  nichil enim vacat a misterio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (Parallel\u252 \'fcberlieferung u.a.: Dillingen Studienbibliothek XV 2, 116\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -120\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; Klosterneuburg CCl 47, 122\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -128\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ).
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (336\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -337\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   und Spiegel hinten) \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Capitulatio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (von anderer Hand): >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Distinctio prima quarti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Vtrum in quolibet hominis statu fuerint aliqua sacramenta. Questio I\u176 \'b0.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  vtrum attricio possit fieri contricio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (= d.17.p. I q. 4). 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Vgl\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 . Stegm\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 \u252 \'fc\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 ller\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   RS, 569 (Handschrift erw\u228 \'e4hnt S. 280). \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Madre\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , S. 99-121 (Handschrift erw\u228 \'e4hnt S. 117). \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Ders\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ., Nikolaus von Dinkelsb\u252 \'fchl, in: \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  VL 6 (1987), Sp. 1048-1059, bes. Sp. 1051f. \endash  M. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Niederkorn-Bruck\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 ,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   Die Melker Reform im Spiegel der Visitationen. Wien, M\u252 \'fcnchen 1994, S. 168}

