\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  88\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Exzerpte aus {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Nicolaus de Lyra}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Postilla litteralis in vetus et novum testamentum}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (zu Mt. 21,1-2); Bezug zur vorausgehenden Predigt Nr. 31 (\u252 \'fcber Mt 21,1-15) am Palmsonntag: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Nota\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Quod sequitur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  non pertinet ad sermonem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  sed est receptum ex Nicolao de Lyra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . (1) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Secundum Nicolaum de Lyra Jherusalem erat clausa triplici muro\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (2) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Nota\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Mons Oliueti est prope Ierusalem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (3) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Bethfage est quedam villa parua sita in descensu Montis Oliueti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (4) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Nota secundum Nicolaum de Lyra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  quod Christus non sedit simul super vtrumque\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  sed successiue\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...-... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  populus Iudaicus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  qui laborauerat sub lege\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Ad hoc autem veniebat Christus, vt vtrumque populum subiugaret sibi per fidem katholicam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .- Ed. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Hain\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   10369 u.\u246 \'f6}

