\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Hic queri solet \u8218 \'82Si peccatum etc\rquote . Postquam Magister determinauit de penitencia et de partibus eius}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , incipit nunc determinare de potestate ministrorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash ... (227\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   tunc apparebit Christus, vita nostra, et nos apparebimus cum ipso in gloria, ad quam nos perducat Jhesus Christus ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (228\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   honor et virtus et fortitudo per infinita seculorum secula. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Et tantum de questionibus quarti libri Sententiarum egregij doctoris Nicolay de Dinkelspuel. Finite anno etc. XXXIX\u176 \'b0 quarta feria post Michaelis. Deo gratias. Scriptoris carj vos pigeat memorarj\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  <.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Zus\u228 \'e4tzliche Quaestio zu den bei Madre angegebenen: zu dist. 21: (80\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Secundo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  vtrum confessor de licencia confitentis possit reuelare peccata sibi in confessione detecta\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...-... (81\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ut dictum fierit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (!) (Parallel\u252 \'fcberlieferung u.a.: Dillingen Studienbibliothek, XV 2, 223\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -224\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .- Klosterneuburg CCl 47, 250\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -251\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ).
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Verschiedentlich Platz freigelassen (wohl kein Textverlust) und Bemerkung: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Nullus defectus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  sed vitium scriptoris\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (z.B. 122\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , 145\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , 171\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (228\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -230\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Capitulatio von der Hand P\u246 \'f6tzlingers: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Distinctio decima octaua 4\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 ti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Vtrum jn ecclesia sit clauis, que est potestas sentenciandi in foro penitencie. q.1\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 a\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . ... \endash ...\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   An electi in patria videant penas dampnatorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Et tantum de isto 1449\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  <.- 230\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   leer. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Vgl\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 . Stegm\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 \u252 \'fc\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 ller\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   RS 569 (Hs. erw\u228 \'e4hnt S. 280).- \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Madre\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , S. 99-121 (Handschrift erw\u228 \'e4hnt S. 117). \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Ders\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ., Nikolaus von Dinkelsb\u252 \'fchl, in: \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  VL 6 (1987), Sp. 1048-1059, bes. Sp. 1051f. \endash  M. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Niederkorn-Bruck\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 ,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   Die Melker Reform im Spiegel der Visitationen. Wien, M\u252 \'fcnchen 1994, S. 168.}

