\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  180\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -230\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Mesue Minor}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 De consolatione medicinarum}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Incipit liber de consolacione medicinarum simplicium et solutiuarum, quem fecit Johannes Mesue. In nomine dei misericordis cuius nutu sermo etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 In nomine dei misericordis, cuius nutu sermo recepit graciam et doctrina perfectionem}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Principium verborum Johannis filij Mesue\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (180\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Cap. 1) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Capitulum primum de eleccione medicinarum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  que fit per comprehensionem et iudiciorum earum secundum esse proprium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  <\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Diximus quod medicina laxatiua non est a re complexionali}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash ... (229\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Capitulum 30\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 m\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   et vltimum de elleboro ....\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Elleborus est barba albulgusi et eius due species\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  nam alius albus, alius niger\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...-... (229\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Dosis eius est \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Am Rande erg\u228 \'e4nzt:\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   niger\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   a karact\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  is\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  VI usque ad 3 II uel ad 3.1. Sit laus deo, qui est trinus et vnus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .- Zu den Randbemerkungen s.o.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (229\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -230\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Dazugeh\u246 \'f6rige Synonymaliste: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Alhosor id est species zuccari duri\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...-... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Tharaxacon id est endiuia silvestris\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  Vgl. z.B. Vatikanstadt, BAV, Cod. Pal. lat. 1148, 29\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra/b\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
