\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Oberer Blattrand: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Liber 28 libri seruitoris bulchasim ben ch\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24 *\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  lf ben abes azaim\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (!)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   translatus a Symone Januensi interpretacione Abraham Judei Tordao\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  z\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  i\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (lies: Tortuosiensi).
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Incipit liber Serapionis de aptacione et repressione medicinarum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  <\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ... {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Dixit aggregator huius operis: Postquam ego collegi librum}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   hunc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (Am Rande erg\u228 \'e4nzt:\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   magnum in medicinis compositis quisque \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   liber est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   magni iuuamenti \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ... \endash ...\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (259\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   et auffer salem, qui est in ea cum facilitate et seraa \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (lies: serua). >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Deo gracias\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  <.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (259\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -260\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Register zum vorausgehenden Text: (259\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , oberer Blattrand;wegen Blattzerst\u246 \'f6rung nicht mehr ganz lesbar) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Tabula Seruitor\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  is\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Sera\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  pionis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ]... < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  De ablucione litargiri et adustione eius \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ... \endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Combustio specierum scilicet spogea \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [spuma? vgl. 7\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   oder spongia?]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   marina etc.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Incipit 2\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 us\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   tractatus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < (260\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , oberer Blattrand; wegen Blattzerst\u246 \'f6rung nicht mehr ganz lesbar): \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Incipit 2\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 us\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   tractatus d\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  e\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   me\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   sunt in plantis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (von zweiter Hand) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  et preparacione ipsarum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < (260\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Modus faciendi aloe\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  modus faciendi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (von da ab Hand 2) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  opium et forma extrahendi succum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (Weiterf\u252 \'fchrung 260\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , 2. Blatth\u228 \'e4lfte) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Modus preparandi euforbium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (260\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Modus exhibicionis mirabol\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  anorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ind\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  orum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ... \endash ...\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   Modus assandi semina, qui administrantur in medicinis fluxus ventris etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  Bricht in Register zu Bl. 20 ab.
