\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   leer. (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Incipivnt collationes Cassiani\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Ueteris instrumenti narrat historia sapientissimum Salomonem}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...; Prolog endet: ... \plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs24 eadem obseruanti\u281 \'ea est perfectio etiam in\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  impari facultate\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Explicit Prologus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < (danach in derselben Zeile einige W\u246 \'f6rter durch Rasur getilgt); (2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Uerba Cassiodori de Cassiano\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; Exzerpt aus Cassiodorus, Institutiones c. XXVIIII, 2; (3\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) in zwei Spalten angeordnet: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Ordo librorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  <\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  und\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Capitula libri primi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  <;\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (3\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -84\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Incipit liber primus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  <\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 De institvtis ac regulis monachorvm dictvri unde competentius donante deo}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Explicit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  liber venerabilis Cassiani\plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs24  super institutis c\u281 \'eanobiorum et de octo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  principalibus uiciis luculenter editus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  <.
