\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (193\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -195\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Moris esse prvdentivm solet non solvm ex eis, que recte apprahenderint}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (!) ...; Anfangszeilen aus Beda, Homelia II, 4 Maioris Hebdomadae (CCL 122, S. 207), fortgesetzt mit Anfangsteil von Beda, Homelia II, 3 Dominica in Palmarum (CCL 122, S. 200-202 Zeile 59); Text bricht ab: ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  et glorificandum hominibus esse innotuit. Qui cum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   //; (195\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -198\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Gracias referamus deo patri omnipotenti, fratres dilectissimi, qvi nobis salutem dedit}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Redemptus vero sanguine\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Christi illius est servus eiusque uoluntati obtemperare debet\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Qui cum patet et\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   //; (198\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -201\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Festivitatem dominic[ae] resurreccionis, fratres karissimi, debita laude celebremus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  quia dignum est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Nam quod nunc diximus de spinis et tribulis non de uobis hoc diximus quia meliora de uobis credimus prestante domino nostro Iesu Christo.}

