\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Bischoff\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Wendepunkte, S. 222, 231-236. \endash  M. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Lapidge\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  /R. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Sharpe\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , A bibliography of Celtic-Latin literature 400 \endash  1200. Dublin 1985 (Royal Irish Academy dictionary of medieval latin from Celtic sources. Ancillary publications I), S. 205 Nr. 762. \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Kelly\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Hiberno-Latin biblical commentaries (I),  S. 552 Nr. 15A. \endash The Reference Bible \endash  Das Bibelwerk. Pauca problesmata de enigmatibus ex tomis canonicis. Praefatio et libri de Pentateucho Moysi, ed. G. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 MacGinty.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   Turnhout 2000 (CCCM 173, Scriptores Celtigenae III), S. XV f}

