\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  353\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -354\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Quaestio: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Utrum monachus possit prefici\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ecclesie seculari\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Nec prepositus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Io\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Calderini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; Rest der Seite leer.
