\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 354\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Nachtrag zu X 1.6: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Quomodo quis petere debeat eleccionem alicuius infirmare propter quod notandum est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  quod plures sunt modi in quibus quis potest petere ut eleccionem alicuius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  irritetur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Item si eligatur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  qui alias fuit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  repulsus vitio persone et durante vitio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Scilicet c\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \lquote \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Super eo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \rquote \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (X 1.6.12); 354\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   leer}

