\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -116\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Epistulae Pauli cum glossis}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   leer bis auf Federproben und einem kurzen Eintrag, 11. Jh. (bei \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Steinmeyer/Sievers\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   4, S. 538 Nr. 383); 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Miniatur (unten beschnitten): Steinigung des hl. Stephanus, Paulus stehend auf Kleidern der Schergen; links oberhalb des Bildes \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  S\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   in brauner Tinte (Act 7, 57); (2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -3\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Prolog: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Incipit praefatio in epistolis Pauli apostoli\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Feliciter amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Primum quaeritur quare post euangelia}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85; (3\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -24\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Ad Romanos: (3\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -5\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Incipit Argumentum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Romani ex Iudaeis gentibusque crediderant}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85; (5\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Paulus apostolus XXV\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  anno post passionem domini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  sepultus est uia Hortensi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; (5\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -6\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Capitulatio; (6\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -7\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Incipit argumentum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < / \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Romani sunt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  partis Italiae\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Hi praeuenti a falsis apostolis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  scribens eis ab Athenis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Explicit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  argumentum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  <; daran anschlie\u223 \'dfend Miniatur: Paulus auf dem Weg nach Damaskus (Act 9, 3-8); 7\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Miniatur: Paulus (mit Nameninschrift in Nimbus) predigend (Act 9, 20-21); (2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -4\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , 8\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -24\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Marginal- und Interlinearglossen des Marianus von Regensburg weitgehend nach Haimo Autissiodorensis, In epistolam ad Romanos; (25\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -43\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Ad Corinthios I; (26\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Corinthii sunt Achiui\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (! dar\u252 \'fcber \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Greci\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Et hi similiter\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  scribens eis ab Epheso per Timotheum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (als Randglosse: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Corinthus metropolis ciuitas Achaie perhibetur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85); (43\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -56\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Ad Corinthios II; (45\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Post actam \plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs24 p\u281 \'eanitentiam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  consolatoriam epistolam scribit eis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  contristatos eos quidem sed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  emendatos ostendit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; (56\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -64\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Ad Galatas; (56\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Galathae sunt Greci\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Hi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  uerbum ueritatis primum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85; (58\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) nach Capitulatio erste Strophe neumiert von AH 19, S. 119 f. Nr. 192 (11. Jh.?): \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Celi ciues o plaudite \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85; (64\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -71\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Ad Ephesios; (64\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Ephesi sunt Asiani\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Hi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (\u252 \'fcbergeschrieben) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  accepto uerbo ueritatis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  per Titicum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  diaconum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . (sp\u228 \'e4ter interlinear und am Rand hinzugef\u252 \'fcgt: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Sciendum est sane quia hec epistola\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ad Laudicenos\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  attitulant\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ); (71\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -76\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Ad Philippenses; (71\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Philippenses sunt Macedones\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Hi accepto uerbo ueritatis perstiterunt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...; (76\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -81\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Ad Thessalonicenses I; (76\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Thessalonicenses sunt Macedones\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  In Christo Iesu qui accepto uerbo ueritatis perstiterunt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...; (81\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -83\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Ad Thessalonicenses II; (81\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Ad Thesalonicenses secundam scribit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  apostolus et notum facit eis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...; (83\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -88\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Ad Colossenses; (83\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r/v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Colosenses et\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  hi sicut Laodicenses sunt Asiani\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...; (88\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -89\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Ad Laodicenses (apokryph); (89\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -94\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Ad Timotheum I; (89\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Timotheum instruit et docet de ordinatione\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (sp\u228 \'e4ter hinzugef\u252 \'fcgt: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Scribens de Laodicia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ); (94\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -99\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Ad Timotheum II; (94\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Item\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Timotheo scribit de exhortatione martyrii\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Scribit ei ab urbe Roma\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; (99\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -101\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Ad Titum; (99\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Titum commonefacit et instruit de constitutione presbyterii\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Scribit a\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Nicopoli\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (zu \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Necapoli\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   korr.); (101\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -102\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Ad Philemonem; (101\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Philemoni familiares litteras facit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85; (102\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -116\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Ad Hebraeos; (103\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  In primis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  dicendum est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  cur apostolus Paulus in hac epistola scribendo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85; zwei Kapitelindices zu II Cor, Gal und Eph. 
