\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (161\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra/b\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Capitulatio; (161\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -167\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Tabula divisionum membrorum; (167\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -168\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Prolog: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Incipit liber qui uocatur via uel dieta salutis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Hec est uia \u8230 \'85 (Is 30, 21). Magnam misericordiam facit qui erranti uiam ostendit}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  et primo in generali et postea in speciali\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  et c\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .; (168\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -241\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Text: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  De peccato in communi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Capitulum primum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Primo ergo nota de peccato in communi}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  et participes efficiat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   [korr. aus \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  efficias\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ductor illius choree Ihesus virginis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  filius cui cum deo patre\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  
