\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -4\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100gi/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Medibardus (Megiwardus)}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Carmen de vita et miraculis Walburgis abbatissae Heidenheimensis (unvollst\u228 \'e4ndig)}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Beginn in liber II, wegen Lagenverlust: // \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  paruam requiem sumpturi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   / \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  insternunt se gramini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  cuius regnum gloriosum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   / \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  nullum habet terminum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Collectis signis svnt septem septvaginta\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Consecrat hvnc nvmervm qvi spiritus est operatvs\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  
