\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  5\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -37\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Hugeburc Heidenheimensis}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Vita Willibaldi episcopi Eichstetensis et Vita Wunibaldi (Wynnebaldi) abbatis Heidenheimensis}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (5\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -6\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Incipit prohemivm de vita et itinere sancti Will\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .< [dar\u252 \'fcber ein Vermerk des 16. Jh.s zur Identit\u228 \'e4t der anonymen Verfasserin] {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs24\chcbpat17 Uenerandis immoque in Christo carissimis omnibus sacerdotalis inful\u281 \'ea}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  laudemus nos liberantem dona tribuentem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  dominum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; (7\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -24\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Primvm igitvr venerabilis svmmique dei sacerdotis atque pontificis primordium}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  quia secundum apostolum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  qui gloriatur in domino glorietur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Explicit vita sancti Willibaldi episcopi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < (24\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -37\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Incipit vita sancti Wnnebaldi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  abbatis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Originem vitae exordivmque uirtvtvm beati Wnnebaldi Christi confessoris atque abbatis ordinare}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  t\plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs24 um ille l\u281 \'eatus et hilaris deum laudabat et gaudens pergebat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  qui tristis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ueniebat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . 
