\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (125\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Esidorus ex libro sententiarum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Amanda est< pulchritudo castitatis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... Isidorus, Sententiae II, 40,5 (CCL 111, S. 177); >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Ambrosius ex libro ad uirginibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < Ambrosius Mediolanensis, De virginibus II, 2,17 (PL 16, Sp. 211); >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  In collationibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  patrum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < zweiter Satz vgl. Johannes Cassianus, De institutis coenobiorum lib. 6 c. 6 (CSEL 17, S. 118); >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Sanctus Gregorius ex\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  libro pastorali\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < zu Beginn Gregorius Magnus, Regula pastoralis, pars 3 c. 19 (PL 77, Sp. 81); (126\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Beatus Augustinus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < vgl. Ps.-Augustinus, Sermo: Quantum valet ieiunium (PL 47, Sp. 1143); >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Eff. ad mon\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .< (Ephraem Syrus) vgl. Admonitio s. Basilii ad filium spiritualem c. 9 (P. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Lehmann\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Die Admonitio S. Basilii ad filium spiritualem, Sitzungsberichte der Bayerischen Akademie der Wissenschaften, Philos.-hist. Kl. Jg. 1955 H. 7, S. 46); >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  De diuitibus Salomonis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < Sir 13, 30; >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  In proverbiis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < Prv 11, 4; >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Augustinus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  <, zu Beginn vgl. Ps.-Hieronymus, Breviarium in Psalmos, zu Ps 36  (PL 26, Sp. 937); (126\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Ex libro Iuliani P\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [o]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  merii\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < Julianus Pomerius, De vita contemplativa lib. II c. 13 (PL 59, Sp. 457); >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  In omelia euangelii\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < Gregorius Magnus, Homiliae in Evangelia XX, 3, XXX, 5 (CCL 141, S. 155, 261); >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Appolonius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < zu Beginn vgl. Apponius, In Canticum canticorum expositio lib. VIII, 71 (CCL 19, S. 213); (127\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  De fornicatione\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Amprosius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < vgl. Cassiodorus, Expositio s. Pauli epistulae ad Romanos ... (PL 68, Sp. 420; vgl. CPL 902); >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Cyprianus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  <; >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Eidem a virgin\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .< vgl. Novatianus, De bono pudicitiae XI, 2, 3 (CCL 4, S. 123); >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Item Augustinus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < vgl. Caesarii Arelatensis Sermo XLI, 1 (CCL 103, S. 180; CPPM IA, 1078); >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Syxti episcopi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  <; (127\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r/v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  De\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  amicitia uera\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < Prv 17, 17; Sir 6, 14; (127\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  In proverbia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < Prv 3, 28 f.; 18, 24; >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  In proverbia Salomon\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < Prv 18, 19; 12, 26; Sir 6, 5; Prv 27, 9 f.; Sir 9, 15, 14; (127\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -128\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Ex libro ecclesiastes\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < Zitate aus Ecl}

