\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  VI\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -172\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Thomas Ebendorfer de Haselbach}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Sermones de evangeliis de tempore (pars aestivalis)}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (VI\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Inhaltsverzeichnis zum gesamten Band: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  In isto libro continentur sermones egreg\u255 \'ff\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  doctoris magistri Thome de Haselpach super ewangelia dominicalia scilicet a festo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  pentecostes usque ad adventum domini cum aliquibus sermonibus de festis sanctorum scilicet\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Marie Magdalene\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Jacobi apostoli maioris\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Petri et Pauli apostolorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Stephani\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  prothomartyris\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  assumptionis Marie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Augustini episcopi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  nativitatis Marie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  omnium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  sanctorum et pro fidelibus defunctis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Item invenies multa bona de decimis XI\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 a\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  dominica in 2\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   sermone\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Similiter etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  invenies de decimis dominica XXIII\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 a\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   in duobus sermonibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .< \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Item in\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   [wohl getilgt] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  de sancto Jacobo et de sancto Christofero invenies etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  dominica\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  8\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 ua\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  post 8\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 uam \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  penthecostes uel C 11\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Dominica prima post festum sancte trinitatis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Homo quidam erat diues \u8230 \'85 (Lc 16, 19). Plures cause sunt quare quilibet christianus de preciosis vestibus et ornatu exteriori non debet gloriari}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85; TEEVAE 010; (4\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) 011; (9\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) 012; (12\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) 013 (anderer Schlu\u223 \'df); (15\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) 015; (20\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) 016 (anderer Schlu\u223 \'df); (23\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) 018; (28\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) 021; (34\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) 022; (39\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) 023; (42\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) 024; (47\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) 025 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  De eodem 1431\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (anderer Schlu\u223 \'df); (51\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) 026; (57\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) 028; (62\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) 030 (anderer Schlu\u223 \'df); (67\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) 031; (70\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) 032; (76\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) 034 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Dominica XIII\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 a\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   m\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  T\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Ha\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  in propria forma etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  anno 1430\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; (79\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) 035 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Sermo eiusdem dominice 13 magistri Thome H\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  1431\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; (82\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) 036 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Dominica XIIII post trinitatis m\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Th\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Ha\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  1428\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (anderer Schlu\u223 \'df); (86\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) 037 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  m\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Th\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  1430\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; (89\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) 038 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Dominica XV\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 a\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   post trinitatis magistri Thome 1428\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; (93\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) 040 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Sequitur alter sermo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  de eadem dominica XV\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 a\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   m\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Th\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . [zweimal] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  H\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  1430\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; (97\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) 039; (102\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) 041; (110\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) 042 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Dominica XVII\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 a\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   m\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  T\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  H\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  1430\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; (116\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) 043 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Dominica XVIII\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 a\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   M\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  T\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  H\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . (anderer Schlu\u223 \'df); (122\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) 045 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Aliter sermo de eadem dominica XIII\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 a\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   m\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  T\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  H\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  1430\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; (127\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb/va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) 047 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Dominica XIX\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 a\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   post trinitatis m\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Tho\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  H\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .; (132\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) 046; (136\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) 049 (anderer Schlu\u223 \'df); (140\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) 048 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Eadem dominica XX\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 a\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   post trinitatis m\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Th\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .; (144\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) 050; (148\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) 051; (153\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra/b\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) 052; (157\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) 053; (160\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) 054; (165\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) 055; (168\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) 056.       
