\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (Kopfzeile) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Paulus Burgensis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; (37\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -38\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Prolog: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Scrutamini scripturas \u8230 \'85 (Io 5,39). Christus volens Iudeos instruere}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   circa ipsius cognitionem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  retribucio multa. Quam nobis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  concedat Christus dei filius etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .; (38\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -145\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Pars I; (38\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Capitulatio zu distinctio 1 (auch den folgenden distinctiones 2-9 vorangestellt); Text: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Capitulum primum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Capitulum primum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Saulus ad Paulum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 O ad (?) Paule audiui quod magister tuus dum uiueret dicebat magistris nostris}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   scrutamini scripturas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  implenda\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  deo duce procedamus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; (145\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -214\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va/b\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Pars II >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Secunda pars huius de scru\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [ti]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  nio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  scripturarum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  <; (145\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -146\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Capitulatio zu distinctio 1 (auch den folgenden distinctiones 2-6 vorangestellt); Text: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Capitulum primum in quo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ponuntur ad\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (lies a) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  discipulo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ad infidelium confutacionem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Discipulus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Firmiter credens ea que per te michi tradita sunt}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   circa deitatem Christi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  veritas est sine fallacia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  bonitas sine malicia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  felicitas sine miseria\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  cui honor\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . / \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Et sic est finis huius tractatus qui\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  intitulatur liber dyalogorum de scrutinio scripturarum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; abgesetzt: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Quo finito laus et gloria sit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Christo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; Rest der Spalte leer; (bis 167\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) in Kopfzeile der Rectoseiten (ab 43\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) meist Z\u228 \'e4hlung der distinctio angegeben (ab 140\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  d\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   statt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  10\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ).
