\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  CCCM 26 (1974), S. XXIX-XXXI. \endash  Honorius Augustodunensis. Imago mundi, ed. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Flint \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  (wie unten), S. 27. \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Klemm\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Hss. 13. Jh., S. 58 f. Nr. 36}

