\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  17\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -112\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100gi/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Gaufridus Babion}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   et alii: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Sermones de tempore et de diversis}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (17\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -17\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Ivo Carnotensis: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Sermo in aduentu domini ad populum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Qvoniam presentivm\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  obseruatione dierum utrumque Christi aduentum celebramus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  sic tamen quasi per ignem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (I Cor 3, 15) (PL 171, Sp. 567 f. Sermo VII); (17\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -18\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Zusatz: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  In ipsa enim resurrectione ignis consurget aerem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs24 ut per actum cursum celest\u281 \'ea\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (!)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   accipiatis premium et regnetis cum eo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  imperpetuum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (!). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Quod ipse prestare\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  d\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ignetur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ); 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (18\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -19\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Emmo, Liber de qualitate caelestis patriae ex sanctorum patrum opusculis excerptus, lib. I c. 1: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Sermo de futura vita\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  In omnibus uiis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 (Sir 7, 40; am Rand, 15. Jh. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Ecclesiasticus 7\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ca\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [pitu]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  l\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [o]). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Resistite autem diabolo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 (Iac 4, 7) \plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs24 et sic possidebitis uitam \u281 \'eaternam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  De futura enim uita plus credendum est quam scribitur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  mereamus ascendere\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  eo donante qui uiuit et regnat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (PL 118, Sp. 875-879; vgl. Clavis Auctores Galliae I, S. 352 f. Emmo 1); 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (19\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -20\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Gaufridus Babion: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Sermo in aduentu domini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Dicite pusillanimes confortamini \u8230 \'85 (Is 35, 4-6; in D-Initiale von sp\u228 \'e4terer Hand Esaie XXXV eingeschrieben). Ante aduentum domini, fratres karissimi, in tanta caligine totum genus hominum uoluebatur}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 (PL 171, Sp. 343-347 Nr. I; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Rep. 2, S. 151 Nr. 1); 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (20\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -21\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Item in aduentu\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Scitis ut ait apostolus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  fratres karissimi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  gratiam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (II Cor 8, 9). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Quam magna multitudo dulcedinis domini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  quam reseruauit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  timentibus se\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  super uno peccatore et cetera\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (Lc 15, 7). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Seruite domino qui uiuit et\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  regnat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (wie Kremsm\u252 \'fcnster, CC 14, 117\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r/v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ); 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (21\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -24\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Gaufridus Babion: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  In die sancto\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  natiuitatis domini ad populum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Apparvit benignitas et humanitas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 (Tit 3, 4-5). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Adquisierat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  sibi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  fratres karissimi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs24 genus humanum astucia diabolic\u281 \'ea fraudis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85\~; (23\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Item alius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Sanctam et uenerabilem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  gloriosam ac singularem sollempnitatem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  hoc est natiuitatem domini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 (PL 171, Sp. 390-394 Nr. XI, 388-390 Nr. X; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Rep. 2, S. 151 Nr. 3, 2); 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (24\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -25\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Sermones in nativitate domini: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Item alius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Exortvm est in tenebris\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 (Ps 111, 4). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Conscius secretorum dei \plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs24 et inexplicabilis grati\u281 \'ea eius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...; (24\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Item de illvminatione\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < / \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Dies\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  sanctificatvs illuxit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 (\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Schlager\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Alleluia-Melodien I, S. 117 f. mit 562, ThK 23). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Vere est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  iste dies sanctificatus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  quia hodie illuxit nobis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  et nos ipsos de innumerabilibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  peccatis nostris excusando\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Rep. 8, S. 709 Nr. 41, 43); 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (25\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -28\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Gaufridus Babion: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  De sancto Stephano protom\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .< \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Diligite inimicos uestros\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 (Mt 5, 44, 45). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Dominus ac redemptor noster\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  fratres karissimi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  uenerat in mundum peccatores saluos facere \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85; (26\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Sancto Iohanne evangelista\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Wvlpes foueas habent\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 (Mt 8, 20). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  De impietate\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  hominum \plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs24 dominus ac redemptor noster, fratres karissimi, qu\u281 \'earimoniam facit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 (PL 171, Sp. 720-723 Nr. LXXIX, 728-731 Nr. LXXXI; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Rep. 2, S. 151 Nr. 4, 5); (28\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -29\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Ivo Carnotensis: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Circumcisio domini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Natalis domini diem hodie celebramus octauum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  in qu\plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs24 o puer Iesus a parentibus carnis su\u281 \'ea\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs24 \u281 \'eaternam in c\u281 \'ealis preparatam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  habeamus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (PL 162, Sp. 571-573 Sermo IX; vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Rep. 5, 715 Nr. 15 zu Wernerus de Sancto Blasio, Deflorationes sanctorum patrum lib. I, PL 157, Sp. 801-804); 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (29\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -29\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Item\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  in circumcisione\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Ubi uenit plenitudo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 (Gal 4, 4-5). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Tempus illud\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  fratres karissimi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  quo Christus incarnatus est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ideo dicitur plenum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  et in iusticia et sanctitate ueritatis uiuere\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  uoluit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; (29\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -30\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  In epiphania domini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Ex persona officii deberem uobis hodie uictum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  spiritualem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  secundum opera illorum nolite facere\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (30\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -32\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Gaufridus Babion: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Item\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Cvm igitvr natus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 (Mt 2, 1-2). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Cum creator omnium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  fratres karissimi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  formam serui\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  pro seruis accipiens\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85; (31\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Sermo in dominicis diebvs\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Cum descendisset Iesus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 (Mt 8, 1-3). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Quando Christus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  fratres karissimi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  uoluit inter homines habitare\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 (PL 171, Sp. 413-419 Nr. XV, XVI; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Rep. 2, S. 151 Nr. 6, 7); (32\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -33\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Ivo Carnotensis: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  In purificatione s\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs24 Mari\u281 \'ea\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < / \plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs24 Consvetvdo \u281 \'eacclesiast\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ica multas ex rebus gestis retinet similitudines\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 (PL 162, Sp. 575-577 Sermo XI); 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (33\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -34\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Item alius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Adorna thalamum suum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 (CAO 1293). \plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs24 Qu\u281 \'ea est ista Syon qu\u281 \'ea thalamum precipitur adornare\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  hostiam uiuam et\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  inmaculatam offeratis deo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Per dominum nostrum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Rep. 8, S. 605 Nr. 96, u.a. diese Handschrift genannt); 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (34\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -35\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Ivo Carnotensis: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  In LXX\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Scientes dilectissimi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  quia quamdiu sumus in hoc mundo peregrinamur a domino\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (II Cor 5, 6), \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  cottidianis lamentis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  oportet\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (PL 162, Sp. 577-579 Sermo XII); 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (35\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -36\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Gaufridus Babion: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  In LX\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Estote\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  imitatores dei\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 (Eph 5, 1-2). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Ammonet nos\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  fratres karissimi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  apostolus, ut sicut filii dei\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  existitis, non a tanto patre\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 (PL 171, Sp. 543-547 Nr. XL; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Rep. 2, 152 Nr. 20); 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (36\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -37\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Sermo abbatis Clareuallensis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Grave iugum super filios Adam a die natiuitatis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  eorum usque in matrem omnium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (vgl. Sir 40, 1; am Rand, 15. Jh. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Ecclesiasticus XXXX\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ca\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [pitu]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  lo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Quamdiu sum filius veteris Adam graue iugum porto\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  esurientium refectio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  perfectorum gloriatio \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (PL 184, Sp. 750B Z. 11-751D Z. 8; s. unten); 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (37\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -37\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  In quinquagesima\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Populus domini et oues\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (Ps 99, 3-4; in P-Initiale von sp\u228 \'e4terer Hand \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Esaie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   ?\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   eingeschrieben). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Duas esse confessiones bonas et deo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  acceptabiles\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  intrabunt per eam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Per dominum nostrum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \~(wie Kremsm\u252 \'fcnster, CC 14, 110\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r/v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Fill\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Kat. Hss. Kremsm\u252 \'fcnster 1, S. 66; vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Schneyer,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Rep. 3, S. 880 Nr. 48, aus dem Jacobus Berengarii zugeschriebenen Vat. lat. 6398, 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -140\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   mit anderem Textschlu\u223 \'df); (37\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -40\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  In qvinqvagesima\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Si\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  quis diligit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 (Io 14, 23-24). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Ecce sermones eius dicentis per Ysaiam in persona patris\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Uinea facta est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 (Is 5, 1-2) \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  In hac autem quadragesima precipue preparate uias\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  domino uenienti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ut digne possitis eum recipere\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Qvi uiuit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (40\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -42\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Gaufridus Babion: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  In capite\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ieivnii\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs24 Avdi Israhel mandata uit\u281 \'ea\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 (Bar 3, 9, 11-12). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Ammonet uos dominus noster\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  fratres karissimi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  per Hieremiam prophetam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 (PL 171, Sp. 440-443 Nr. XXII; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Rep. 2, 151 Nr. 9); 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (42\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -43\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  In capite ieiunii\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Experti sancti patres solam esse medicinam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs24 anim\u281 \'ea uulnerat\u281 \'ea peccatis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs24 qu\u281 \'ea non confundit de c\u281 \'ealesti patria certificetur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Rep. 8, S. 710 Nr. 65 aus Clm 15912, diese Handschrift genannt); 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (43\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -51\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Gaufridus Babion: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  In capite ieivnii\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Excutere de puluere\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 (Is 52, 2-3; in E-Initiale von sp\u228 \'e4terer Hand \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Esaie LII\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   eingeschrieben). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Audite\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  fratres karissimi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  quam dulciter\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs24 quam affectuos\u281 \'ea c\u281 \'ealestis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  sponsus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85; (45\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  In dominica Inuocauit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < (am Rand, 15. Jh. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Numeri XII\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Maria soror Moysi peccauit murmurando\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  reuocata est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (vgl. Nm 12). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Vltiones\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  fratres karissimi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ueteris testamenti ad correptiones hominum illius temporis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...; (47\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Item alius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Nolite diligere mundum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (I Io 2, 15-17). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Est quidam specialis inimicus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  qui genus humanum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  excecat \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85; (49\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Sermo et ammonicio ad clericos\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  In omnibus exhibeamus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 (II Cor 6, 4, 6, 7, 3). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Dominus ac redemptor noster\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  fratres karissimi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  per gratiam suam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 (PL 171, Sp. 463-467 Nr. XXVI, 423-427 Nr. XVIII, 467-471 Nr. XVII, 768-772 Nr. XCII; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Rep. 2, S. 151 Nr. 13, 11, 12, S. 153 Nr. 35); 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (51\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -52\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  De decima reddenda\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Iam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  fratres karissimi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  prope sunt dies in quibus messes colligere debetis gratias deo agente\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs24 H\u281 \'eac fratres\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  secundum consuetudinem uestram libenter audite et Christo auxiliante implere studete\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (am Anfang und stellenweise nach Ps.-Augustinus, Sermo de reddendis decimis, CCL 103, S. 143-147, CPPM IA, 1062); 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (52\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -76\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Gaufridus Babion: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  In XL\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 a\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Noli emvlari in malignantibvs\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 (Ps 36, 1-2). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Multi in mundo sunt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  fratres karissimi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  qui cum uideant homines huius seculi florere\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85; (54\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  In\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  palmis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < (darunter, 15. Jh.: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Zacharie nono ca\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [pitu]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  lo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs24 Dicite fili\u281 \'ea Syon\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 (Mt 21, 5). \plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs24 Mandat uobis rex c\u281 \'eali\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  fratres karissimi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  per prophetam Zachariam sui aduentus gaudium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85; (57\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Item in palmis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Dominvs noster Iesus Christus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 (Hbr 13, 12-13). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Satis,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  fratres karissimi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  audistis ordinem redemptionis nostr\plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs24 \u281 \'ea\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85; (58\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Scitote\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  fratres karissimi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  quia uetus homo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 (Rm 6, 6). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Letum nuntium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  karissimi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  affert uobis apostolus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85; (61\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Ecce odor filii\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 (\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  Gn 27, 27-28). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Aggratulatur uobis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  fratres dilectissimi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs24 pater c\u281 \'ealestis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  quia sibi ut\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22   \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; (63\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  In cena domini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Dominus noster Iesus Christus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 (I Cor 11, 23, 26). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Imminente\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  fratres karissimi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  domini passionis articulo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  quando iam pene erat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85; (64\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  In cena domini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Cvm intinxisset\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  dominus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 (Io 13, 27, 30-35). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Satis nouit caritas uestra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  dilectissimi fratres\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  quod tota perfectio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs24 nostr\u281 \'ea \u281 \'eadificationis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; (67\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs24 Item in c\u281 \'eana domini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Sciens Iesus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  quia uenit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 (Io 13, 1). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Vos satis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  fratres\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  dei gratia intelligitis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs24 qu\u281 \'ea uobis a domino precipiuntur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85; (68\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Ad penitentes\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Uenite filii\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  audite me\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (Ps 33, 12). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Audite\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  fratres karissimi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  quam dulci uoce\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  quali affectu reuocat uos\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...; >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Sermo in parasceue\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs24 Popvl\u281 \'ea mevs\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  quid feci\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 (Mi 6, 3-4). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Reduc me in memoriam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 (Is 43, 26-27). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Diu\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  fratres karissimi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  tolerauit nos dominus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  diu distulit penam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85\~; (73\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  In die sancto p\plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs24 asch\u281 \'ea\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Pascha\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  enim pascha nostrum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 (I Cor 5, 7). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Si igitur pascha Christus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  pensandum nobis est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  quid de pascha lex loquitur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85; (75\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  In letania maiore\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Divina scriptura\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  fratres karissimi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  nos\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ad lacrimas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  aliquando ad\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  gaudium invitat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 (PL 171, Sp. 835-839 Nr. CVIII, 485-491 Nr. XXXI, 547-551 Nr. XLI, 841-845 Nr. CX, 481-485 Nr. XXX, 534-538 Nr. XXXVIII, 531-534 Nr. XXXVII, 833-835 Nr. CVII, 534-538 Nr. XXXVIII, 531-534 Nr. XXXVII, 833-835 Nr. CVII, 505-510 Nr. XXXIV, 828-833 Nr. CVI, 564-567 Nr. XLIV, 572-574 Nr. XLVI; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Rep. 2, S. 151 f. Nr. 14, 15, 16, 17, 18, 19, 21, 22, 23, 24, 25, 26); 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (76\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -77\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Augustinus, Sermo de sancto Helia: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Dominus deus noster\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  nolens aliquem perire\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  nostrum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  excolens\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 (CCL 41, S. 161-163 Nr. XI; CPL 284; CPPM IB, 4401; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Rep. 2, S. 152 Nr. 27); 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (77\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -112\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Gaufridus Babion: (77\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  De sancta crvce\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Verbvm crvcis pereuntibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 (I Cor 1, 18). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Fratres karissimi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  quia fidelibus locuturi de misterio crucis sumus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (PL 171, Sp. 683-685 Nr. LXXI; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Rep. 2, S. 152 Nr. 28); (78\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va/b\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  In diebus rogationum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Qvis vestrum habebit amicum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 (Lc 11, 5-9). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Modo sunt dies\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  fratres karissimi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  rogationum et\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  orationum et ideo dignum duximus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85; (80\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  /80\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Item alius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Confitemini alterutrum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  peccata vestra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 (Iac 5, 16). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Si quis autem ex vobis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 (Iac 5, 19-20). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Cum in aliis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  fratres karissimi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  diebus ad confessionem et p\plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs24 \u281 \'eanitentiam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 (PL 171, Sp. 574-580 Nr. XLVII, XLVIII; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Rep. 2, S. 152 f. Nr. 29, 30); (81\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  In ascensione domini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Elevatvs est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  sol \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 (Hab 3, 11). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Hodie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  fratres karissimi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  est ascensionis domini iocunda festivitas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (PL 171, Sp. 580-583 Nr. XLIX; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Rep. 2, S. 153 Nr. 31); (83\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  In die sancto\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  pentecosten\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Verbo domini celi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 (Ps 32, 6). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Fratres karissimi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  scire debetis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs24 qu\u281 \'ea et quanta\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  sit sollempnitas ista et quare\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85; (84\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  /84\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Item alius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Dvm complerentur dies pentecostes\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 (Act 2, 1-3). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Congruum est satis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  fratres karissimi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ut in his diebus conuentum in domo dei\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 (PL 171, Sp. 589-595 Nr. LI, LII; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Rep. 2, S. 153 Nr. 32, 33); (86\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  De sancto\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Iohanne Baptista\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Vbi venit plenitudo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 (Gal 4, 4-5). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Fratres karissimi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  magna dispensatione\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  uoluit deus humanum genus redimere\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 (PL 171, Sp. 656-658 Nr. LXV; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Rep. 2, S. 153 Nr. 34); (87\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Ad monachos a\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  m\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  monitio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Cvm egrederetvr Loth\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (in C-Initiale eingeschrieben, 15. Jh.: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Genesis XIX\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ad eum angeli\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  dicendo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Salua animam tuam \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 (Gn 19, 17, 20, 22). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Nouistis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  fratres karissimi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs24 quia Loth nepos Abrah\u281 \'ea \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  inter\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  pessimos in Sodoma\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 (PL 171, Sp. 880-883 Nr. CXVIII; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Rep. 2, S. 153 Nr. 36); (88\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Legitvr\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  fratres karissimi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  quod Iacob duas uxores habuit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Lyam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  videlicet et Rachel\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 (PL 171, Sp. 888-892 Nr. CXX; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Rep. 2, S. 153 Nr. 38); (90\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  /91\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Ad sanctimoniales\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Omnis gloria eivs\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (Ps 44, 14). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  In hoc uersu prophetico\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs24 fili\u281 \'ea dilectissim\u281 \'ea, domin\u281 \'ea uestr\u281 \'ea gloria describitur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 (PL 171, Sp. 901-905 Nr. CXXIV; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Rep. 2, S. 153 Nr. 40); (92\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Dicit apostolus Paulus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Non est potestas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 (Rm 13, 1-2). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Audite\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  fratres karissimi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  quid apostolus domini uobis clamet\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Non sunt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 (PL 147, 219-223 und PL 171, Sp. 792-796 Nr. XCVIII; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Rep. 2, S. 153 Nr. 41); (94\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va/b\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Ad sacerdotes\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Homo qvidam peregre proficiscens\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (Mt 25, 14-18). \plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs24 H\u281 \'eac parabola\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  fratres karissimi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  dicta a\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  domino discipulis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 (PL 171, Sp. 779-783 Nr. XCV; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Rep. 2, S. 153 Nr. 42); (96\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  /97\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Ad sacerdotes\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Locvtvs est dominus ad Moysen dicens\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Homo de semine Aaron\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (Lv 22, 4), \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Quicumque maculatus fuerit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 (Lv 13, 44-46). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Fratres karissimi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  timeo ne\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs24 quosdam uestrum contaminet h\u281 \'eac lepra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 (PL 171, Sp. 783-786 Nr. XCVI; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Rep. 2, S. 153 Nr. 43); (98\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Item ad sacerdotes\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Locvtvs est dominus ad Moysen dicens\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Sacerdos qui habuerit maculam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 (Lv 21, 17-21). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Ideo quae in veteri lege de sacerdotio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  iubentur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 (PL 147, Sp. 225-227 und PL 171, Sp. 765-768 Nr. XCI; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Rep. 2, S. 154 Nr. 44); (99\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Fecit Moyses labrum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 (Ex 38, 8 und 30, 18). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Huius rei figura\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  o uos\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  sacerdotes\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ad uos pertinet\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  docent quomodo in templo domini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 (PL 171, Sp. 776-779 Nr. XCIV; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Rep. 2, S. 154 Nr. 45 und Rep. 8, S. 21 Nr. 206); (100\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Ue pastoribvs\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  qui dispergunt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (neben U-Initiale, 15. Jh.: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Ieremie vicesimo tercio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )\u8230 \'85 (Ier 23, 1-2). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Audite\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  fratres karissimi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  super uos terribilem sententiam domini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 (PL 147, Sp. 223-225 Sermo II; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Rep. 2, S. 154 Nr. 55); (102\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Devs stetit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 (Ps 81, 1). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Fratres karissimi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  cum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  dominus noster Iesus Christus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  deus ante secula\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  homo in seculo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85  (\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Bonnes\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , wie unten, S. 205-209 app. II; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Rep. 2, S. 154 Nr. 57); (104\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -107\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Dixit dominus per Ieremiam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  prophetam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Preparamini contra Babylonem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 (Ier 50, 14-15). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Vos\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  fratres karissimi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  congregati estis in domo domini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Circuite gregem domini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85, \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ut tandem recipiatis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  co\plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs24 ronam uit\u281 \'ea\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Iuuante domino nostro Iesu Christo, qui cum patre\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 (\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Rep. 2, S. 155 Nr. 58); (107\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Convertimini et agite\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 (Ez 18, 30-32). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Audite\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  fratres karissimi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs24 quant\u281 \'ea\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs24 misericordi\u281 \'ea\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs24 quant\u281 \'ea patienti\u281 \'ea est redemptor noster\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 (\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Rep. 2, S. 155 Nr. 59); (109\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Audite uerbum domini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 (Os 4, 1-2). \plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs24 Ose\u281 \'ea \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  propheta\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  fratres karissimi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  cum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  dominum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  iratum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 (\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Rep. 2, S. 155 Nr. 60); (110\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Filii hominum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  usquequo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 (Ps 4, 3, 8). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Fratres karissimi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  si filii domini estis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  audite patienter correctionem patris\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 (\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Rep. 2, S. 155 Nr. 61); 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (111\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -112\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Augustinus, Sermo XXXIX: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Audivimus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  fratres karissimi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  dominum per prophetam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  dicentem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Ne tardes converti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 (Sir 5, 8-9). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Promisit tibi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  quoniam quo die conuersus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  fueris \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  et orationes deleantur mala preterita\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  et futura bona emant sempiterna\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (CCL 41, S. 489-492; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Rep. 2, S. 157 Nr. 93 nach Paris, BNF lat. 14934 und Rep. 3, S. 878 zu Jacobus Berengarii); am Rand h\u228 \'e4ufiger Nachtr\u228 \'e4ge von etwas sp\u228 \'e4terer Hand in schwarzer Tinte.                                            
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Sanftl\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   I, p. 244-249 und 105. \endash  Vgl\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 . Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Beobachtungen, S. 101 f. sowie die Liste mit den Initien und Drucken der Predigten von Gaufridus Babion bei J. P. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Bonnes\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Un des plus grands pr\u233 \'e9dicateurs du XII\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 e\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   si\u232 \'e8cle: Geoffroy du Loroux, dit Geoffroy Babion, in: Revue B\u233 \'e9n\u233 \'e9dictine 56 (1945/46), S. 174-215, hierzu app. I S. 200-204 (Numerierung wie bei \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ). \endash  \u196 \'c4hnliche Sammlungen mit Predigten, die vor allem Gaufridus zugeschrieben werden, enthalten die aus dem Kloster Pr\u252 \'fcfening \u252 \'fcberlieferten Clm 13099, 117\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  -193\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   (Nordostfrankreich?, 1. H\u228 \'e4lfte 12. Jh.) und Clm 13093, 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  -98\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   (13. Jh.); vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Klemm\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Rom. Hss. 1, S. 58-60 Nr. 85. Zu den beiden Sammlungen vgl. im einzelnen \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Schmitz\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Pr\u252 \'fcfening, S. 163-168 und 175-178. \endash  Zum Bernardus Claraevallensis zugeschriebenen Sermo (36\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ) vgl. H.-M. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Rochais\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Enqu\u234 \'eate sur le sermons divers et les sentences de Saint Bernard, in: Analecta sacri ordinis Cisterciensis XVIII, 3-4 (1962), S. 137-140 (diese Handschrift genannt).}

