\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  188\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -195\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Gerhohus Reichersbergensis}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Epistula et Sermo de assumptione BMV}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (188\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -189\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Gerhohus Reichersbergensis, Epistola ad quasdam sanctimoniales: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Incipit prefacio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  in ser\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [mo]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  nem de assumptione s\plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs24 anct\u281 \'ea Mari\u281 \'ea virginis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Frater Gerhohvs fratrum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Richerspergensium seruus dilectis in Christo sororibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Vigilare et aduentum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  sponsi obseruare\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  quod Ieronimus improbat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  secernatur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Explicit proemivm\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ;
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (189\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -195\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Sermo de assumptione BMV: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Incipit sermo \plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs24 de assumptione sanct\u281 \'ea Mari\u281 \'ea\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Non\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ille quem beatus Ieronimus improbare uidetur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  sed alter post tempora Ieronimi conscriptus et\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  magnorum et antiquorum patrum auctoritatibus fultus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  uidelicet Dyonisii Ariopagite\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Germani Constantinopolitani\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Iuuenalis Ierosolimitani archiepiscopi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Hodierna festiuitas}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs24\chcbpat17 uirginis Mari\u281 \'ea dormitionis toto orbi uenerabilis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs24 orbem terr\u281 \'ea\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   pacifica\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs24 una \u281 \'eacclesias\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs24 fide corrobora et memor bon\u281 \'ea consuetudinis propitiatrix semper nobis esto apud filium tuum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  dominum et saluatorem nostrum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  cui est honor et\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  gloria\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .      
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Edition: Epistola Gerhohi in: Gerhohi praepositi Reichersbergensis opera inedita I, Romae 1955 (Spicilegium Pontificii Athenaei Antoniani 8), app. ed. P. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Classen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , S. 366-376 Nr. 2 (Clm 14348 = Sigle R). \endash  Vgl. D. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Van den Eynde\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , L\rquote \u339 \'9cuvre litt\u233 \'e9raire de G\u233 \'e9roch de Reichersberg, Romae 1957 (Spicilegium Pontificii Athenaei Antoniani 11), S. 245 f. Nr. 83 (zu um 1160); P. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Classen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Gerhoch von Reichersberg. Eine Biographie, Wiesbaden 1960, S. 403 f. Regest Nr. 160 (Clm 14348 = Sigle D). \endash  Sermo de assumptione BMV bei A. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Wenger\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , L\rquote assomption de la T. S. Vierge dans la tradition Byzantine du VI\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 e\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   au X\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 e\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   si\u232 \'e8cle, Paris 1955 (Archives de l\rquote Orient chr\u233 \'e9tien 5), Documents S. 341-362 (nach dem Reichenauer Codex Karlsruhe, Bad. LB perg. 80, gelegentlich abweichend), dazu S. 173-180, 179 zu dieser Handschrift}

