\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  195\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -216\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Honorius Augustodunensis}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Elucidarium}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (195\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va/b\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Incipit prologvs in libro Elvcidarii\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < / \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Sepivs rogatvs a condiscipulis quasdam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  questiunculas enodare\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  sollers subtilitas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; (195\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -203\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Liber I: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Liber\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (am Rand ausgeworfen). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Gloriose magister\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  rogo ut ad quisita \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  mihi respondeas ad honorem dei\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \endash  (202\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Iudam et phariseos inde scandalizando cruciari\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  D\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Quid de pastoribus hec\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  consentientibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ? \u8230 \'85 \endash  (202\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  comedere non uetuerit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Quidam quoque Romani pontifices\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \endash  (203\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra/b\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  intronizari in Corintho metropoli\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  D\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .: \plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs24 Quod est lignum scienti\u281 \'ea boni\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ? \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  quoniam deus spreuit eos\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  D\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Debent tolerari mali\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs24 in c\u281 \'ealo in beati scilicet Abrahe\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  sinu\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  M\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . / >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Explicit liber I\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  <; (203\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -216\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Liber II \endash  III: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Incipit II\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Anima mea exvltat in domino\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  quod, de\plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs24 terso ignoranti\u281 \'ea nubilo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  et uideas bona\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs24 Ierusalem omnibus diebus uit\u281 \'ea tu\u281 \'ea\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Magister\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Explicit liber III\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  <; am Rand h\u228 \'e4ufig rot unterstrichene Autoren- und Quellenangaben ausgeworfen.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Druck/Edition: PL 172, Sp. 1109-1176; Y. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Lef\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 \u232 \'e8\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 vre\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , L\rquote Elucidarium et les Lucidaires, Paris 1954 (Biblioth\u232 \'e8que des \u201 \'c9coles fran\u231 \'e7aises d\rquote Ath\u232 \'e8ne et de Rome 180), app. I, S. 359-477 (ohne diese Handschrift); Handschrift aufgenommen bei H. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 D\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 \u252 \'fc\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 well\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Noch nicht untersuchte Handschriften des \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20  Elucidarium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   von Honorius Augustodunensis, in: Scriptorium 26 (1972), S. 337-342, hierzu S. 341 Nr. \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 +\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  75. \endash  Vgl. V. I. J. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Flint\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , The place and purpose of the works of Honorius Augustodunensis, in: Revue B\u233 \'e9n\u233 \'e9dictine 87 (1977), S. 97-127, hierzu S. 114, 122 (zu Hss. 12. Jh.)}

