\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 }}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Interrogandvm est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  qui primus rogauit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs24 ut anim\u281 \'ea haberent requiem in inferno\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Primus Paulus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  apostolus et\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Michael archangelus quando descenderunt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  dinumerare peiores penas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  inferni\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Fratres nos audientes tanta mala debemus conuerti ad dominum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  deum nostrum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ut regnemus et uiuamus cum eo in secula seculorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Druck: H. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Brandes\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Visio S. Pauli. Ein Beitrag zur Visionsliteratur, Halle 1885, S. 75-80; PL 94, Sp. 501 f. (Homilia C); Text der Handschrift weicht von beiden ab. \endash  BHL 6582; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Stegm\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 \u252 \'fc\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 ller\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , RB 1, 276,3. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24    
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 218\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra/b\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Aufz\u228 \'e4hlungen\~(Lebensstufen und Tugendreihen): \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Versvs\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Comparatio,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  natiuitas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  passio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  mors\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  resurrectio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  gloria\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  regnum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Quatuor sunt uirtutes\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  septima fides uel discretio in bono opere}

