\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (218\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -218\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Nr. 62 De timore domini et avaritia vitanda: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Timor domini expellit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (Sir 1, 27). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Per timorem domini magnas possumus adquirere uirtutes\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  peccatorum multas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Dominus autem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  elegit pauperes in hoc mundo sed diuites in fide\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs24 quibus promisit regnum \u281 \'eaternum atque\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  perducat ipse uos\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; (218\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -219\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Nr. 49 De miseria carnis et falsitate vitae (stark gek\u252 \'fcrzte Form): \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  O vita tantos decepisti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  tantos seduxisti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs24 tantos exc\u281 \'eacasti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  q\plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs24 u\u281 \'ea dum fugis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  nichil es\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  melius quam tu\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  me demergas in infernum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Druck: Sermo 62 in PL 40, Sp. 1345-1347; CPPM IA, 1189. \endash  Sermo 49 vgl. PL 40, Sp. 1332-1334; CPPM IA, 1176; Schlu\u223 \'df \u228 \'e4hnlich Vat. Reg. lat. 58, 75\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  -77\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  ; vgl. A. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Wilmart\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Codices Reginenses latini, t. 1, Citt\u224 \'e0 del Vaticano 1937 (Bibliothecae Apostolicae Vaticanae codices manu scripti recensiti), S. 128}

