\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  219\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -219\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Katechetische Unterweisungen}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  In prima hora formauit Adam et ipsa hora ordinatus est Petrus in ordine apostolorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs24 Hora nona nouem ordines angelorum ordinati sunt in c\u281 \'ealo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Dic\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  frater\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  quando fuerunt apostoli baptizati\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ? \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Responde\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  odium dei\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  affectus seculi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs24 desperatio uit\u281 \'ea etern\u281 \'ea\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 219\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Proverbia Wiponis: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Deo seruire est regnare. Decet regem discere legem}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Audit rex\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Iudicis sententiam oportet\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  sequi clementiam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . 219\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  
