\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (220\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Epistola: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Christianus ad solitarium quendam de ymagine mundi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Honorivs\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  <  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Septiformi spiritv in trina fide\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  illustrato\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85; >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Prologvs de ymagine mundi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Honorivs\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs24 Sapienti\u281 \'ea alumno abdita diligenter in scienti\u281 \'ea\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   scrutanti profundo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85; (220\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -240\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Liber I \endash  III: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Incipit ymago mundi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  De forma mundi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Mvndvs dicitur quasi undique motus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  est enim in perpetuo motu\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  C\u466 onradvs\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  tyrannizabat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Isdem de hinc secundum agit annum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  indictione secunda\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs24 Reliquium sext\u281 \'ea \u281 \'eatatis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  soli deo patet\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; einige Randvermerke, 14. Jh.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 240\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -241\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Anhang: Series pontificum Romanorum (usque ad papam Lucium II).
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Edition: Honorius Augustodunensis. Imago mundi, ed. V. I. J. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Flint\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , in: Archives d\rquote histoire doctrinale et litt\u233 \'e9raire du moyen \u226 \'e2ge 57 (1982), S. 7-153, Text S. 48-151 (diese Handschrift beschrieben, aber nicht zur Edition herangezogen; vgl. S. 27 sowie 8, 17, 20, 36, 41-44). \endash  Vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Flint\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , The place and purpose (wie oben), S. 124 (zu Hss. 12. Jh.)}

