\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -139\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Bernardus Claraevallensis}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24   et alii: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Sermones de tempore}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   leer bis auf Besitzvermerk (s. oben); (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Incipiunt sermones\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Bernhardi Clarevallensis abbatis per circulum anni\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Sermo primus de aduentu domini et de sompno dupplici\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Dominica I\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 a\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < Godefridus Admontensis: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Hora est iam \u8230 \'85 (Rm 13, 11). Sompnus alius bonus, alius malus, quidam corporis, quidam anime}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  nam iustificatus a phariseo descendit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Rep. 2, S 201 Nr. 196); (2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -7\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) In adventu domini 1-3; (7\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -18\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) In vigilia nativitatis 3, 5, 6, 2, 1; (18\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -25\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) In nativitate 2, 3, 4, 1, 5; (25\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -28\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Godefridus Admontensis: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Rep. 2, S. 201 Nr. 197, 198; (28\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -29\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Sermo de diversis 51: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  De eis qui portant Christum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Quid est quod Maria portat Ihesum}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85; (29\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra-va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Sermo de diversis 53; (29\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Sermo de diversis 51 (Anfang); (29\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va/b\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Sententiae, ser. I, 11 (vgl. Bibliographie g\u233 \'e9n\u233 \'e9rale, Bernard Nr. 7479); (29\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  In secunda parte sermonum beati Bernhardi adhvc restant duo sermones de natiuitate\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  domini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Primus sermo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  <: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Multifariam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  secundus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  <: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Non poterit explicari sermone\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; (29\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -33\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) In circumcisione 2, 3; (33\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -37\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Sermo iste Petri Lombardi est non Bernhardi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Item in circumcisione domini de\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  tribus silenciis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  sermo III\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 us\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < Petrus Lombardus, Sermo 7 (vgl. Petri Lombardi Sententiae I, 1, Prolegomena, S. 101* und \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Rep. 4, S. 701 Nr. 6); (37\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -38\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) In circumcisione 1; (38\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va/b\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Sententiae, ser. I, 14, 15 (vgl. Bibliographie g\u233 \'e9n\u233 \'e9rale, Bernard Nr. 6870); (38\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -40\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) In epiphania 3; (40\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -43\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Sermones varii: In epiphania (vgl. Bibliographie g\u233 \'e9n\u233 \'e9rale, Bernard Nr. 8625); (43\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -47\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) In epiphania 1, 2, In octava epiphaniae; (47\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -49\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Post octavam epiphaniae 1; (49\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -49\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Bibliographie g\u233 \'e9n\u233 \'e9rale, Bernard Nr. 12314, 12316, (10711); vgl. auch \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Sanftl\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   I, p. 309 Nr. XXXIII; (50\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -51\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Sermones de diversis 55, 56; (51\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -54\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Post octavam epiphaniae 2; (54\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -55\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) In septuagesima 1; (55\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -62\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) In quadragesima 1, 2, 6, 3, 4; (62\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -64\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Sermo de diversis 22; (64\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\pl