\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  56\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -109\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Gregorius Magnus}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Homiliae in Hiezechihelem prophetam (liber I, I \endash  VIII, 23) }}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  56\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  leer bis auf Federproben und drei kurze, teilweise unleserliche Zeilen, beginnend mit \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Tercia die\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85, 13. Jh. (56\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Liber I, Praefatio: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  In hoc codice continen\plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs24 tur omeli\u281 \'ea\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs24 Gregorii pap\u281 \'ea in Ezechiel proph\u281 \'eatam numero \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  XXII\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs24 dict\u281 \'ea in patriarchio Lateranensi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  in basilica\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs24 qu\u281 \'ea appellatur Aurea\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Dilectissimo fratri Mariniano\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  episcopo Gregorius servus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  servorvm dei\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  <  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Omelias, qv\u281 e in beato Ezechiel propheta, ita ut coram populo}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85; (56\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -109\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Homiliae I \endash  VIII, 23: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Dei omnipotentis asspiratione (!) de Ezechiele proph\u281 eta locoturus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (!) \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  sed tamen angelis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  vt dictum est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  humanitate minoratvs\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   //.    
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  
