\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (107\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -117\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Tropen zu Introitus, Kyrie und Gloria: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Incipiunt tropi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  In natale\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  domini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < Corpus Troporum (= CT) I, S. 107, (108\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) AH 47, Nr. 85 (Sigle A), (109\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Nr. 206 (Sigle A), (109\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Ct I, S. 82, (110\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) AH 47, Nr. 31 (1a, 2a, 3b) (Sigle A), (110\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Nr. 218, (111\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) CT I, S. 186, 210, 178, 186, 118 (111\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r/v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) CT I, S. 169, AH 47, Nr. 184 (Sigle E), (112\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) CT I, S. 132, 141, 184, (112\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) CT I, S. 91, 182, 145, 73, 161, 202, 108, (112\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -113\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  In pv\plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs24 rificatione sancte Mari\u281 \'ea\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Hodie quem ad modvm patriarchis antiquis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85; Corpus Troporum III, S. 162, 127, 132, 75, AH 47, Nr. 183 (Sigle D), (114\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) CT III, S. 99, 73 (114\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Gloria des griechischen Me\u223 \'dfordinariums (s. oben 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r/v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   mit geringf\u252 \'fcgigen Abweichungen); (114\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -115\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  De sancto Iohanne\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  <  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Angelo prenuntiante\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  magnus hodie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 (wie Kremsm\u252 \'fcnster, Stiftsbibl., CC 309, 180r); AH 49, Nr. 215 (Sigle O), >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  In natale sancti Petri\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Divina beatus Petrus ereptus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  clementia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 (wie Kremsm\u252 \'fcnster, Stiftsbibl., CC 309, 180\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ), >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  De sancto Laurentio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Hodie celesti igne\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 (wie Kremsm\u252 \'fcnster, Stiftsbibl., CC 309, 181\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ), RH 7922, 11888, (115\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  De sancto Emmer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ammo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  et\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  sancto Mavricio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Hec est alma dies cunctis ueneranda fidelibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  in qua cum propheta\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 RH 7567 (nach Clm 14845, fol. 102), (116\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) AH 49, Nr. 53, >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  De omnibvs sanctis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Sollemnitatem uenerandam omnium sanctorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 (wie Kremsm\u252 \'fcnster, Stiftsbibl., CC 309, 182\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ), (116\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r/v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  De sancto Martino\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Hodie sanctissimi patroni nostri\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Martini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 vgl. RH 7923, AH 49, Nr. 203 (Sigle A), Nr. 366 (Sigle P), RH 37679, (117\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) AH 49, Nr. 372 (Sigle I; = \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Schaller/K\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 \u246 \'f6\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 nsgen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   16480), Nr. 377 (Sigle B), (117\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Nr. 381 (Sigle A), >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  In dedicatione\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < AH 49, Nr. 23, nach Kyrie \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Uenite filii audite me\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (Ps 33, 12) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  et hanc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  orationis domum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85; (118\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -119\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Tropen zum Sanctus: Corpus Troporum VII, S. 241 (mit  den Verweisen zu den Sanctustropen dieser Handschrift); (119\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r/v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Tropen zum Agnus dei: Corpus Troporum IV, S. 164 (mit den Verweisen zu den Agnus dei-Tropen dieser Handschrift). 120\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r/v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   leer.
