\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Introductio ad introitum: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Gregorivs presul\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  meritis et nomine dignus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Ad te\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  levavi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; AH 49, Nr. 1 (Sigle U); (147\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -156\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Offertoriumstropen: AH 49, Nr. 600 (Sigle B), (147\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Nr. 604, 607, 563, (148\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Nr. 613 und \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 St\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 \u228 \'e4\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 blein\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , S. 238 (nach dieser Handschrift), (148\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) AH 49, Nr. 615 (Sigle E), Nr. 615/4 (= RH 36969), (149\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Nr. 620, \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 St\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 \u228 \'e4\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 blein\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , S. 239 Nr. 9, (149\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 St\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 \u228 \'e4\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 blein\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Nr. 10, 11, AH 49, Nr. 623 (Sigle C), (150\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) St\u228 \'e4blein, Nr. 13, 14 (150\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) 15, 16, (151\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) 17, AH 49, Nr. 625, \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 St\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 \u228 \'e4\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 blein\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Nr. 19, AH 49, Nr. 626, (152\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) 627, \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 St\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 \u228 \'e4\