\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  113\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -172\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Ps.-Hieronymus}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Expositio quattuor evangeliorum}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (113\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -114\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Prolog: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  In nomine dei summi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Incipit expositio euangelii secundum Matheum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[5].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Primis querendum est omnium librorum tempus, locum (!), personam}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (!) ... \endash  ... \plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs24 messias ebraic\u281 \'ea\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  unctus latine\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; (114\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -133\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) In Matthaeum: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Liber generationis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 ... (Mt 1,1). }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Ideo duo}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17  (!) }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 patres}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17  }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 nominat}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash .. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ut non soluisset\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  lege uel uiderent\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  quod sanatus esset a lebra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; (133\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -134\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Iohannis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  librum istum scripsit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Uir integar \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!) \plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs24 incorruptus matrimonia trea testificantur h\u281 \'eac sententia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...;  (134\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -143\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) In Iohannem: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 In principio erat uerbum, in pri[n]cipio, quia omnia in ipso inicantur }}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  siue finiantur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (!) ... \endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ubique sine meatu\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ubi uoluer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [.]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  nt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [Buchstabe fehlt]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   ingredi possunt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; (143\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -156\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) In Matthaeum: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Incipit de centurione\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Kapharnau\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (Mt 5,8) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  uilla pinguidinis siue speciosa. Centurio tenit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  in Galilea\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  in monte\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ostendit de populo Iudeorum ad gentes\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; (144\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -145\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Einschub in Mt: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Item de nomina apostulorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[6].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Symon hoc est oboediens, quia relinquit retiam (!) suam}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  id est commoti de infidelitate ad fidem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   Iudas confessio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ;\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   Scarioth memoria mortis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; (156\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -161\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) In Marcum: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Item secundum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Marcum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Initium euangelii Iesu Christi filii dei, filii dei quod dicit, ostendit natiuitatem secundum diuinitatem}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  non per concubitu\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  generans\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  quia uirgo permansit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   Explicit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; (162\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -171\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) In Lucam: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Item secundum Lucam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Lucas ipse consurgens}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 , }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Sirus nationes}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 (!) }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Antiocensis}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 , }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 arte medicus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  rationabilem celebrum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  concupisciui Legecore \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (?)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   irasciui Lefel \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (?); (171\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -172\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Epistola de sancto Marco\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Item de Marco discipulo Petri apostoli, quia quando Petrus de carcere fugit}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  sed primus episcopus Alexander ipse ibit euangelista eius breuiter in fabolis plenus ad sensum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Deo gratias\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Der sehr fehlerhafte Text k\u246 \'f6nnte auf Verlesungen (schwer entzifferbare, vielleicht insulare Vorlage?) beruhen oder auf eine korrupte Vorlage deuten. \endash  Der Evangelienkommentar liegt in drei Redaktionen vor; vgl. B. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Griesser\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Beitr\u228 \'e4ge zur Textgeschichte der Expositio IV evangeliorum des Ps.-Hieronymus, in: Zeitschrift f\u252 \'fcr katholische Theologie 54 (1930), S. 40-87; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 ders\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ., Die handschriftliche Ueberlieferung der Expositio IV evangeliorum des Ps. Hieronymus, in: Revue B\u233 \'e9n\u233 \'e9dictine 49 (1937), S. 279-321; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Bischoff\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Wendepunkte, S. 240 f.; Lambert IIIB, 470-472; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Kelly\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , A catalogue (II), S. 397-400 Nr. 56 (A,B,C); gedruckt nur Recensio I in PL 30, Sp. 531-590 und PL 114, Sp. 861-916 (zum Vergleich herangezogen; h\u228 \'e4ufig stark abweichend). \endash  Bei \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Lambert\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   (BHM IIIB, 472) ist dieser Text der Recensio III zugeordnet. Dagegen weist ihn A. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Kavanagh\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   in einem Aufsatz der Recensio II zu; vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 dies\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ., The Ps.-Jerome's Expositio IV Euangeliorum, in: The scriptures and early medieval Ireland, ed. by T. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 O'Loughlin\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Steenbrugis, Turnhout 1999 (Instrumenta Patristica 31), S. 125-131, hierzu S. 127, 130}

