\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Incipiunt nomina Hebreorum de ponderibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Minima pars est calcalus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  quod sunt grana\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ciceris duo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  cadus habet sextaria C\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  De mensuris\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Libra una et semis eminae\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  duo gomor\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  quod sunt modia \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  XXX chorum faciunt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
