\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Incipiunt glose de A\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Abauu pater proaui\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  id est auis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  aui\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  abba pater Syrum nomen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  falera ornamenta equorum uel fabulas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; (229\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Glossen mit F schlie\u223 \'dfen unmittelbar an C.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  
