\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  M. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Passalacqua\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , I codici di Prisciano, Roma 1978 (Sussidi eruditi 29), S. 176-178 Nr. 397. \endash  RISM III, Manuscripts from the Carolingian era up to c. 1500 in the Federal Republic of Germany (D-brd), bearb. von M. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Huglo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   und C. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Meyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , M\u252 \'fcnchen 1986, S. 110-113. \endash  M. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Huglo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Notice sur deux nouveaux manuscrits d\rquote Aristote en latin, in: Scriptorium 42 (1988), S. 183-190, hierzu S. 183-188. \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Klemm\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Ott. u. fr\u252 \'fchrom. Hss., S. 36 f. Nr. 12. \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Bergmann/Stricker\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Katalog 3, S. 1106-1108 Nr. 571}

