\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \u220 \'dcber beide Spalten am oberen Rand: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Huius toni modulatio in psalmis sono currit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85; (63\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Fortsetzung am oberen Rand: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Additur a plerisque et\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  quinta\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85; (62\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Erkl\u228 \'e4rung von \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Nonanoeane\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Nona dicitur a greco quod est nus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  uidelicet\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  interiecciones apud nos interpretantur eia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Incipit primvs tropvs qvi Dorivs dicitur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < [neumiert:] {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Nonanoeane. Primvm qverite regnvm dei}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Gloria\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Seculorum amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \endash ... >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  co\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .< \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Responsum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Accepit Simeon\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; (62\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) am linken Blattrand Schema mit Dasia-Notation. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Tonarten und Intonationsformulare bei T. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Bailey\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , The intonation formulas of western chant. Toronto 1974 (Pontifical institute of mediaeval studies. Studies and texts 28), S. 43 ff. (Edition), S. 92 (Clm 14272 = EM1). \endash  Vgl. M. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Huglo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Les tonaires, Paris 1971 (Publications de la soci\u233 \'e9t\u233 \'e9 Fran\u231 \'e7aise de musicologie, 3\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 e\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   s\u233 \'e9rie, tome II),\~S. 62, 67-69, 253, 382; RISM III (s. oben Literatur); R. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Hankeln\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Artikel \u171 \'ab\~Tonar\~\u187 \'bb, in: MGG Sachteil 9 (1998), Sp. 629-637, zu Clm 14272 Sp. 633}

