\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  93\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -128\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Boethius}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Commentaria in Ciceronis Topica}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  93\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Accessus: Schemata zur Logik; (93\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Cicero, Topica 1, 1-5: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Epistola Ciceronis ad Graccvm Trebativm\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Maiores nos res scribere ingressos\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   Gracce\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Trebati\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  et his libris \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ad id quod instituimvs accedere\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Huc respice qui tibi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  istud \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  in brauner Tinte \u252 \'fcbergeschrieben) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  prohemivm sentis deesse\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  <; darunter Zitat aus Boethius, In Porphyrii Isagogen commentorum editio secunda, lib. II c. 3: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Quattuor principia sunt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  in loco ac tempore est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (CSEL 48, S. 174 f.); \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Argumentum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  probatio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  breuis oratio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85; \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Ars est facultas que per instrumentum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85\~; Zitat aus Boethius, De topicis differentiis, lib. I: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Propositio est oratio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  argumenti per orationem explicatio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (PL 64, Sp. 1174); (94\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -128\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Kommentar: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Anicii Severini Boetii vc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  et inl\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ex cons\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ordine\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ad Patricivm in topica Marci Tullii Ciceronis commentariorvm liber primvs incipit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Exhortatione tua}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 , }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Patrici}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 rhetorum peritissime}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 , }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 que et presentis honestate propositi}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ornamenta qu\plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs24 \u281 \'eadam uoluimus non debita accedere\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Finivnt topica\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; gelegentlich Randglossen, einige Male mit logischen Schemata. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0  
