\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Am oberen Rand, 14. Jh.: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  De musica\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -8\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Musica enchiriadis: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs24\chcbpat17 Sicvt uocis articvlat\u281 \'ea \u281 \'ealementari\u281 \'ea atqve individu\u281 \'ea partes sunt litter\u281 \'ea}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs24 Huiusc\u281 \'ea ratiuncul\u281 \'ea \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ponamus hic finem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; (8\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -24\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Incipit scolica enchiriadis de musica\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Musica quid est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \~ \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   dupla proportio et simphoniam seruat tropique retinet modum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Finit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; Schemata, Diagramme und Tabellen in rot mit Beschriftung in normaler Tinte.
