\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 94\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Zitat nach Johannes Scottus, Periphyseon (De divisione naturae), lib. V: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  In natura rerum tria inquirenda sunt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  quod corporale dicitur atque sensibile\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; Rest der Seite leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (94\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -177\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Anicii Manlii Severini Boetii viri clarissimi ex consulum ordinibus editio prima\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  super Kategorias Aristotilis a se verbvm e verbo translatvm e Greco in Latinum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Expeditis his qu\u281 e ad predicamenta Aristotilis Porphirii [korr.] institvtione digesta sunt}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  quod sub\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  se aliquas partes speciesque contineat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Anicii Manlii Severini Boetii uiri clarissimi ex\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  consvlvm ordinibvs aeditio \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   prima svper kategorias Aristotelis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  
