\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Anitii Manlii Severini Boetii viri clarissimi ex consvlvm ordinibvs incipivnt Cathegoriae\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  qvas de Aristotele verbvm ex verbo transtvlit in Latinum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  De equivocis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Eqvivoca dicvntvr qvorvm nomen solvm commune est}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs24 secundum nomen vero substanti\u281 \'ea\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Forte tamen et\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  alii quidam apparebunt modico quod est habendi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   [korr.]; \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  sed qui consueuerunt dici pene omnes enumerati sunt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Explicivnt Cathegoriae\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; unterhalb Vers: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Hic finem tango\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  nec plus sudoris\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  adibo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (Colophons 21819, 21820).
