\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  74\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -121\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Hieronymus}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Commentarius in Ecclesiasten}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Incipit prefatio Hieronimi presbyt\plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs24 eri svper \u280 \'caccl\u281 \'easiasten\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Memini me ante hoc ferme qvinqvennivm}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  opinionum riuulos consectarer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; (74\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -121\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Incipit explanatio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Hieronimi presbyteri in librum \plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs24 \u280 \'cacclesiasten\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs24\chcbpat17 Uerba \u280 \'cacclesiastes filii \u8230 \'85 (Ecl 1, 1). Tribus nominibus uocatum fuisse Salomonem scriptur\u281 \'ea manifestissime docent}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs24 V\u281 \'ea quippe his\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  qui dicunt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 (Is 5, 20). >\plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs24 Explicit expositio libri \u280 \'cacclesiastes\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  <.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Edition: CCL 72 (1959), ed. M. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Adriaen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , S. 249-361, ohne diese Handschrift. \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Lambert\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , BHM II, S. 51 Nr. 205; CPL 583}

