\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  121\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -151\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Ps.-Hieronymus}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Expositio sancti Hieronimi presbiteri in libro Cantici Canticorum (Expositio brevis I)}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Incipit expositio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (Nachtrag: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  S\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Ieronimi presbyteri\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  in librvm\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  qui dicitur Canticvm\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Canticorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < (121\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -132\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Homeliae I \endash  VII: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Ueri amoris, quem magister gentivm Paulus caritatem edocuit}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \endash   (132\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ubi captam deuorent predum et pardi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . (danach fehlt l\u228 \'e4ngerer Textteil aus Homelia VII, VII endet:) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Ita in secret\plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs24 o uerbo c\u281 \'ealesti saturantur Christi amici\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  per presentiam deitatis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; (132\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -140\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Homelia VIII: (135\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -139\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  et cum mulieribus non\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  sunt polluti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . (Textteil aus Homelia VII hier eingef\u252 \'fcgt:) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Sicut sunt montes\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ubi animalia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  simpliciora captantur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Comedite, amici\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  bibite et inebriamini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  carissimi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Per talem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ergo doctrinam crura \plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs24 illius column\u281 \'ea marmore\u281 \'ea\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs24 qu\u281 \'ea fundata est super bases aureas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  facti sunt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Crura igitur tanti corporis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85; Schlu\u223 \'df von VIII: \u8230 \'85 \plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs24 qui asperitatem penitenti\u281 \'ea ignorant\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; (140\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -151\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Homeliae IX \endash  XII: \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  in quo eo facie ad faciem perfruatur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Explicit omelia dvodecima\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  <.          
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Edition: CCL 19 (1986), ed. B. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 de\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Vregille\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   u. L. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Neyrand\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , S. 314-390, ohne diese Handschrift. \endash  CPL 194a}

