\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Incipit de paradyso liber primvs\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Et plantavit dominvs\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  in Eden\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (dar\u252 \'fcber >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  idest\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  voluptatem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  <) \u8230 \'85 (Gn 2, 8). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  De paradyso adoriundus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  sermo non mediocrem estum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \endash  \plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs24 metemus ea qu\u281 \'ea sunt spiritalia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Explicit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   [\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  c\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   mit zus\u228 \'e4tzlichem K\u252 \'fcrzungsstrich!]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   de paradyso liber secundus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  <.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  
