\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  119\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -146\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Ambrosius Mediolanensis}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 :{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 De Cain et Abel}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (119\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -134\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Incipit de Cain et Abel\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   / \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  liber primus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 De paradyso in< svperioribvs pro captv nostro ut potuimus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  qui salutis es\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [dar\u252 \'fcber wohl sp\u228 \'e4ter b\u252 \'fcgelf\u246 \'f6rmiger K\u252 \'fcrzungsstrich\~gesetzt?] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  effudit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Explicit de Cain et Abel liber primvs\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  <; (134\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -146\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Incipit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  liber secundus vnde supra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Hos partvs anima\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  nostra pariat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  qui mauult peccatoris\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  correctionem quam mortem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Explicit de Cain et Abel liber secundvs\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  <.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Edition: CSEL 32/1, S. LVIIII Anm. 1, S. 337-408 (Explicit von Clm 14399 angegeben). \endash  CPL 125}

