\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  66\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -93\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Henricus de Frimaria}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Tractatus de decem praeceptis}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Prolog I: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Audi Israhel precepta domini \u8230 \'85 Exodi (Dt 4,1 u.a.). In verbis propositis sanctus spiritus circa diuina precepta [im Text zweimal] tria tangit}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85; (68\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Prolog II: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Intendentes igitur pro communi exhortacione fidelium}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85; (68\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -93\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Text: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Primum preceptum approprietate respicit personam patris}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Hoc est vinum quod letificat deum et homines\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ,  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ut scribitur Iudicum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   XX\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (Idc 9,13). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Quod vinum nobis meritis gloriose uirginis prestare\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  dignetur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; Kolophon: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Expliciunt decem precepta edita per magistrum Henricum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Finita anno domini M\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   CCCC XXIIII\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   feria tercia post festum sancte trinitatis per manus Wen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Zdek\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   [mit K\u252 \'fcrzungsstrich?].
