\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Nota quod ingratus est ille qui beneficium dissipat}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  constat habentem pluribus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  amiculis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [korr.] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  indigere etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Est finis huius etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Explicit hoc totum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  infunde\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  da mihi potum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Py\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  py\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ypy\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  wypyg\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (?); (121\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -122\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Caesarius Arelatensis, Sermo LIV eingef\u252 \'fcgt: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Bene\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  nostris\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  fratres karissimi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  frequencius supplicasse\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  nequicia possit surripere\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Prestante\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  domino nostro\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .      
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Edition des Sermo von Caesarius Arelatensis in CCL 103, S. 235-240. \endash  Vgl. F. M. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Barto\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 \u353 \'9a\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , \plain \f2\lang1024\fs20 Liter\u225 \'e1rn\u237 \'ed \u269 \'e8innost \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  M. J. Husi. Praha 1948 (Sb\u237 \'ed\plain \f2\lang1024\fs20 rka pramen\u367 \'f9 k pozn\u225 \'e1ni liter\u225 \'e1rn\u237 \'edho \u382 \'9eivota \u268 \'c8eskoslovensk\u233 \'e9ho III, III/10), S. 79 Nr. 63; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 ders\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ./P. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Spunar\plain \f2\lang1024\fs20 , Soupis pramen\u367 \'f9 k liter\u225 \'e1rni \u269 \'e8innosti M. Jana Husa a M. Jeron\u253 \'fdma Pra\u382 \'9e\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  sk\u233 \'e9ho (Catalogus fontium M. Iohannis Hus et M. Hieronymi Pragensis). Praha 1965, S. 111 f. Nr. 62. \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Bloomfield\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   3357}

