\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (124\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -127\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Sermo de adventu domini: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Confirmate corda vestra \u8230 \'85 Iachobi primo (Iac 5,8). Et in currentis temporis officio beatus Bernhardus sermonem suum de aduentu}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \endash 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Fac\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  o benedicta\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  per graciam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Ipse benedictus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Tak my buoh pomahay y geho\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  myla matka panna matka\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  etc.;\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (127\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -128\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Sermo de apostolis: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Vos estis sal terre \u8230 \'85 (Mt 5,13). Et in festivitatis hodierne officio verba salvatoris nostri episcopi et doctoris prestantissimi}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Rogemus denique pro serenissimo domino nostro\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Wenceslao Romanorum rege et Bohemie etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ., \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ut omnipotens dominus secundum suam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  sapienciam dignetur etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Edition: A. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Schmidtov\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 \u225 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Iohannes Hus magister universitatis Carolinae: positiones, recommendationes sermones. Praha 1958, S. 119-130, 149-156 und S. 211-213  (\u220 \'dcberlieferung, ohne diese Handschrift). \endash  Vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Barto\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 \u353 \'9a\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 /Spunar\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Soupis pramen\plain \f2\lang1024\fs20 \u367 \'f9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   (wie oben), S. 83 f. Nr. 23 und S. 87 Nr. 27; J. \plain \f2\scaps\lang1024\fs20 T\plain \f2\scaps\lang1024\fs20 \u345 \'f8\u237 \'ed\u353 \'9a\plain \f2\scaps\lang1024\fs20 ka\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Stilus rhetoricus et litterae universitatis Pragensis medio aevo florentes. Praha 1975 (Series librorum archivi universitatis Carolinae-1), S. 129, 275 (Initien mit weiterer Literatur)}

