\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  De vita et morte hominis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Respice ab oriente ad meridiem}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 , }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 ad occidentem}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 , }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 ad aquilonem}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 . }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Hec}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17  }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 verba}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 , }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 fratres karissimi}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 locutus est dominus ad Abraham}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85; (130\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  De uirginitate\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Bonam tibi karissime querere}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85\~; (130\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Uiso de castitate, que est habitus uirtuosus, videndum est}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85; (131\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Impnus Prudencij Aurelli de consecracione ignis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  cerei et baptismi sub figura\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  transitus maris\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  rubri et columpne ignee ducentis populum Israel per noctem in deserto\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Versus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Aurelius prudens\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   / \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ympnus et carmina cudens\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   / \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  clarus in hac parte\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   / \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  metricaque\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  scolasticus arte\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; es folgt Prudentius, Liber Cathemerinon V: Hymnus ad incensum lucernae.
