\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  192\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra/b\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , 193\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -229\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Bernardus Casinensis}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Speculum monachorum}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (192\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra/b\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Text begonnen und abgebrochen: [M]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  onachus inquam profitetur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  secundum quod ex capitulo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  beatus Benedictus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  In omnibus omnes magistram\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  sequantur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; Rest der Spalte leer; 192\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   leer; (193\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra-va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Prolog: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Item prologus speculi Bernhardi abbatis Cassinensis monasterii\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < (\u252 \'fcber Schriftspiegel gestellt) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Incipit speculum regule monachorum beati Benedicti abbatis editum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  a Bernhardo abbate Montis Cassino\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Precordialissimis fratribus Johanni decano}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   Thomacio vicedecano\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85; (193\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -229\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Text: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Prima pars speciali vbi de forma monastice professionis et eius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  explanacione agitur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Capitulum primum huius speculi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   [korr.]< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Monachus inquam}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  videas facie ad faciem in eternum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; rechte Spalte leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 230\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -237\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Edition/Druck: Bernardi I abbatis Casinensis Speculum monachorum seu \u8230 \'85, ed. H. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Walter\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . Freiburg/Br. 1901, S. 1-211 [nicht verf\u252 \'fcgbar]; Speculum monachorum \u8230 \'85 Dillingae 1616. \endash  Zum Werk vgl. H. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Walter\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Das Speculum Monachorum des Abtes Bernhard I. von Cassino, in: Studien und Mittheilungen aus dem Benedictiner- und dem Cistercienser-Orden 22 (1901), S. 32-48 (S. 33 Anm. 7 diese Handschrift genannt)}

