\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Tractatus de penitentia reuerendi magistri Nico\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  de Dinkelspuhel\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Ecce}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17  }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 nunc tempus acceptabile 2}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 e}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17  Chor VI}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 o}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17  (II Cor 6,2). {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Duo sunt tempora hominis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  contra triplex ius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  naturale\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ecclesiasticum et diuinum a quo nos custodiat qui\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; abgesetzt: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Et hec de penitencia sufficiant\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Anno domini 1438 in vigilia sancti Barnabe apostoli etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .; darunter Eintrag wohl von anderer Hand mit Aufz\u228 \'e4hlung von 22 Vergehen, die unter Kirchenstrafe stehen: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Sinodalis constitucio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 :\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   sub \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [korr.] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  pena suspensionis ab ingressu ecclesie precipitur rectoribus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ecclesie vt in singulis festis apostolorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Occupacione bonorum relictorum a clericis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  mortuis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; hinzugef\u252 \'fcgt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  h\u255 \'ff\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  22\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
