\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  sensualitatis et memorie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85; (141\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) 76; (143\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) 74; (145\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) 86; (147\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) 83; (148\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) 80; (150\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va/b\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) 73; (152\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) 81; (155\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) 78; (157\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) 75; (158\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Dominica prima post octauam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  pasche\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Ego sum pastor bonus \u8230 \'85 (Io 10, 11). Uerba dei ut malleus et ignis ardens}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85; (159\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) 48; (160\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Pro defunctis sermo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Super flumina \u8230 \'85 (Ps 136, 1). Quidam sunt qui semper uolunt orare et canere}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85; (161\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -163\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Circumdederunt me gemitus \u8230 \'85 (Ps 17, 5). In ewangelio hodierno dicitur, quod quidam ociosis dictum est}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  tum liberari mereantur uenire ad IX choros angelorum, quod ipse nobis p. d. et cetera\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; (88\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) f\u252 \'fcnf Merkverse nach der Predigt zu dominica IIII in Quadragesima (vgl. Mt 14, 15-21 und 15, 32-38): {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Bis binus panis quinus quinque milia pauit}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , / \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Bissenus cophinus plenus uncis superauit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . / \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Quatuor ex VII saturauit milia libis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (lebes!), / \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Implenturque cibis sporte post prandia VII\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , / \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Pisciculis paucis fuit ex his copia cunctis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; zahlreiche Randglossen zum Text, etwas sp\u228 \'e4ter (s. oben); am unteren Rand von 102\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , 136\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   und 137\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Begriffsschemata zu \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  diuicie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  cogitatio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   und \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  s\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [c]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  orpio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; sp\u228 \'e4tere Numerierung der Predigten von XVII \endash  XL (104\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) von gleicher Hand wie im ersten Teil, 14. Jh.
