\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   leer. (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Prolog: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Titulus sequentis operis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Quisquis ad [korr. aus a] diuine pagine lectionem accedit, primo considerare debet}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  uel non est iusto posita\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  id est pro iusto\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; (2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -30\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Kommentar von Ps 1 bis 49: >{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Beatvs< vir qui \u8230 \'85 (Ps 1,1). Homo quando cogitationem suam ad terrena flectit}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Illustra faciem tuam super seruum tuum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; (30\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -86\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Kommentar von Ps 50 bis 150: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Miserere mei deus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 (Ps 50,3). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Quidam peccatum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  negauit dicens\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Numquid custos fratris\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 (Gn 4,9) \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  sola enim perseuerantia accipit brauium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Finis distinctionum post\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  multitudinem colletarum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Explicit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; Rest der Seite und 86\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   leer; Einleitungszitate zu Ps 70 (40\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) und Ps 99 (53\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) ausgelassen.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  
