\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Kapitel weitergez\u228 \'e4hlt; >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  De hinc Gennadivs Massiliensis prespyter\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Feliciter\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  CXXXVI\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Iacobvs cognomento Sapiens, Nezibenae nobilis Persarum modo ciuitatis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  unus ex numero\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  et robur addunt Thimotianis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Uiuere autem dicitur et ad tempus declamare\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Explicit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  liber virorum illvstrivm\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  <.
