\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (62\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -63\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Epistola 43 (M\u228 \'e4rz 850): \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Ad Hincmarum episcopum contra Gotescalchi errorem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; endet: \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Dilectionem uestram bene ualentem et in\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Christi seruicio utiliter laborantem dici in hoc seculo omnipotentis dei gratia ad multorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  profectum seruare et in futura uita \plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs24 \u281 \'eaterna beatitudine remunerare dignetur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  sancte frater\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  memorem nostri\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; (63\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -69\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Epistola 44 (850); (69\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r/v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Epistola 45 (nach 850; unvollst\u228 \'e4ndig).
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  
