\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 >Sabbato sancto. Ad Matut. In primo Noctur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 [no]. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Antiphona< In pace in idipsum dormiam et requiescam. >Psal\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 [mus]< \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Cum inuocarem exaudiuit me \u8230 \'85 Ps 4.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  Etc. Endet mit der Oration: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Respice quaesumus domine super hanc familiam tuam \u8230 \'85 et crucis subire tormentum. >Secre\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 [to]< \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Qui tecum viuit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 .- Text folgt dem Ordo breviarii Romani.- 82\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -88\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  leer, au\u223 \'dfer (84\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) Nachtrag: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 De Feria Quinta in Coena Domini ex Bartholomaeo Gauanto< Missa habet festiuum officium ob institutionem sacramenti sacramentorum \u8230 \'85-\u8230 \'85 Reseruatur hostia cum particulis in sequentem diem pro sacerdote et infirmis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Bartholomaeus Gavanti, Liturgiker und Rubrizist, Mitglied der Kommission f\u252 \'fcr Brevier- und Missalereform (\u8224 \'86 1638). Vgl. LThK\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20\cf1 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1  4, Sp. 534 (E. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Jerg\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 ); LThK\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20\cf1 3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1  4, Sp. 305 f. (B. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Kranemann\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 )}

