\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Liber tercius sententiarum de reparatione generis humani< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Cum venit igitur plenitude temporis \u8230 \'85 Iste est tertius liber sententiarum Petri Lombardi in quo magister specialiter et principaliter agit}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  de misterio nostre reparationis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  cuius in perpetuum est uita eterna et beatitudo perfecta quam nobis conferet ipse qui legem dedit Jhesus Christus deus in secula seculorum benedictus. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 >Expliciunt questiones tercii sententiarum venerabilis magistri Narcissi Hercz de Perching arcium ac sacre theologie professoris eximii quas collegit in Mellico in monasterio solemni ordinis sancti Benedicti in primo anno sui doctoratus qui in bona etate constitutus obijt. Anno 1451<\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \endash  263\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  leer. \endash  (264\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -265\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 )  \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Verzeichnis der Quaestionen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 , geordnet nach den Distinctiones des Liber III sententiarum. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 266\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -269\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Stegm\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\cf1 \u252 \'fc\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\cf1 ller\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 , RS I, 544 und die dort zitierten Quellen. \endash  Zum Autor: LThK\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20\cf1 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1  7, Sp. 791 (L. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Ott\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 ); LThK\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20\cf1 3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1  7, Sp. 638 (L. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Hell\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 )}

