\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  179\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -204\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Petrus de Alliaco}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Tractatus de potestate ecclesiastica}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u220 \'dcberschrift: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Incipit tractatus de ecclesiastica potestate editus per dominum cardinalem Cameracensem in sacro concilio Constan\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  anno 1416\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; Text:{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17  Cristi nomine invocato cui data est ipso teste omnis potestas in celo et in terra Mt. vltimo (vgl. Mt 28,18). De ecclesiastica potestate ab eo deriuata}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   tractatum hunc breuem aggredior\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  me illis qui contra premissa\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  opponere voluerint responsurum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Datum et pronunciatum Constancie in concilio generali\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  anno domini millesimo quadringentesimo decimo sexto die prima mensis octobris in ecclesia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24       
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  sancti Pauli\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Editus per dominum cardinalem Cameracensem de ecclesiastica potestate\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  tractans etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .; abgesetzt: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Explicit etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  tractatus de ecclesiastica potestate editus per reuerendissimum cardinalem Cameracensem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; zeitgen\u246 \'f6ssische Randvermerke zum Text. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Druck: Joannis Gersonii opera omnia, t. 2, ed. L. E. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 du Pin\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . Antwerpen 1706, Sp. 925-960}

