\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx1980\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Sermo de sancto Andrea: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Vestigia illius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 (Iob 23,11). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Sunt qui secuntur deum per fidem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  sed ab eo recedunt per operacionem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 (Initium nach Jacobus de Voragine; vgl. u.a. Berlin, SBB-PK, Ms. theol. lat. qu. 346, 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; N\u252 \'fcrnberg, Stadtbibl., Cent. II, 53, 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ); (110\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  De eodem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Vestigia illius \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 (Iob 23,11). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Rationale valde est et est iusticie consonum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85; (110\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Jacobus de Voragine, Sermo V de sancto Nicolao (Schlu\u223 \'df gek\u252 \'fcrzt; vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Rep. 3, S. 247 Nr. 303); (111\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  De sancto Thoma\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Qvia vidisti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 (Io 20,29). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Homo fit certus de re per auditum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  certior per visum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  certissimus per tactum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85; (112\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  De nativitate\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Paruulus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  natus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 (Is 9,6). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Hodie dicuntur boni rumores hiis qui Christum expectauerunt in isto\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  aduentu\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Anfangsteil nach Peregrinus de Oppeln, Sermo in festo nativitatis domini, dann stark abweichend; vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Rep. 4, S. 549 Nr. 11; Edition s. unten); (114\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Ewangelizo vobis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 (Lc 2,10-11). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Circa nativitatem Christi saluatoris nostri tria\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  o\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [ste]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ndit angelus in verbis premissis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Primo quod ipsa natiuitas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85; (Anfangsteil \u228 \'e4hnlich Jacobus de Voragine, dann stark abweichend; vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Rep. 3, S. 248 Nr. 321); (115\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  De sancto Stephano\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Stephanus plenus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 (Act 6,8). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Hic describit beatus Lucas beati\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Stephani passionem et passionis actionem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 (Initium \u228 \'e4hnlich Jacobus de Voragine, dann v\u246 \'f6llig abweichend; vgl. ebd. S. 248 Nr. 325); (117\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  De sancto Iohanne\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Hic est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  discipulus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 (Io 21,20). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Prerogatiua Iohannis perpenditur quod spiritualiter dilectus fuisse\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  perhibetur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 (Initium nach Jacobus de Voragine, dann v\u246 \'f6llig abweichend; vgl. ebd. S. 249 Nr. 334); (118\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Circumcisi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [onis]< \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Postquam consummati \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 (Lc 2,21). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  In hoc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ewangelio tanguntur duo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  scilicet humilitas circumcisionis Christi et sublimitas nominis eius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85; (119\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Conversio Pauli\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Postquam conuertisti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 (Ier 31,19). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Quia hodie agitur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  conuersio sancti Pauli quem dominus de celo vocauit penitentiam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 (Initium und Schlu\u223 \'df \u228 \'e4hnlich Johannes Contractus; vgl.\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24  Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Rep. 3, S. 440 Nr. 95); (120\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  In purificacione\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Surge\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  illuminare\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 (Is 60,1). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Ex quo colit ecclesia festum luminum et Christus qui est verum lumen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  hodie in templo est presentatus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 (Initium vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Rep. 8, S. 795 Nr. 3; Rep. 9, S. 617 Nr. 20); (121\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Mathie apostoli\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Certe videtis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 (I Sm 10,24). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Dominus beatum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Mathiam in apostolum suum elegit et cum centum XX\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 ti\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   congregati\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 (Initium vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Rep. 4, S. 30 Nr. 217, zu Leo OCist); (122\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Annunciacionis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Missus est angelus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 (Lc 1,26). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Ewangelium hodiernum narrat quomodo deus incepit humano generi misereri\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 (wie Clm 14131, 105\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -106\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ); (124\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Georgius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Certamen forte\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 (Sap 10,12). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Multi sunt qui nolunt certare\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  sed semper ocio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  turpare\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Contra quos dicit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \lquote \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Certamen forte etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .\rquote  \u8230 \'85; (125\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Crucis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Michi autem absit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 (Gal 6,14). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Sunt quidam qui gloriantur in diuiciis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Secundum idem psalmus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (51,9): \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  In\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  multitudine diviciarum suarum gloriantur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85; (126\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Michi autem absit gloriari etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Vbi supra accessus in primo sermone\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  In quibus verbis duo ponuntur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Primo in quo non est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  gloriandi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85; (128\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Iohannis baptiste\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Multi in natiuitate\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 (Lc 1,14). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Angelus Gabriel\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  qui concepcionem precursoris nunciare venerat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  In quibus circa nativitatem Iohannis duo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  describuntur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 (zum Initium vgl. Uppsala, UB, C 383, 141\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; Clm 28528, 201\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   und \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Rep. 3, S. 441 Nr. 111, zu Johannes Contractus); (130\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Petri et Pauli\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Principes\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  populorum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 (Ps 46,10). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Verba preposita possunt exponi de duobus precipuis apostolis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  scilicet Petro et Paulo quia fuerunt apostoli et principes duorum populorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 (Initium vgl. ebd. S. 441 Nr. 112, zu Johannes Conractus); (131\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  In visitacione\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Exurgens Maria\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 (Lc 1,39). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Hodie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  karissimi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  agitur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  festum omni sollempnitate dignum scilicet visitacionis Marie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  nuper detectum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85; (133\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Margarethe virginis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Fortitudo et decor\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 (Prv 31,25). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Possunt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  hec verba exponi de beata Margaretha que fuit virgo robusta\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  virgo leta\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  virgo decora\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 (Initium vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Rep. 9, S. 492 Nr. 53); (135\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  In diuisione apostolorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Confringite vitulos\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Ezechielis IIII\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (Nm 33,52-54). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Hodie in ecclesia agitur divisio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  apostolorum et quia apostoli igitur diviserunt sibi sorte terras\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24    \u8230 \'85 (Initium vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Rep. 3, S. 441 Nr. 114, zu Johannes Contractus); (136\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Marie Magdalene sermo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Rogabat Ihesum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 (Lc 7,36). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Status Marie Magdalene in isto ewangelio describitur quantum ad tria\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Primo quantum ad statum culpe\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 (Initium \u228 \'e4hnlich Uppsala, UB, C 334, 168\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ); (138\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Iacobi apostoli\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Potestis bibere\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 (Mt 20,22). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Sicud dicit Gregorius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Si consideremus que\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  et quanta sunt que nobis promittuntur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  nisi per magnos labores\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Et hic salvator noster\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  innuit quando Iacobo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   [korr.] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  et Iohanni sedem regni petentibus calicem exhibuit passionis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 (Textanfang Zitate aus Gregorius Magnus, Homiliae in evangelia XXXVII,1; CCL 141, S. 348, bis Z. 14); (140\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  De eodem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Potestis bibere calicem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Mt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  XX\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Cum sancti apostoli Iacobus et Iohannes desiderarent venire\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Ceterea autem ut habentur in\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Contractu\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (Predigtanfang; Initium vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Rep. 3, S. 441 f. Nr. 116, Johannes Contractus); (140\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Vincula Petri\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Dirupisti vincula mea\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 (Ps 115,16-17). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Hec verba Petrus beatus dicere potuit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  cuius dominus vincula mirabiliter disrupit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 (Initium vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Rep. 1, S. 768 Nr. 309, zu Conradus de Saxonia); (141\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Conradus de Saxonia, Sermo de sancto Laurentio (ebd. S. 768 Nr. 312); (142\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  De assumpcione beate\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  virginis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Qve est ista\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 (Ct 8,5). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Assumpcionem \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [korr.] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  huius sanctissime virginis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  nec sufficientes sumus inquirere\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 (wie Clm 14131, 100\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -101\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ); (142\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  De eodem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Qve est ista\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ut supra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  In quibus verbis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  angeli primo ostendunt suam annunciacionem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 (wie Clm 14131, 101\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -103\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ); (144\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Jacobus de Voragine, Sermo I de sancto Bernhardo (\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Rep. 3, S. 260 Nr. 513); (145\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Jacobus de Voragine, Sermo IV (V) de sancto Bernhardo (ebd. S. 260 Nr. 516); (146\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Bartholomei\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Nvdus egressus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 (Iob 1,21). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Quere illum sermonem in Contractu et ibi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  invenies\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; Jacobus de Voragine, Sermo I de sancto Bartholomaeo (stark abweichend vom Druck; ebd. S. 260 Nr. 517); (147\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Augustini episcopi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Appropinquate ad me\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 (Sir 51,31). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Possunt esse hec verba beati Augustini doctoris egregii invitantis nos ad suam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  doctrinam \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 (Initium wie Kassel, Stadt- u. Landesbibl., 2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Ms. theol. 47, 183\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ); (148\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Decollacio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Lex veritatis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 (Mal 2,6). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Beatus Iohannes baptista cuius festum colimus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  propter veritatem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85; (149\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Natiuitatis Marie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Qve est ista\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 (Ct 6,9). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Gloriosa virgo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Maria propter excellentem pulcritudinem pulcerrimis rebus co\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [m]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  paratur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 (wie Clm 14131, 103\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -105\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ); (151\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  De eodem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Beatam me dicent\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 (Lc 1, 48-49). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Sicud dicit dominus Mt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  IIII\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (4): \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Quod non in solo pane \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Homo enim est compositus ex corpore et anima\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 (wie Clm 14131, 88\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va-b\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ); (151\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Crucis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Michi autem absit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 (Gal 6,14). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Sunt enim qui gloriantur in suis maliciis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Proverborum II\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Letantur cum malefecerint\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 (Prv 2,14). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Quidam gloriantur in diuiciis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Psalmus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85; (153\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  De eodem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Exaltaui lignum humile\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Ezechielis XVII\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (24). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Lignum sancte crvcis cuius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  exaltacionis hodie festum agitur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 (Initium vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Rep. 1, S. 769 Nr. 333, zu Conradus de Saxonia); (155\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Mathei ew\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .< \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Cum transiret\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 (Mt 9,9). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Fuit enim theolonarius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (!). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Est enim theoloneum ut dicit Isodorus et Beda locus in partu\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (? lies portu) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  maris ubi merces nauium et nautarum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  emolumenta redduntur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (Isidorus, Etymologiarum lib. XV, II, 45). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Et ait illi sequere me\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 (Mt 9,9; Lc 5,27-28). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  In hiis uerbis notantur tria\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85; (156\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  De eodem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Conuersus sum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 (Apc 1,12). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Peccatum sicud dicit Augustinus est auersio ab incommutabili bono\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 (Initium und Schlu\u223 \'df wie \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Rep. 1, S. 656 Nr. 977, zu Bonaventura Sanctus und Rep. 5, S. 387 Nr. 174, zu Servasanctus de Faenza; im Text vom Druck stark abweichend, s. unten); (157\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Johannes Contractus, Sermo de Matthaeo ev. (\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Rep. 3, S. 442 Nr. 126); (158\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )  >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Mauricii\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Conualuerunt de infirmitate\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 (Hbr 11,34). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Verba ista possumus capere ad\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  commendacionem sanctorum Mauricii et sociorum eius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 (Initium vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Rep. 9, S. 896 Nr. 144); (159\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Wenczesslay\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Posuisti domine\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 (Ps 20,4). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Considerate karissimi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  secundum IIII\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 or\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   virtutes cardinales IIII\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 or\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   coronas triumphales\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Prima est iustorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 (Initium wie Augsburg, Staats- und Stadtbibl., 2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Cod. 420, 21\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ); (161\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Iordanus de Quedlinburgo (nach Jacobus de Voragine), Sermo de angelis (\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Rep. 3, S. 856 Nr. 492 und ebd. S. 262 Nr. 548; nach Predigtende im Druck noch l\u228 \'e4ngerer Textzusatz; Druck s. unten); (162\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Luce\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ewangeliste\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Ecce super montes\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 (Na 1,15). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Verba ista possunt sumi ad commendationem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Luce ewangeliste\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  qui commendatur hic a duobus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 (wie Clm 14131, 90\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -91\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   und Clm 28471, 175\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Johannes Contractus?); (162\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Symonis et Iude\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Hoc mando vobis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 (Io 15,17). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Sic dicit sanctus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Augustinus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Merito magister bonus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  quibus homo efficitur bonus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (Zitat aus Augustinus, Tractatus in Iohannis evangelium LXXXVII, 1; CCL 36, S. 544). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  In hiis ergo verbis tradit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  nobis deus preceptum dilectionis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 (wie Clm 14131, 91\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -93\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ); (164\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  De omnibus sanctis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Beati pauperes\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 (Mt 5,3). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Alma mater ecclesia festiuitates sanctorum veneracionis misterio \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (lies ministerio) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  celebrans ad ipsorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  imitacionem salubriter nos prouocat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 (wie Clm 14131, 93\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -97\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ); (166\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Laudem dicite\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 (Apc 19,5). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Dicit beatus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Augustinus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Sicud deus in celesti gloria electis et dilectis prebet et exhibet\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 (wie Clm 14131, 97\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -98\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ); (167\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Domus mea domus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 (Is 56,7; Mt 21,13). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Dominus noster Ihesus Christus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   zelator domus sue ecclesie videlicet sancte\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   videns in ea multa nepharia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 (wie Clm 14131, 98\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -100\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ); (168\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va-b\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Schlu\u223 \'dfbetrachtung (wie Clm 14131, 100\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra-va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ): \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Nota quod quinque assignantur rationes\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  quare deus oculte in panem ascendit et ad nos veniet non inanitate\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Primo propter bonos ut\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  homo credendo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 et sicud vnus sol per multas fenestras intrat et tamen est vnus sic deus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  et homo in multis hostiis et sic patet de isto etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .; darunter \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Finito libro\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   sit laus et gloria Christo \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Colophons 21496). 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\tx1980\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  
