\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Sermo in dominica post octavam Pentecostes: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 [}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 D}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 ]}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 eus caritas est}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 ... (I Io 4,8). }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 In hodierna dominica, que est prima post octauas}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 (!)}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17  Penthecostis incipit quartum tempus}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   4\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 or\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   temporum et vocatur tempus peregrinacionis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  in qua anime omnium sanctorum requiescunt. Ad que vos perducat Jesus, qui nos per seipsum inuenit etc.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (40\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) De octo beatitudinibus: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Incipit exposicio illius ewangelij videns Jesus turbas ascendit in montem, quod scribitur Mt. V. Quedam exposicio sumpta est ex glosa supra Mt., quam composuit frater Thomas aliquo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (!)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   ordinis predicacionis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 [V]idens Jhesus turbas. Crisostomus: Omnis artifex secundum professionem suam}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   opor\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (41\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  tunitatem operis videns gaudet. Carpentarius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (41\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Beati pauperes scilicet\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (?)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   Augustinus de sermo \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   domini in monte: Presumpcio quidem spiritus audaciam et superbiam significat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Augustinus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Persecucionem hic generaliter posuit et in maledictis et in laceracione\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  fame. Et sic est finis huius exposicionis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .- Vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Schneyer\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 ,\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Rep. 7, S. 548, Nr. 8.- \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Stegm\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 \u252 \'fc\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 ller\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   RB 4350 (Initium aus Ps.-Johannes Chrysostomus: Opus imperfectum in Mt.; haupts\u228 \'e4chlich Zitate aus Chriysostomus, Augustinus, Ambrosius).
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (46\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) De passione domini: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  De passione\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 [B]aiulans sibi crucem exiuit ... (Io 19,17). Ignominia dominice passionis in hijs verbis ostenditur quo ad quatuor}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Primo quo ad patibili\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...-...\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   facti sunt veri testes resurreccionis domini nostri Jhesu Christi, qui est benedictus in secula seculorum. Amen. etc. etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .- Vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Schneyer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   7, S. 424 Nr. 120. \endash  Parallel\u252 \'fcberlieferung: u.a. Augsburg UB, Cod. II.1.fol 168, 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash  11\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  /210\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \endash  214\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (Schlu\u223 \'df var.).- Verglichen mit  Clm 11460, 156\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -165\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (var.).
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Hinweise auf das Entstehungsgebiet des Textes (vgl. dazu Augsburg UB, Cod. II.1.fol 168, 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash  11\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  /210\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \endash  214\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ): (49\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Uade in Babenpurg vbi in maiori ecclesia seruatur iste gladius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (zum Messer des hl. Petrus in Bamberg, erstmals erw\u228 \'e4hnt Mitte 15. Jh. (!) vgl. E. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Bassermann-Jordan\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  /W.M. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Schmid\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : Der Bamberger Domschatz. 1914, S. 25, Nr. 18). \endash  (50\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ): \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Galilei differunt in ydiomate suo modo sicud Sweuie Bauarij\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (!).- (52\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) im fortlaufenden Text dt. \u220 \'dcbersetzungen lat. W\u246 \'f6rter: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Vach\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  quod est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  pfuch dich\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .- \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  capucium ein kocze}

