\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Capitulatio zu Buch 1: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Quod deus summus et incommutabilis sit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  De gloria sanctorum. De penitentibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .- (Buch I)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Summum bonum deus est et incommutabilis est}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   et corrumpi omnino non potest ...-..\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  quos celestis aula letificandus includit etc. Punthschuech.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (zu {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100gi/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Buntschuh}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   als Schreiberbezeichnung vgl. z.B. Cgm 4376, 240\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Cgm 4883, 85\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Finitus est iste liber in vigilia sancti Jacobi apostoli Anno domini Mi\u176 \'b0CCCC\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  XL\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   durchgestrichen) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  XVIIII\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  <. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Von anderer Hand: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Isydorus de summo bono\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
