\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r/v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Vorbemerkung zu den Weltaltern nach Hieronymus: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  De etatibus mundi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 [Bea]tus Jeronimus in Cronica quam propriis contexuit manibus ita commemorat}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Ab Adam vsque ad\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  diluuium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ab Adam vsque ad Christum sunt anni V\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 M\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   C XC VIIII\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; (2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -3\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Chronikalische Notizen (1. Teil: 915-1402): \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Vnde Versus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Ante deum carne natum sunt milia quinque anni\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  transacti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Item anno 1402\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  XXII\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  die mensis februar\u255 \'ff apparuit cometa versus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  occidentem et durauit plus quam duos menses\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; (3\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -5\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Chronikalische Notizen (2. Teil bis 1341): \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Cronice diuerse\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Item a creatione mundi annis V\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 M\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   CC minus vno natus est dominus noster\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Ihesus Christus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Item 1340 post obitum Nicolai episcopi Rat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  post huius obitum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  episcopatum plenarie est assecutus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0    
