\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (32\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Auctoritates de libris consideracionum beati Bernhardi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; Liber I: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Commendacio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  consideracionis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Primum quidem fontem suum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  id est mentem de qua oritur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24    \u8230 \'85 aus VII 8, VIII 9, X 13; (32\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -35\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Liber II: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  De libro secundo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Differentia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  contemplacionis et consideracionis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 aus II 5, III 6, VII 14, VIII 15, IX 18, X 19, XI 20, XII 21, XIII 22, XIV 23; (35\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -36\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Liber III: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  De libro tercio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  De considerando ea que sub\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  te\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  sunt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 aus I 1-5, II 7,8, IV 14,15,17,18; (36\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -38\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Liber IV: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  De libro 4\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 to\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  De h\u255 \'ffs que circa te\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  sunt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 aus II 2, III 6-8, II 4,5, IV 9-12, VI 17, V 15,16, VI 18-22; (38\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -39\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Liber V: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  De\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  quinto libro\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  De consideracione horum que supra te\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  sunt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 aus I 1,2, VI 14, VII 15, IV 7, VII 17, VIII 18, IX 20, X 22,23, XI 24, XIII 27-29, endet \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  sublimitas potencia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  profund\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  itas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  sapiencia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; Rest der Seite leer.
