\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (55\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r/v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Johannes Peckham (?): De corpore Christi: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Incipit oratio pulchra de corpore Christi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Aue, viuens hostia, veritas et vita}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85; (55\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -56\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Oratio perpulchra de beata virgine\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Aue, tu triclinium, summe trinitatis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85; (56\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -57\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Oratio pulcherrima de beata virgine Maria\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Aue virgo, virgula flosculi regalis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 .   
