\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 darunter Bauernregeln (5 Verse, bairisch): {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666d/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 S\u228 \'e4 k\u246 \'f6rn Egidij, habern, gersten Benedicti}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Heb an\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Martini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  trinch wein per circulum anni\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; darunter De vitanda epidemia (6 Verse): \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Contra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  pestem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Aleam (lies Allia) cum pane tu debes sumere mane}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 (\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Walther\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Initia carminum 772); darunter Formel zur Amtseinf\u252 \'fchrung eines neugew\u228 \'e4hlten Abtes: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Ego N\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  consentum in\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24    \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  fratrem N\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  in abbatem nostri monasterij eligendum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  porrigens per has litteras sigilla domini N\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  sigillatas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  datum die tali anni etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . 
