\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  De septem gradibus conuersionis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Bern\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  hardus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  super Cantica Canticorum sermone XVIIII\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 a\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  1\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 us\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   Quid primo opus est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ? \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Ut tumor uel ulcus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  quod forte supercreuit in wlnere\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Recapitulacio eorumdem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Primo compunctio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  deinde deuocio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  quod\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ille adiunxit non\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  pretermittas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Et de hys satis etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
