\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Titel, 13. Jh.: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Matheus glosatus; daneben Signatur Mengers (s. oben) o 23; (1v-3r) Prolog: [vor Textanfang in Mittelspalte f\u252 \'fcnf Zeilen freigelassen f\u252 \'fcr Prologanfang] sicut in ordine primus ponitur}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  diligenter esse dispositionem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  querentibus non taceret\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; glossa marg.{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17  Cum multi scripsisse \u281 euangelia legantur}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash  (2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  et\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  undosi mundi edidit lucem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs24 H\u281 \'eac igitur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  septem spiritualia bona\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  nobis spiritus timoris\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; (2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Matheus in hac uita que IIII\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 or\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   temporum consulabitur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash  (3\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8230 \'85 \plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs24 aut certe singulis qu\u281 \'ea\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  sua sunt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; (3\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -37\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Evangelientext bis Mt 15, 34 (drei Bl\u228 \'e4tter abgeschnitten): \endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  quot panes\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  habetis at\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   //; glossa marg. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Matheus cum primo predicasset in Iudea}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  cuius obedientia uitam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  restituit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Liber generationis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  consuetudo Hebreorum est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85; glossa interlin. (\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Liber\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ): \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  incipit generationum ab ipso\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  promissionis exordio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85; nachgetragene Lesetermine, 15. Jh.; auf 27\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r/v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , 28\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , 29\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , 30\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r/v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , 36\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , 37\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   sp\u228 \'e4tere Erg\u228 \'e4nzungen zu den Glossen, 13. Jh.; auf 5\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -7\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , 9\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , 10\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Notate, 15. Jh.     
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  
