\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (38\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Titel, 13. Jh.: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Tractatus de corpore Christi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Pascasii Ratberti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  abbatis Corbeiensis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ordinis sancti Benedicti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; von Hand des 15. Jh.s dar\u252 \'fcber \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  J\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , unter dem Titel \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  vixit circa annum DCCC\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; weiterer Titeleintrag, 15. Jh.; (38\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -39\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Prolog: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Collectio cuiusdam de corpore et sanguine domini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Incipit prologus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Dilectissimo filio Pladio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  et vice Christi presidenti magistro\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs24 alternis monastic\u281 \'ea disciplin\u281 \'ea successibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash ... \plain \f2\i\lang1024\fs24 qu\u281 \'ea monui deuotis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; (39\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -40\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Capitulatio; (40\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -69\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Post commvnionem uervm corpus et sangvinem esse non dvbitandvm}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Quisque\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   [nachtr\u228 \'e4glich zu \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Quisqvis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   korr.!] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  catholicorvm recte deum cvncta creasse de nichilo corde\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash ...  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ut ad illa resurreccionis gaudia quantotivs venire valeamvs\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  
