\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (I\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -III\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Register): \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  De constitucionibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Constitucio synodalis, De transscriptis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Instrumentum recognicionis cum substitucione procuratoris\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .- Erfa\u223 \'dft die Texte bis 114\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Prolog) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Quoniam nonnulli iuris ignorancia turpiter excecati}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ...-... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  tedio minime sint affecti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .- Ed.: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Barraclough\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Public notaries, S. 97.- Teiledition des Prologes: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Rockinger\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Ueber formelb\u252 \'fccher, S. 89.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -65\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Formularius episcopalis}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) De constitutionibus
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Incipit nouus formularius tres antiquos continens. Formularius episcopalis de constitucionibus. Constitucio synodalis registranda\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Johannes miseracione dominica Munatensis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (!; gemeint: Mimatensis, d.i. Mende in Frankreich; in Mende im fraglichen Zeitraum mehrere Bisch\u246 \'f6fe dieses Namens: Johannes d\rquote Arcy (1330-1331), Johannes d\rquote Armagnac (1387-1390), Johannes de Costa (1408-1409) und Johannes de Corbeya (1413-1426), vgl. auch \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Barracglough\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Public notaries, S. 117 Anm. 3; s.u. 4\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   episcopus dilectis filiis N. rectoribus ecclesiarum parrochialium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Si racione rerum et personarum statuta et ordinaciones juris peritorum et mandata principum minime seruarentur}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...-... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  propter inobedienciam grauiter puniemus. In cuius rei testimonium ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Dominicus Dominici, Summa dicta\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 minis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Ed. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Rockinger\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 ,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Briefsteller, S. 572, Nr. 83).}

