\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 De Transscriptis}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  De transscriptis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Scriptum cum decreto et auctoritate judicis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Universis hec uisuris officialibus Auinionensibus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 (Avignon)}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17  pro domino nostro papa salutem. Notum facimus, quod}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 ...}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17  coram nobis personaliter constitutus P. nobis ostendit et exhibuit et p}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 [}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 rese}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 ]}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 ntauit quoddam publicum instrumentum non abolitum}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Tenor vero instrumenti super eodem per notarios publicos\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  In nomine ... Per hoc presens publicum instrumentum cunctis pateat ... In nostri \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   notariorum publicorum et testimonium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  subscriptorum presencia personaliter constitutus P. nobis exhibuit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Subscripcio primi notarij\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Et ego T. de prefatis duobus instrumentis ad huiusmodi transscriptum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Subscripcio secundi notarii\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Et ego T. premissi auscultator\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Super eadem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  In nomine ... Hoc est transsumptum quarundam litterarum apostolicarum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...-... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  quarum tenor talis est: Vrbanus etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . (Urban)}

