\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -4\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 De electionibus}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  De eleccionibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < [\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  I\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  n nomine domini. Amen. Per hoc presens publicum instrumentum cunctis pateat euidenter... Defuncto Bononie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (Bologna)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   religioso viro fratre N\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . ... >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Decretum eleccionis via Spiritus Sancti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  In nomine ... Sanctissimo ac beatissimo in Christo patri ac domino domino Vrbano \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Urban) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  diuina prouidencia pape\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Cum propter vacanciam diuturnam ecclesie pastoralis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (vgl. Krakau BJ, Cod. 461, 147\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ). (2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Et ego T. o. notarius qui predictis omnibus vna cum prenominatis testibus rogatus interfui presens eleccionis decretum propria manu scripsi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Instrumentum petiti assensus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  In nomine ... Constituti in presencia venerabilis viri domini J. electi in abbatem monasterii ... ad Romanam ecclesiam nullo medio pertinentis ... Religiosi viri et ac\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (!)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   monachi dicti monasterii presentauerunt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Decretum eleccionis per viam compromissi secundum doctrinam domini Hostiensis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Sacris canonibus nouimus esse cautum, ut vltra menses tres pontifice proprio non vacet cathedralis ecclesia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (vgl. Krakau BJ, cod. 326, 103\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) ... (4\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Quomodo patronus supplicat pape quod ipse reseruet beneficium pro clerico\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < (4\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Sanctissimo in Christo patri ac domino domino V.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (Papst Urban?)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ... summo pontifici ... Predicte\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (?)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   sappimus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  quot dilecto spirituali nostro P. vita et moribus et sciencia multipliciter commendato\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  De consecracione electi. Littera electi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Petrus miseracione diuina Mumatensis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (!; Mimatensi, s.o. 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; in Frage kommen Petrus Gerardi de Roure 1366-1371 oder Petrus de Saluciis 1409-1412) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  episcopus reuerendis in Christo patribus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Glorificetur nomen altissime gloriosi disponens omnia sua misericordia et sanitate\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (!) ... (vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Dominicus Dominici, Summa dictaminis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Ed.: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Rockinger\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Briefsteller, S. 566f., Nr. 75.- vgl. Krakau BJ, Cod. 461, 115\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ). >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Littera electi quod ipse jurauit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Universis et eciam vniversitati vestro\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  tenore presencium innotescat quod ... episcopum Bituricensem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (Bourges) ...-... (4\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  prout mihi iniungitur prouide fieri feci\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .}

