\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (9\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Comissio facta alicui super matrimonio}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Salutem etc. Cum inter T. ex vna parte et M. parrochianam vestram ex altera nostre diocesis clandestine fuerit matrimonium \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ... >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Comissio sygentarie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (?)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   proseruiente\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Symon de ... Baylinus de ... dilecto vostro P. de condominio castra de ... salutem in domino ... Laudabile testimonium quo apud nos comendatus existit exposcit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (9\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Comissio gubernacionis hospitalis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Salutem etc. Gubernacionem et administracionis hospitalis sancti ... nostre diocesis ... tibi concedimus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...-...\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   commisimus vices nostras. Datum tali loco et die etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Weitere genannte Personen: (8\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Aussteller: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Johannes auditor generalis camere apostolice\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... wohl Johannes Maurelli (\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Laurent\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , a.a.O., Register Bd. 12, S. 57)}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (9\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -18\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 De procuratoribus}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  De procuratoribus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  In nomine ... Per hoc presens publicum instrumentum cunctis pateat ... absentes tamquam presentes suos fecit constituit nominauit \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ... (9\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Procuratorium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  In nomine ... Per hoc presens publicum instrumentum cunctis pateat ... presbyter ... diocesis fecit et eciam tales procuratores suos et nuncios spirituales licet absentes\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (10\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Procuratorium ad presentandum litteras et prosequendum graciam communem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  In nomine ... Per hoc presens publicum instrumentum cunctis pateat ... Vsque ad presentandum insumendum notificandum pro eo, quod eius nomine litteras appostolicas sibi concessas a sanctissimo patre domino \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ...}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (13\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Procuratorium ad recipiendum homagium et petenda hereditaria in alia forma}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  In nomine ... {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Ad petendum exigendum et recipiendum retrahendum requirendum et recuperandum a quibuscumque personis}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   terram (!) redditus et res feudales\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  In nomine ... Anno natiuitatis eiusdem millesimo quadringentesimo vicesimo indiccione tercia decima die vero duodecima mensis Octobris hora vesperorum vel quasi pontificatus sanctissimi in Christo patris et domini nostri domini Martini diuina prouidencia pape 5\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 ti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (Martin V.)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   anno 3\u176 \'b0 in mei notarii et testium infrascriptorum presencia constitutus honorabilis vir dominus Conradus Patzz\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Repertorium Germanicum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   4, Sp. 478)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   canonicus ecclesie Wratislauiensis fecit, constituit et solemniter ordinauit suos veros legitimos et indubitatos procuratores actores et nunccius (!) spirituales venerabiles et discretos viros magistros Johannem Creyuelt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Repertorium Germanicum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   4, S. 3556)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   prepositum ecclesie sancti Mauricij extra muros monasterienses, Petrum Rack\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Repertorium Germanicum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   4, Sp. 3195-3197)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   et Johannem Pranperger\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Repertorium Germanicum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   4, S. 2255)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   in Romana curia procuratores absentes tamquam presentes quemlibet in solidum ita \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ... (15\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Procuratorium sub sigillo ad contrahendum mutuum pro episcopo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Univeris presentes litteras inspecturis L. dei gratia episcopus ... salutem in domino ... Vniversitati vestre tenore presencium innotescat quod confisi de fidei legalitate\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (vgl. Krakau BJ, Cod. 461, 61\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) ... (17\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Constitucio procuratoris pro se et substitucio pro aliis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  In nomine\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  In Romana curia procurator suos proprios fecit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (18\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Reuocacio procuratoris\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  In nomine ... Habens inter cetera potestatem ab ipso\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Reuocacio quorumcumque procuratorum excepto vno\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Nouerint vniuersi etc. Reuocatus expresse tenore presencium omnes procuratores nostros constitutos per nos\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...-... (18\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   volumus remanere. In cuius rei etc.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Weitere erw\u228 \'e4hnte Personen: (10\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Papst Urban (V.?); (12\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Fuerit Petrus sancte domus hospitalis Sancte Johannes Jerusalem locum tenens in prioratu\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (18\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -19\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 De resignationibus}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  De resignacionibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Resignacio ecclesie facta in manibus episcopi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  In nomine etc. Per hoc publicum instrumentum cunctis pateat ... In mei notarii et testium infrascriptorum presencia personaliter constitutus discretus vir ... capellanus in ecclesia .... gratis et sponte\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  resignauit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Resignacio canonicatus et prebende ecclesie in manibus cardinalis auctoritate appostolica\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  In nomine etc. Vt supra in proximo. Constitutus apud sedem apostolicam coram reuerendissimo in Christo patre ac domino domino A. dei gracia A. tituli sancti presbytero cardinalis T. O. decanus ecclesie Pragensis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (Prag)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   sponte libere et simpliciter absque omni dolo resignauit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (18\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Resignacio ecclesie libere facta\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  In nomine etc. Reuerendissimi .... episcopi et mei notarii publici et testium subscriptorum T. rector ecclesie ... diocesis ... personaliter constitutus considerans\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (19\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 De inuentacione in bonis ecclesie facienda}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Robertus miseracione diuina ... episcopus ... dilecto salutem in domino et debitam diligentiam in comissione. Relacione plurimorum ... didicimus, quod Bon\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  on\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ie rector\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (Bologna) ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  est viam vniuerse carnis ingressus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Dominicus Dominici, Summa dictaminis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; Ed.: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Rockinger\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Briefsteller, S. 553, Nr. 45). >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  De comendacione ecclesie vacantis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Ludovicus etc. Cum ecclesia ... vacet ... et expediat, quod inter bona jura omnia et ornamenta ipsius ecclesie non pereant \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ... (vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Dominicus Dominici, Summa dictaminis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Ed.: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Rockinger\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Briefsteller, S. 555, Nr. 50). (19\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  De acceptacione beneficii\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  In nomine etc. Per hoc etc. Personaliter constitutus C. dixit et asseruit, quod cum ipse a prefato domino nostro papa in gracia spirituali gracias optinuerit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Instrumentum acceptacionis beneficii forma cuiusmodi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  In nomine etc. Personaliter constitutus C. diocesis exspectans auctoritate apostolica, vt dicebat, ad prebendam in ecclesia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \endash ... (19\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  de eo facere prouideri. Super quibus etc.}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  >{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 De presentacionibus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  <. >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Potestas conferendi beneficium vel presentandi ad illud\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  In nomine etc. Venerabilis vir vel reuerendus pater considerans et attendens grata et accepta seruicia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Sanctissimo in Christo patri ac domino domino G. ... s\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  alutem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . V\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  enerabiles\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   filii decanatus et vniuersitatis vestre ... Inter solitudines nostre curas pie pacis et diuine\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (20\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  totis mentibus afferramus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Item presentacio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Reuerendo in Christo patri ac domino domino P. etc. vel eius vicario in spiritualibus A. ... vtriusque juris professor obedienciam, reuerenciam et honorem. Ad vestre paternitatis boniuolenciam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (!),\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   dileccionem \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ... (20\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Presentacio ad ordines super prouisione\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Cum Christus sit bonorum omnium fundamentum ac salutis tocius incrementum ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Presentacio per patronum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Reuerendo in Christo .... humilis abbas monasterii ... salutem et humilitatem bonorum. Cum parrochialis ecclesia sancti ... ad nostram presentacionem pertinens\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Instrumentum concessionis et quasi presentacionis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  In nomine etc. Constitutus discretus vir etc. vel venerabilis vir pater dominus abbas monasterii asserens parrochialem ecclesiam ... cuius jus patronatus ad eundem abbatem dicitur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ... \endash ... (20\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  si quis fuerit semper saluo. De quibus etc.}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (20\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -20\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 De commissionibus conferendis}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  De comissione conferenda\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  <. >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Comissis per episcopum vicarijs ut conferant primum beneficium in sua collacione vacaturis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Oudarducus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (Oudardus?)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   miseracione diuina episcopus discretis viris magistris ... Attendentes grata et accepta obsequia \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ... (20\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Comissio vicariis quod conferant beneficium vacans ad collacionem episcopi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  <\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   O. dei gracia etc. Cum de vestra circumspeccione confisi vos et vestrum quemlibet in spiritualibus nostros vicarios generalis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...-...\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   plenam vobis auctoritate presencium concedimus facultatem. In cuius}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (20\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -24\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 De collationibus}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  De collacionibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  <. >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Collacio ordinarij facta presentate\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (!)< \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Lvdouicus etc. dilecto nostro ... clerico salutem in domino ... Merita probitatis, quibus personam tuam fide dignorum testimonio iuuari percipimus, nos inducunt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (21\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Littera facta de canonicatu et camerariatu ecclesie cum permutacione de ecclesiis quas tenebat per modum processus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Lvdouicus etc. discreto viro .... etc. G. canonico et camerario ecclesie ... salutem in domino. Litteras sanctissimi in Christo etc. eius vera bulla etc. recepimus in hac forma\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Vrbanus etc.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (Urban V.?).\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   Cuius \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (?) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  itaque receptis a nobis litteris apostolicis infrascriptis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (21\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Collacio beneficij vacantis causa permutacionis auctoritate apostolica facta\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Lvdouicus etc. discreto viro G. canonico ecclesie ... diocesis salutem in domino\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Sanctissimi patris etc. litteras eius vera bulla etc. recepimus in hac forma innotatas etc. Cum ergo receptis a nobis litteris apostolicis supra dictis R. rector ecclesie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (24\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Forma collacionis ecclesie vacantis per liberam resignacionem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Robertus etc. probitatis vt supra in collacione ecclesie facta familiari presenti. Cum igitur vicaria seu capellania perpetua parrochialis ecclesie ... per liberam resignacionem O. nuper obtinentis eandem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (24\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Item alia prouerbia apponenda in principio vbi ponitur merita probitatis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Salus et vite decor et alia virtutum merita\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Super eodem causa permutacionis quando est alterius diocesis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  R. miseracione diuina etc. salutem in domino. Parrochialem ecclesiam ... nostre diocesis pertinentem vacantem ad presens per liberam resignacionem \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ...-... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  officiis fideliter exequamini vt superius est premissum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Weitere erw\u228 \'e4hnte Personen: (24\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  papa Sextus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (vielleicht Clemens VI. oder Urban VI.?).
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (24\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -25\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 De receptionibus}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  De recepcionibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  <. >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Recepcio vnius canonici per capitulum nominati per regem auctoritate apostolica\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  In nomine etc. Venerabiles et discreti viri domini J. decanus ecclesie ... diocesis ... et ... canonici dicte ecclesie capitulum faciendum et more solito ad campane sonum in choro ipsius ecclesie congregati\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (24\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Recepcio vnius canonici per capitulum auctoritate gracie facte per cardinalem auctoritate apostolica\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  In nomine etc. Personaliter constitutus discretus vir canonicus ecclesie ... cardinalis venerabili et discreto viro decano et canonico ecclesie ipsius ecclesie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (!)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   capitulum faciendum et presentibus ad sonum campane more solito congregatis exhibuit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (25\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Instrumentum quomodo episcopus reciperit aliquem in canonicam admonicionem executorem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  In nomine etc. Reuerendus pater etc. Visis et bibi \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  presentatis litteris apostolicis concessis venerabili viro ... nepoti cardinalis super gracia sibi facta de canonicatu ecclesie ... sub expectacione prebende\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Super eodem per papam et canonicos auctoritate pape\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  In nomine ... Discretus vir canonicus ecclesie ... presentauit et dedit ex parte sanctissimi patris et domini nostri etc. venerabilibus et discretis viris .... preposito decano et capitulo ac canonicis ecclesie quasdam litteras apostolicas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (25\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Super eodem per conuentum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  In nomine\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Visis litteris apostolicis sanctissimi patris etc. Super prouisione facienda seu gracia facta\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Super eodem per capitulum alio modo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  In nomine etc. Venerabiles viri .... et ... ac ... canonici ecclesie ... visis litteris apostolicis super gracia seu prouisione facta discreto viro\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...-... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  et statutis ecclesie supradicte\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (25\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -25\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 De institutionibus}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  De institucionibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Instrumentum quomodo episcopus instituit clericum in ecclesia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  <\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   R. miseracione diuina episcopus ... etc. Pietatis opus esse dinoscitur deo seruire volentibus milicia clericali \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ...-... (25\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  exhibere debitam porcionem contradictoribus et rebellis auctoritate nostra per censuram ecclesiasticam composcendo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (!)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . In quorum etc.}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (25\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -27\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 De provisione}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  De prouisione\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Instrumentum prouisionis per birretum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  <\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   In nomine etc. Personaliter constitutus ... coram venerabili viro domino ... executore ad hoc specialiter deputato asserens se prebendam ecclesie ... nuper per mortem ... qui extra Romanam curiam obijt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (vgl. Krakau BJ, Cod. 326, 91\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ). >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Instrumentum presentacionis litterarum subexecutoris et corporalis possessionis et prouisionis facte de ecclesia vacante\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < (25\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   In nomine ... Constitutus ... coram venerabili et discreto viro C. canonico ecclesie sub execucione A. venerabilis et discretus vir O. domino executori et suis collegis a sede apostolica ad infrascripta constitutus ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (26\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Si vero inuenisset ecclesiam clausam et non potuisset intrasse ad dandum possessionem fiat instrumentum presentacionis et prouisionis sic\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  <\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   In nomine ... vt supra in proximum vsque reuerenter receptus iidem subexecutor et procurator exeuntes fortiter ante fores dicte ecclesie in mei notarii publici et testium subscriptorum presencia ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (27\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Instrumentum quando nunccius refert se presentasse litteras\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  <\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   In nomine etc. Constitutus personaliter etc. Coram ... ad infrascripta deputato nuncius iuratus ... de mandato ipsius executoris retulit ... In nomine etc. Coram venerabili viro domino ... executore in huiusmodi causa seu negocio deputato comparuerunt ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (27\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  In nomine etc. Constitutus procurator coram venerabibli viro ... executore in huiusmodi causa a sede apostolica dixit ... In nomine etc. Subexecutor ... dixit et proponit dicto episcopo et eum citauit \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ... (27\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Si vero parere voluerit fiat instrumentum sic\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  In nomine etc. Constitutus coram C. delegato vel subdelegato vel subdelegato \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   episcopus ... Auditis et presentatis litteris apostolicis ...-... in hijs scriptis promulgauit. Actum etc.}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (27\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -28\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 De possessione}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  De possessione\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  <. >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Instrumentum pro adipiscenda possessione ecclesie collate in personam absentem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  In nomine etc. Personaliter constitutus ... habens ad infrascriptam vt dicit partem et speciale mandatum a reuerendo in Christo patre domino episcopo super infrascriptis sibi factum. Exiens personaliter ante fores dicte ecclesie ...-... recepisse possessionem omnium aliarum possessionum jurisque et pertinentes ecclesie supra dicte. De quibus etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (28\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -56\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 De processibus}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  De processibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Processus in forma pauperum ad collacionem episcopi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Reuerendo in Christo patri ac domino \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ... (28\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  salutem in domino et mandatis nostris ymo verius firmiter obedire. Litteras sanctissimi patris etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  cum cordula canapis vera bulla plumbea ... quorum tenor sequitur in hec verba\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Vrbanus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (Urban V.?)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   etc. Post quorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  quidem litterarum apostolicarum presentacionem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (29\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Processus in forma pauperum ad collacionem archidiaconi vel prepositi vel prioris aut canonici\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Robertus miseracione diuina ... episcopus ... salutem in domino et et mandatis nostris ymo verius apostolicis firmiter obedire. Noueritis nos litteras sanctissimi domini etc. ... recepisse nouiter in hec verba\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 :\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   Vrbanus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (Urban V.?)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   episcopus etc. Vsque ad finem. Quarum quidem litterarum apostolicarum presentacionem et recepcionem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (29\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Processus in forma pauperum ad collacionem abbatis et conuentus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Robertus  etc. vt supra ... Venerabilibus et religiosis viris abbati et conuentui\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Episcopus executor prefatos volentes mandatum apostolicum nobis in hac parte directum reuerenter exequi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (55\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Processus super amplificacione gracie quo ad taxacionem ad collacionem episcopi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Reuerendo in Christo patri ac domino \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ... (56\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   salutem etc. Cum dudum sanctissimi patris etc. Venerabili et discreto viro ... graciam voluerit facere speciale beneficium ecclesiasticum ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (56\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Processus excommunicati a jure qui legatus celebrabit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Uniuersis etc. vt supra vsque debite demandare. Confessionem quia quam prefatus ... coram nobis humiliter vsque reseruauit. Audimus diligenter\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (56\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Processus officii tabellionatus auctoritate imperiali pronominato in comissionem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  In nomine etc. Nouerint vniuersi ... quod coram venerabili viro ... in mei notarii publici et testium subscriptorum presencia personaliter constitutus discretus vir ... exhibuit et presentauit quosdam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  litteras apostolicas ...-... de predicto tabellionatus officio eidem ... vt premittitur inconcesso ... Super quibus omnibus et singulis prefatus dominus ... voluit vnum vel plura eidem ... fieri publicum instrumentum seu publica instrumenta eiusdem tenoris et sui sigilli ad maiorem roboris firmitatem. Datum et actum etc.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Weitere Personennamen: (30\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , 52\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Urban V. und (33\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , 44\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , 56\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Urban (V.?); (31\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   Coso de Dure sacrista ecclesie Auinionensis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   und (31\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Boso de Turre sacrista\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (wohl identisch; Boso de Turre, sacrista unter Urban V., vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Laurent\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , a.a.O., Bd. 10, S. 159 s.v. Boso de Turre).- Weitere Ortsnamen: (31\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Avignon, (31\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Rouen, Paris, (45\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Toulouse.}

