\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (56\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -57\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Instrumenta ad creandum notarios}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Instrumentum quomodo comissio ad creandum plures notarios creat vnum ex illis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Arnoldus etc. Dilecto nobis in Christo ... diocesis ... salutem in domino. Peruenit ex tue probitatis meritis tueque deuocionis obsequio sedulitas nos inducit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (56\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Item super eodem in alia forma\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  A. miseracione diuina etc. dilecto ... clerico ... salutem in domino sempiternam. Litteras sanctissimi patris etc. vt supra in primo processu primo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Instrumentum concessionis ad creandum auctoritate imperiali VI notarios nominandos per ipsum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Venerabili etc. Nicolaus etc. dei gracia comes Palatinus pacem gaudium salutem ac debitam diligenciam in comissione. Sagax\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (57\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  humane nature discrecio memorie hominum labilitate pensata\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (vgl. Krakau BJ, Cod. 461, 137\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ). (57\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Instrumentum notarij auctoritate imperiali sub sigillo pro presente\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Uniuersis presens priuilegium seu presens publicum instrumentum inspecturis Nicolaus etc. ... Clericus in nostra presencia personaliter constitutus nobis humiliter supplicauit, vt sibi tabellionatus officium concedere dignaremur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (57\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Super eodem pro absente\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Venerabili etc. vt in penultimo vsque \u8218 \'82cum itaque ex parte discreti viri\rquote ... diocesis ... humiliter supplicauit, vt alicui discreto viro committere dignaremur, qui posset ...-...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (57\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   que tunc in vestris manibus tenebit ac per pascis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   osculum inuestiatis de officio antedicto. Dantur et concedentur vt supra}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (57\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -58\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 De litteris testimonialibus}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  De litteris testimonialibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  <. >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Littera testimonialis pro scolari in canone\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Venerabilibus et discretis viris dominis ... salutem in eo, qui est sciencie munificus dispensator. Cum nos condiciones et merita personarum in nostro prefato studio conuersancium oculis debite justicie intueamur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Littera testimonialis de vita et moribus per auditorem camere\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < (58\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Reuerendo in Christo etc. Jo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  hannes\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   prepositus ecclesie ... camere domini nostri pape generalis auditor\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (s.o. 8\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   salutem in domino. Pridem pauper clericus a diocese ... in nostra presencia constitutus nobis exposuitque ipse a sanctissimo patre domino Vrbano diuina providencia papa V.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (Urban V.) ... (58\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Littera testimonialis quot sit gracia invtilis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Uniuersis presentes litteras respecturis nos ... officialibus ... facimus esse notum, quod facta et habita per nos inquisicione diligenti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (58\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Littera testimonialis pro cessu alicuius in vita}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Uniuersis presentes litteras inspecturis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  salutem in domino sempiternam. Notum facimus ... quod T. ... diocesis ... lator presencium est vir bone fame\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Littera testimonialis pro recessu famuli\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Reuerendo in Christo ... salutem cum debita reuerencia et honore. Reuerendo p\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  atri\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   V. tenore presencium facimus manifestum, quod ... diocesis est de legitimo matrimonio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Super eodem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Salutem in actoris salutem ad instantem supplicacionem ... clerici ... diocesis ... cui sanctissimus dominus nostri \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   summus pontifex prouideri mandauit de beneficio ecclesiastico cum cura vel sine cura ad collacionem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (58\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Super eodem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Reuerendo in Christo patri ... executori seu prouisori ...  salutem ... Per virtutes et misericordie opera eterna gaudia promereri\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...-... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ad execucionem predictam procedere dignemini graciose iuxta traditam apostolicam nobis formam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Weiterer Ortsname: (58\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Avignon (Ausstellungsort).
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (58\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -60\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 De ordinibus}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  De ordinibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  <. >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Licencia recipiendi tonsuram in diocese propria per alienum episcopum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Reuerendo in Christo ... salutem in domino. Cum T. primam clericalem tonsuram habere cupiens sitque \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   agregari milicie clericali\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (59\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Licencia recipiendi tonsuram et omnes ordines a quocumque\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  N. miseracione diuina episcopus ... salutem in domino. Vt a quocumque antistice graciam et communionem apostolice sedis habente\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Super eodem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Ut a quocumque malueris antistite catholico graciam et communionem sedis apostolice habente sacrum diaconatus possidere statutum ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (59\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Littera acoliti extra curiam Romanam secundum vsum ecclesie Constanciensis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (Konstanz)< \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Noueritis vniuersi quod nos L. dei gracia episcopus ... anno ... die ... dilectum nobis in Christo T. clericum ad acolitatus et ceteros Minorum ordinis fauente domino duximus promouendum. Datum etc.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (59\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Littera presbyteri\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Noueritis vniuersi quod nos R. miseracione diuina episcopus ... discretum virum T. dyaconum ad titulum sue cappellanie sanctorum ... in ecclesia nostra ... fundate ad ordinem ... duximus promouendum. Datum etc.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Littera aperta in papiro quando vnus cardinalis vel camerarius pape presentat aliquem promouendum cardinali vel episcopo ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Reuerende pater dilectum nobis in Christo T. vel dilectum clericum nostrum ... et familiarem nostrum latorem presencium acolitum vel subdiaconum aut diaconum in ecclesia ... perpetuum capellanarium .... duximus presentandum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Quomodo episcopus excusat aliquem ab ordine recipiendo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < (60\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  A. miseracione diuina episcopus .... dilecto .... salutem in domino. Quia significastis nobis quod vigente quadam ineuitabili necessitate ...-... vos excusandum merito tenore presencium declaramus ac eciam nunciamus. Insuper etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . (vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Dominicus Dominici, Summa dictaminis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; Ed.: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Rockinger\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Briefsteller, S. 552f., Nr. 44)}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (60\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -61\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 De licentiis}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  De licenciis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Licencia de non recipiendo ordinem et non residendo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Z. miseracione diuina episcopus ... O. rectori ecclesie ... salutem in domino. Vt adhuc vsque ad ... in dicta vestra ecclesia residenciam personalem nec personaliter interesse minime tenamus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ... (60\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Item de non recipiendo ordines\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  M. ... ecclesie ... electus confirmatus nondum consecratus ... salutem in domino vt vsque ad septennium. Stando in studio vbi illud vigeat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Item de non recipiendo ordines\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Robertus etc. Beniuolencie spirituales effectus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (60\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Compulsoria rectoris pro residencia facienda\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  A. et Theo. rectori ecclesie ... nostre diocesis salutem etc. Quia dignum est et iustum, quod ecclesia a prelati seruicio minime defraudetur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Dominicus Dominici, Summa dictaminis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Ed.: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Rockinger\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Briefsteller, S. 562f., Nr. 68). >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Item super eodem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < (61\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Arnoldus etc. Cum de grege vobis comisso in extremo die judicij vos oportet reddere racionem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Dominicus Dominici, Summa dictaminis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Ed.: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Rockinger\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Briefsteller, S. 580f., Nr. 96). (61\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Compulsio rectoris ad residendum in beneficio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  <\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   A. etc. prudenti viro et nobis in Christo dilecto salutem \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ...\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   Recordari debet prudencia vestra, quod P. vos iam diu et sine nostri licencia fuistis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (!)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   absens\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...-... (61\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  et tenebitur personaliter deseruire. Datum etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (61\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -62\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 De familiaritate}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  De familaritate\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Qualiter cardinalis recipit aliquem in cappellanum suum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Guillelmus ... cappellano nostro ... salutem in domino. Caritatis magne dileccionis affectus, quam ad personam deducimus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (61\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Super eodem pro nobili\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Illos libenter ad noticiam familiaritatis admittimus quos \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  sciencie desiderabilis splendor illuminat ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (61\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Super eodem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Meritis tue probitatis inducimur, vt personam tuam prerogatiua spiritualis gracie prosequenda oportunis anuamus fauoribus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (vgl. Krakau BJ, Cod. 461, 131\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ). >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Super eodem pro clerico\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < (62\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Probitatis et virtutum obsequio sancta deuocione inducti, qua nobis hactenus placuisti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Super eodem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Desideramus viros nostris aggregare consiliis, qui circa latus nostrum vite sancte\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  resplendeant\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Super eodem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Fulgent in nobis virtutum dotes eximie, per quas confidenter allicimur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...-... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  confidere de vobis in posterum amplius decutamur \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!).}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (62\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -62\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 De conductibus}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  De conductibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Littera conductus pro rebus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Uniuersis pedagiariis, ballinis, castellanis ceterisque justiciarijs Rene\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (Renne?)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , Rediverencie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (Reviers?)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   vel Gabelle\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (Cintegabelle?),\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   receptoribus et portuum et passuum quorumcumque per terram et aquam ... Arnoldus permissione diuina .... archiepiscopus ... domini pape camerarius salutem in domino. Cum reuerendissimus in Christo pater et dominus P. Cardinalis IIII\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 c\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   Mutones \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (?)  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  apud Romam, vbi Romana curia residere pro suo et hospicij sui vsu ...-... Datum Viterbii\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (Viterbo)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   sub sigillo camerariatus nostri die etc.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Weiterer Ortsname: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Lende\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   = der Flu\u223 \'df L\rquote Ande (?) in Frankreich. >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Conductus personarum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Universis presentes litteras inspecturis A. miseracione diuina etc. salutem in domino. Cum nos dilectos nostros familiares ... et ... principum portitores pro quibusdam certis negocijs ... transmittimus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  .... (62\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Conductus camerarij pro personis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Universis archiepiscopis episcopis ... G. miseracione diuina episcopus Laudunensis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (Laon)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   domini nostri pape camerarius salutem in domino sempiternam. Cum dilectus noster C. clericus  diocesis ... de Auinonensi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (Avignon)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   recedens ad partes vestras\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...-... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  et quod nostras huiusmodi litteras sibi sentiat fructuosas. In quorum omnium testimonium presentes litteras fieri fecimus et sigilli cameraris nostri appensione ... Datum etc.}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (62\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -63\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 De fundatione cappellaniae}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  De fundacione cappellanie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Tenor institucione \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   cappellanie de nouo fundate talis est< Deus omnipotens misericors ideo, qui justiciam et equitatem in temporalibus diligit humanam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (63\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Tenor confirmacionis episcopi ecclesiali\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (!)<\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   Quapropter ego G. dei gracia episcopus et canonicus sancti Petri conuentus vnanimiter per nos omnes successores nostros grates non modicas deo omnipotenti reseruentes\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (63\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Tenor confirmacionis domini pape\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  In nostris etc. Cum a uobis petitur, quid iustum est et honestum, tam vigor equitatis quam ordo exigit racionis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...-... (63\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ei ausu temerario contraire. Si quis etc.}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

