\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (63\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 De consecratione ecclesiae}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  De consecracione ecclesie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Littera super consecracione ecclesie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Uniuersis presentes litteras inspecturis ... salutem in domino. Noueritis quod dispensante domino ecclesiam vestre diocesis ad honorem dei et gloriose virginis Marie ...-... et ipsas januis ipsius ecclesie duximus affigendas. Datum.}

