\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (63\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -64\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 De comissione reconciliationis ecclesiae}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  De comissione reconciliacionis ecclesie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  <. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Comissio reconciliacionis ecclesie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Thomas dei gracia episcopus ... salutem in domino. Tenore presencium vobis committimus et mandamus, quot comiterium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (!)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   ecclesie vestre predicte propter effusionem sanguinis et violenciam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (erw\u228 \'e4hnt: Papst Gregor VIII.). (64\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Vel sic\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Thomas etc. Cum ecclesia vestra seu cimiterium ecclesie vestre propter violenciam et effusionem sanguinis nuper in eo per talem in personam comissam polutam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...-... (64\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  propter effusionem seminis vel sepulturam excommunicati\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (64\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 De anniversario dedicationis ecclesiae}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  De anniuersario dedicacionis ecclesie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Uniuersis ... salutem in domino. Splendor paterne glorie, qui sua mundum illuminat ineffabile claritate ...-... XL dies de iniunctis siue\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (!; statt sibi)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   pena misericorditer relaxamus etc.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Dominicus Dominici, Summa dictaminis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Ed.: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Rockinger\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Briefsteller, S. 564f., Nr. 72; vgl. auch Krakau BJ, Cod. 461, 148\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ).}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (64\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -65\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 De indulgentiis}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  De indulgenciis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Littera\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (durchgestrichen; Anfang wie 64\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va/b\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   und 64\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (64\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Indulgencia pro paupere\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Uniuersis ... salutem in domino. I. presbyter nostre diocesis lator presencium, quem animosa grauitas exercicio agriculture dedit in heredem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Confirmacio episcopi super indulgencia per alienum concessa\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Uniuersis etc. Cum reuerendus in Christo pater dominus archiepiscopus omnibus vere penitentibus et confessis, qui ad ecclesiam sancti ... tam deuocionis excedent\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Absolucio in articulo mortis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Hugo miseracione diuina episcopus ... salutem in domino. Solet anuere fides apostolica \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Sanctissimus pater dominus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (64\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Vrbanus papa quintus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (Urban V.) ... (Wortlaut der Adressierung wie durchgestrichener Abschnitt 64\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ). >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  De indulgenciijs\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Littera inqueste pro subsidio pauperis ecclesie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Uniuersis prioribus, rectoribus, cappellanis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (Wortlaut der Adressierung wieder wie durchgestrichener Abschnitt 64\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Quoniam vt ait apostolus omnis stabimus ante tribunal\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (zum gro\u223 \'dfen Teil \u252 \'fcbereinstimmend mit \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Dominicus Dominici, Summa dictaminis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Ed. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Rockinger\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Briefsteller, S. 546f., Nr. 31). (65\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  De indulgencia pro monasterio monialium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Deum credimus habere propicium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Indulgencia pro ecclesia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Virga venustissima et omnium virtutum floribus insignita virgo dei genetrix gloriosa\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...-... (65\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  dictam ecclesiam deuote visitauerint, XL dies deminucionis penitenciis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (?) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  in domino ... relaxamus.}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (65\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 De approbatione testamenti}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  De approbacione testamenti. Approbacio testamenti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Uniuersis presentes litteras ... Facimus notum, quod testamentum, cui nostre presentes littere sunt annexe\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Littera super execucione testamenti facta\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Uniuersis presentes litteras inspecturis officialibus Constanciensibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (Konstanz)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   salutem in domino. Notum facimus, quod anno domini Millesimo CCCLXXIIII die XXV mensis Augusti \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (25. August 1374) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  T. et B., executores testamenti seu ultimi voluntatis C. defuncti Constanciensi, coram nobis personaliter constituti nobis fecerunt et reddiderunt verum computum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...-...\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   sub sigillo nostro tenore presencium significamus. Actum ut supra.}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (65\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -85\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Formularius iudicialis}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (65\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -66\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ){\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17  De citationibus}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (65\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Explicit formularius episcopalis. Incipit secunda pars noui formularii tres antiquos continentis. Formularius judicialis et primo de citacionibus. Citacio contra illum, qui non soluit debitum in termino\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Reuerendo in Christo patri ... {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Tenore presencium vos requirimus et per emptorem citamus}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , vt infra quinque dies a presentacione presencium vobis facta in mediate sequente dicatis ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (66\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Forma citacionis conquestus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  N. executor vnicus ... salutem in domino\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Noueritis nos litteras sanctissimi patris etc. non viciatas etc. in hec verba: Vrbanus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Urban V.?) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  etc. Quas si petieritis, precipimus exhiberi et ipsis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (66\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )>\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Forma excommunicacionis super mutuo contracto\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Reuerendus in Christo prioribus archiepiscopis episcopis ... A. canonicus judex ... executor ad infrascripta seu pro infrascripto debito vnacum venerabilibus viris ... et a sede apostolica deputatis etc. Dudum discretum virum a procuratori\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (!)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   reuerendissimi patris domini A. episcopi tunc electi Patauiensis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (vielleicht Albertus de Winkel, Bischof von Passau 1364-1380; Vakanz des Bischofstuhles vom 15. Sept. 1362 bis 29. Jan. 1364; vgl. Conrad \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Eubel\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : Hierarchia catholica medii aevi, Bd. 1, Monasterii 1898, S. 412) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ad infrascriptum legitime constitutum procuratorio nomine\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...-... (66\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  sumptibus et expensis fideliter intimetis. In cuius rei testimonium etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (67\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -69\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 De absolutionibus, de excommunicatione, de citatione}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Littera absolucionis pro illis, qui fuerunt in capcione vnius clerici\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Cum occasione capcionis L. clerici incarceracionis et detencionis eiusdem talis est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Item alia absolucionis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Salutem etc. Cum parrochianus vester ad instanciam excommunicacionis sentenciam incurrisse dicatur, mandamus vobis quot auctoritate nostra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Littera absolucionis super inieccione in clericum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Cum ... diocesis ... manus suas violentas in clericum citra et vsque sanguinis effusionem iniecisse dicatur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (67\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) ...\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   prepositus Auinionensis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (Avignon) ... 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (69\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Instrumentum absolucionis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Anno etc. S. coram tali judice personaliter constitutus presentauit eidem domino judici deposiciones\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Littera absolucionis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Talis judex tali presbytero salutem in domino. Cum ... parrochianus vester, quem suis meritis exigentibus ad mandatum nostrum excommunicatum denunciauistis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Absolucionis infame\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Quoniam hactenus plene nouimus tuam vitam ...-... et si qua irrogata fuerit eam ex officio nostro totaliter abolemus et de Re. jud. Cum pia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  //  (Abbruch?; Spalte b leer)...
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Ortsname: h\u228 \'e4ufig erw\u228 \'e4hnt wird Avignon (67\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -68\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; insgesamt 5x).}

