\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (70\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -76\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 De sponsalibus et matrimonio}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (70\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Littera pronunciacionis super dissolutione sponsalium propter peccatum sponsi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Vniuersis etc. Comparentibus in judicio coram nobis J. ex parte vna et Behata nomine ex altera proposuit predicta B. contra dominum Jo. coram nobis, quod ipse Jo. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ...
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (70\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Littera pronuncciacionis judicis super nullitate sponsalium propter consanguinitatem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Uniuersis etc. Notum facimus, quod in nostra presencia personaliter propter hoc constituti P. et B. filia condam etc. Dixerunt quod ipsi dudum ignorantes se forte aliqua consanguinitatis linea copulatus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (!) ... >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Super eodem propter affinitatem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Uniuersis etc. Coram nobis personaliter constituti G. ex vna parte et B. ex altera dicentes,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (70\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  quod licet Petronella quandam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  vxor dicti G., dum viuebat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   ... (71\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Littera pronuncciacionis judicis quod coniuges seperentur ... propter advlterium viri\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Uniuersis etc. Comparentibus in judicio coram nobis P. ex vna parte et G. eius uxor ex altera proposuit dicta G. actrix contra dictum P. ... reum, quod idem P. post matrimonium ... regnantibus sanctissimo in Christo patre et domino domino G. diuina prouidencia papa VI et C. dei gracia episcopo archiepiscopo ac illustrissimo principe domino domino Jo. Francorum rege\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (vielleicht: Papst Clemens VI., 1342-1352 und Johann II. (le Bon), 1350-1364?) ... (73\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Super eodem propter artitatem mulieris\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Universis etc. notum facimus quod comparentibus in judicio coram nobis Johannes ex parte vna et P. ex altera. Proponit dictus Johannes contra dictam P., quod licet ipse dum cum dicta P.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (vgl. Krakau BJ, Cod. 461, 157\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) (74\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Super eodem propter malificium seu impotenciam viri\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Uniuersis etc. Comparentibus in judicio coram nobis B. ex parte vna et G. ex altera proposuit dicta B. actrix contra dictum G., quod ipsa dudum anno cum dimido et amplius iam elapso \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ... (vgl. Krakau BJ, Cod. 461, 156\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ). (75\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Sentencia nullitatis matrimonii propter consanguinitatem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Uniuersis notum facimus quod comparentibus in judicio coram nobis promotore causarum officii curie nostre ex parte vna et P. et B. matrimonium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (!)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   coniuncti ex altera. Proponit promotor predictus nomine dicte curie et pro ipsa nos\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...-... (76\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  silencium perpetuum dictum promotori super premissis imponentes et expensis carentes et ex causa\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (!)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . In cuius etc.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (vgl. Krakau BJ, Cod. 461, 156\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (76\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -77\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 De expensis}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (76\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  De expensis judicis extra iudicialibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Expense, que fiunt in judicio ob continuam partem judicis officio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (!)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   vel non probatur de excepcione\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (76\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Expense vero que fiunt extra judicium peti debe\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  n\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  t nominatim in libello\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (77\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  De expensis que fiunt post litis contestacionem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Expense vero, que fiunt post litis conestacionem \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (?)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   veniunt judicibus officialibus ...-... habet legitimam causam absencie vt in predicta: properandum etc.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   }

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (77\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -83\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 De appellationibus}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (77\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  De appellationibus quando fit appellacio et infra quod tempus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Appellari potest statim quando quis grauatur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Qualiter appellacio fieri debeat et appellans fieri debeat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (!)< \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Siue appellatur a diffinitua sentencia siue ab interlocutoria\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Forma\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Cum me grauaueritis, eo quod talem meam excepcionem admittere recusatis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (81\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Appellandi reuerenciales ab interlocutoria vel grauamine\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Reuerendo in Christo etc. vt supra cui appellacioni. Junge\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 :\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   Ob vestram reuerenciam detuli reuerenter ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (82\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   >Vel sic< Reuerendo etc. vt supra ... Ideoque cum ob reuerenciam detuli ... >Appellacio< Sanctissimo vel reuerendissimo etc. vt supra vsque finem appellacionis. Subiunge\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 :\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Ego\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   vero licet de meo iure certus sim\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (bis hierher fast identisch mit Krakau BJ, Cod. 461, 151\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -156\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ). (82\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Intimacio appellacionis ... coram episcopo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  In nomine etc. Personaliter constitutus venerabilis vir dominus A. canonicus ... diocesis ... humiliter requisiuit dictum dominum episcopum iuxta formam et tenorem cuiusdam cedule papiree \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ...-... (83\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  vna cum dictis testibus presens fui.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Weitere Personennamen: (81\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Papst Gregor (XI.?).- Weitere Ortsnamen: (80a\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Toulouse. }

