\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (83\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -85\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 De protestationibus}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  De protestacionibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Protestacio ad ostium pape super appellacionibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  In nomine domini Amen. etc. Personaliter etc. In Romana curia procuratori ... vt de procuracione ipsa quodam publico instrumento manu notarii publici sub anno a nostro domino etc. indiccione etc. domini Vrbani pape V\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 ti\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Urban V.) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  anno quarto confecto et signato per me ... Auinionensi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (Avignon)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   videlicet ante portam palacij predicti petijt cum instancia A.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (83\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Item protestacio ad ostium domini pape super appellacionibus in alia forma etc.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < (83\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  In nomine ... Religiosus vir, frater monachus monasterii ... ordinis ... diocesis ... administrator infirmarius claustralis monasterii predicti constitutus personaliter ad ostium, per quod mittitur ad dominum nostrum papam, petijt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Item ante hostium domini pape ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < (84\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Constitutus ante hostium pape, per quod intratur per\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (!)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   dominum papam, petijt cum instacia G., ipsius domini pape ostiarium\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (85\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Protestacio ad bullam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  In nomine ... Infra ostium, in quo littere domini pape Auinionensi bullantur ... de manu magistri H. de Podio \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ... >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Protestacio ad bullam alio modo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  In nomine etc. Vt dicit in hospicio ... in quo littere domini pape bullantur et bullate redduntur recepit de manu ... ad litteras bullatas ibidem reddendum ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (85\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   >Protestacio coram examinatore litterarum iusticie< In nomine etc. Coram venerabili viro etc. examinatore litterarum iusticie in vicecancellaria pro reuerendissimo in Christo patre domino P. episcopo Penestrino\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (Praeneste)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   sancte Romane ecclesie cardinalis et vicecancellarii dixit et exposuit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...-... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  cui quidem protestacioni dictus examinator consentijt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Weitere Personennamen: (84\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Johannes de Angitura (Anglure).- Weitere Ortsnamen: (84\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Praeneste, (84\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , 84\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Avignon, (84\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Toul.}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (85\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -118\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Formularius de contractibus, de emptione et venditione}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (85\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -95\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 De emptione et venditione}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Formularius de contractibus ad empcionem et vendicionem. Instrumentum vendicionis stagnorum facte a marito vxoris et filio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Anno etc. Existente domino ciuitatis Auinionensis serenissio principe et\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (?)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   domino domino A. dei gracia Jerusalem Cecilie rege comiteque promotore ... et in presencia mei notarii et testium infrascriptorum P. mercator Auinionensis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (Avignon)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   et J. eius vxor\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...-... (87\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Datum Auinionensi \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Avignon) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ante sacrum palacium domini nostri pape Vrbani \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Urban) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  etc.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Instrumentum vendicionis castri cum libertatibus ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  In nomine ... Nobiles viri ... fratres filij ... spontanea voluntate vendiderunt cesserunt dederunt et tradiderunt jure proprio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (88\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Instrumentum vendicionis apothece\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  In nomine ... sponte recognouit et in veritate confessus fuit pro se et heredibus suis et successoribus vendidisse bene et legaliter omni dolo et fraude et metu \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (?)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   remotis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (94\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Notula personarum absencium jus habencium de et super rebus venditis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Dato de personis presentibus tempore contractus quem consentiunt et renunnciant\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (94\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Si promittat venditor ... que habet ratificare et approbare vendicionem vt puta pro fratre vel sorore sic scribes\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Insuper promisit dictus venditor eidem emptori pro se et suis heredibus ... se facturum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   ... >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Si persona qui tempore contractus absens fuerit postea consociat et renunciet ita scribes< Domina Mechelda vxor Anthonij lecto sibi in eius presencia dicto instrumento vendicionis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ...-... (95\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  secundum consuetudinem ciuitatis Bononiensis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (Bologna)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   occurrant sufficientur satis vt michi videtur. Sic notatum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Zus\u228 \'e4tzliche Personennamen: (90\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) Petrus de Sengnig (?).- Weitere Ortsnamen: (90\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  in parrochia sua sancte Agathe\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   }

