\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Deposicio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < (!) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Instrumentum depositi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  In nomine ... Sponte et ex certa sciencia confessus est \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ... (95\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Notula depositi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Restat nunc videre de deposito sed notandum est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Instrumentum depositi simplex\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Anthonius ciuis et mercator Bononiensis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (Bologna)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   precibus et gracia Conradi recepit seruandum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Instrumentum depositi pro vtilitate\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...< \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Anthonius fuit confessus ... se in depositum habuisse et recepisse \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ... (96\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Si vero fiat mencio de vtilitate depositarii ... parte seruatur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  <\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   Anthonius fuit confessus ... se habuisse et recepisse custodiendi seruandi causa\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...-... (96\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   obligauit omnia bona sua renunccians etc. vt supra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .}

