\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (96\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -98\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 De locato et conducto}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  De loco\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (!)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   et conducto. Instrumentum locacionis domus ad pensionem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Anthonius concessit et locauit Conrado ad pensionem domum suam vnam positam in tali contrata, cuius tales sunt confines\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (96\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Instrumentum benediccionis terre et superficie in ea facienda\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Johannes concessit et locauit ad pensionem Conrado pro se et suis heredibus recipiendi quoddam casamentum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (96\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Instrumentum locacionis equorum ad equitandum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Anthonius concessit dedit locauit Conrado ad decem dies \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ... 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (97\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Instrumentum conuencionis facte de aliqua \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!),\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   quod futurus sit discipulus in arte\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Anthonius promisit et pacto de Michaelem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  filium suum magistro Conrado et ad discendum et operandum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (97\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Instrumentum locacionis boum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Anthonius fuit confessus et contentus se habuisse et recepisse ad\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ad quartam partem lucri a Conrado duos boues\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (98\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Instrumentum locacionis vinee et terre date ad laborandum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Anthonius dedit et concessit ad laborandum Conrado per\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  se et suis heredibus vnam peciam terre aratorie vineate positam in villa Bagralee\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (?)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ... \endash ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  et secundum hec pacta merita inter partes\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .}

