\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  De feudis, censibus et pensionibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Instrumentum concessionibus in feudum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Dominus Aczo Hostiensis et Anthonius Ma. ob remuneracionem exequiorum fidei multorum et amorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (101\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Instrumentum concessionis ... propter debita\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  In nomine ... Reuerendus pater L., dei gracia Lugdunensis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Lion) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ecclesie archiepiscopus asserens se cogitasse maximam suam vtilitatem ecclesie sue \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ... (102\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Instrumentum domus concesse ad firmam ... pensionem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  In nomine ... vsque peronaliter constitutus. Locauit dedit et concessit ad pensionem T., domum suam, quam habet \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ... >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Instrumentum concessionis ad affictum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Anthonius concessit Conrado pro se et suis heredibus recipienti ad vtendum et fruendum pro certo affictu ... peciam vnam terre vineate \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ... \endash ... (102\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   pacta et conuenciones, que agantur inter partes ... congruentibus negocio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .}

