\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  De emphiteose\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  <. >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Instrumentum concessionis et in emphiteosim facte Auinionensi \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Avignon)< \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Quoniam monasterium sancti Stephani Bononie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (Bologna)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , quod dicitur Jerusalem, domino Jacobo CC libras debito\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (!)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   et tenebatur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  103\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ) \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Instrumentum reuocacionis concessionis emphiteoce\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Quoniam domus quedam sita in parrochia sancte Agathe \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (s.o. 90\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  infra tales confines etc. olim concessa et data a monasterio sancti Stephani Bononie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (Bologna)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , quod dicitur Jerusalem, in emphitoteosim\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  cum condicione anime pensionis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (103\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Item instrumentum solucionis pensionis rei emphiotice pro multis annis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Quoniam Conradus quondam Ticij nomine pensionis eiusdem domus emphiotica sita in contrata Techense\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (?) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  infra tales confines etc.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (103\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Instrumentum vendicionis ad perpetuam de dyacesano \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!)< \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Quoniam ecclesie sancte Marie parte Biuenati\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (?)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   quasdam domus habebat iuxta se positas, que ruinam et precipitum minabantur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...-... (104\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  obligare omnia bona sue ecclesie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .}

