\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  De rerum permutacione\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Instrumentum permutacionis facte ab ecclesia de re emphiotica\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Quoniam monasterium sancti Petri, quondam dicti Jerusalem, infrascripta permutacio \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (!)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   ad utilitatem credit multiplicem et profectum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ... (104\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Instrumentum rei permutate et partim vendite\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  <\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   Anthonius dedit tractauit permutauit et vendidit pro parte videlicet permutacionis et pro parte juris proprie in perpetuum vendens Conrado pro se et suis heredibus ... peciam vnam terre\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...-... (104\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  et quia eciam magis ornate procedit tibi series instrumenti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .}

