\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  141\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  -187\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Baldus de Ubaldis: Conclusiones extractae ex Innocentii papae IV apparatu super quinque libris Decretalium}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Incipiunt conclusiones Innocentii secundum Baldum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  De summa trinitate et fide katholica\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (X 1.1)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 [E]tiam inferiores prelati possunt dispensare}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . Cum illiteratis. c. primo. Innocentius. ... De constitucionibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (X 1.2)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Constitucio non ligat eum, qui dilucide suam probat ignoranciam}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... -... (186\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) (am Rande: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  De excessibus prelatorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   = X 5.31). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Excommunicacio non fertur, nisi pro contumacia ... Nimis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (X 5.31.16)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . An liceat monachis et fratribus sibi eligere sepulturam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ... (187\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  non desiderat libellum ut notatur ff. de ... accioni in rescripta per glosam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .- Endet in X 5.31.16.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
