\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Direkt anschlie\u223 \'dfend folgt: (201\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  De natura anime\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (am Rande)< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Quia de anima cepimus de ea aliquantum (!) perducatur racio}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ... animam nonnulli esse quandam diuine essencie porcionem. De IIII\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 or\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   enim elementis aiunt et diuino spiritu \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ... (202\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Inde anime lunarem circulum alie solarem pro modo perfeccionis tenere dicuntur}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 : Hinc et Palimirus et Dido, qui nondum peruenerant ad locum purgacionis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ...-... (204\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  quia trium illarum animi naturalium potenciarum efficacias pretermittere non debuimus, ordo est deinceps ad aliorum trium effectus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (!)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   virtutes transire\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Amen solamen sit sanctus spiritus amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  <.-Vom Schreiber der Randglossen: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Credo quod sit defectus sicud eciam fuit in exemplari\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .}

