4\chcbpat17 Secundum beatus}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17  [}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Bern}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17  ausgestrichen] }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Augustinus confitens}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17  }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 peccatum suum}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   cum Christo dicebat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \endash  (229\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  plena modo incipiamus hystoriam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  passionis et pacienter audiatis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Narrat beatus Iohannes quod tali die sicut hodie sunt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (!) \u8230 \'85  \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  vsque ad 3\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 m\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   diem quam Christus resurrexit de\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  morte ad vitam ad quam nos ducere dignetur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85; abgesetzt: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Explicit sermo de passione domini domini Conradi Walthuseri quondam predicatoris in Praga\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; Rest der Spalte und 251\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   leer. 
