\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 (6\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) Prolog (?): {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 O vos qui sub tristo mundo certatis in isto / discite uirtutum conflictus ac viciorum}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  / Quis mihi laude  pari uel honore sociari / flos feni\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (?) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 vermis  puluis cinis vnde superbis / \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  In se quisque probet cui nam victoria constet\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 .-  (6\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) Spruch: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Salomon\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (?) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 quodcumque potest manus tua facere instanter operare quia nec opus nec ratio nec scrientia nec sapientia erit apud inferos quo tu properas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (10\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -68\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) De disciplina scolarium: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Vestra nouit intentio de scolarium disciplina compendiosum postulare tractatum}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85 \endash  (67\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 salua fiant indicia / vltima vero alterius saporis inquinamenta pemanebunt.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (68\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Explicit liber venerabilis magistri Bohecij de disciplina scolarium vna cum aliquali declaratione finitus sub anno domini M\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  CCCCXXXII\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  in feria quinta post festum natiuitatis Marie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \endash  (6\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -68\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) Kommentar: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Non sit autem discipulus supra magistrum: Perfectus enim omnis erit si sit sicut magister eius}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . Scribitur Luce sexto capitulo. Kathedram habet in celis qui hominum corda docet \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  laudes habeat venerabilis virgo Maria mater Jhesu in secula seculorum. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 .- Am Schlu\u223 \'df einige Notae angef\u252 \'fcgt: De peccatis per gulam; de poenis inferni (Schema); Legende des hl. Bernhard, wonach er f\u252 \'fcnf M\u246 \'f6nche fragte, wer sich f\u252 \'fcr besser h\u228 \'e4lt als die anderen. \endash  68\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 -69\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Edition und Druck (ohne Kommentar): Pseudo-Bo\u232 \'e8ce: De disciplina scolarium. Ed. crit., introduct. et notes par O. Weijers. Leiden, K\u246 \'f6ln 1976 (Studien und Texte zur Geistesgeschichte des Mittelalters 12), S. 93-134; PL 64, Sp. 1223 D-1238 D. \endash  Vgl. P. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20\cf1 Lehmann\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\cf1 , Pseudo-antike Literatur des Mittelalters. Leipzig 1927, S. 27 und 101 Anm. 152 (verzeichnet weitere Literatur)}

