\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Osculetur me (Ct 1,1). Prologus: Cogitanti mihi canticum promere laudis cuiusdam ad honorem virginis}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  amoroso \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ab osculo iocunde ait: Osculetur me\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \endash  (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) Text: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Primo Alexander lib. 20: Osculum idest duorum coniunctio}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . Dum nostram naturam sibi associat Sapientia que est verbum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ascendet super montem aromatum clementer oro pro me fratre Johannes Varadiensis de ordine sancti Augustini qui messuit mirram cum aromatibus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  filium tuum ascendisti sicut virgula fumi aromatibus mirre et turis. Amen. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  Explicit postilla super Canticum.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 
