\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 >De natiuitate virginis Marie< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Procedens tamquam sponsus de talamo suo (Ps 18,6) per te accessum}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  cum autem Christus apparuit uita vestra tunc vos apparebitis cum Christo in gloria ad quam nos perducat virgo Maria. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \endash  (33\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 De spiritu sancto<\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 [S]icut lux aurore oriente sole mane absque nububus rutilat. 2 Reg. 23 (4). Ista uerba congrue ad spiritus sancti commendationem sunt assumpta}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  hanc autem repletionem donet uobis in presenti per gratiam et in futuro per gloriam. Amen. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \endash  (34\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 va\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Probet se homo et sic de pane illo edat. I Cor 11 (28). Ceteri cibi sunt probandi}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  excepit illum gaudium in domo patris\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (?). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \endash  Etc. Letzter Sermo (37\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 vb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ): {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 [S]vscepit Israel puerum suum recordatus misericordie sue. (Lc 1,54). In uerbis istis beatissima virgo tria facit}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85 et bonis celestibus ad que nos perducat qui sine fine viuit et regnat. Amen. Deo gratias\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . \endash  38\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 rb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  leer.
