\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 >Elucidarius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 < Praefatio: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Sepius rogatus a condiscipulis quasdam questiunculas enodare}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  quartam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  [sc. columnam] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 figat magistrorum sollers subtilitas.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  Liber primus: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17\cf1 Gloriose magister rogo, ut adquisita mihi respondeas ad honorem dei et utilitatem ecclesie}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 . Magister: Equidem faciam quantum uires ipse deus dabit nec me labor ista grauabit. Discipulus: Dicitur quod nemo sciat quid sit deus et ualde absurdum uidetur adorare quod nescimus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 (163\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24\cf1 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 D\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 [iscipulus]: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Dic queso horum reproborum sacerdotum et\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  [in]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 fidelium quis erit finis et cruciatus? M\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 [agister]: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Ut legitur: Corrupti sunt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  et abhominabiles facti sunt in omnibus operibus suis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1  ut oues sic et pastores in inferno positi erunt. Mors depascet eos\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  (Ps 13,1; 48,15). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\cf1 Scriptori requiem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Die R\u228 \'e4nder um den Text (vor allem der untere sind teilweise dicht gef\u252 \'fcllt mit einem in winziger Schrift geschriebenen Kommentar; Bl. 154-157 und 159-162 unterer Rand abgeschnitten.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
